{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "nëw phone", "line": "Woah, woah, too many feds got my number, I went and bought a new phone, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Woah, woah, too many feds got my number, I went and bought a new phone, yeah"], "meaning": "It makes absolutely no sense for him to say “too many feds got my number”. He is saying too many “fans” have his number. Honestly, did you think the feds were blowing up his phone or something and now that he has a new phone the FBI isn’t texting him anymore?", "annotation_id": "30940382", "url": "https://genius.com/30940382", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
