{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "nëw phone", "line": "I’m loving her twat", "vault_lines": ["I can't admit when I'm falling in love but I'm loving her twat"], "meaning": "Twat has two meanings to highlight:\n\n1) A derogatory term for a person whose behaviour is considered to be extremely or intolerably ignorant, obnoxious, offensive or moronic.\n2) A vagina.\n\nIn this case yeat refers to the twat of one of his girls and how he is not in love with her but with her twat, being nothing more than a mere object of satisfaction.", "annotation_id": "24952772", "url": "https://genius.com/24952772", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
