{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Countup", "line": "Back in the day, I was broke (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["Back in the day, I was broke (Uh)"], "meaning": "Yeat suggests he was at a state of financial hardship or having little to no money. He suggests he lacked the funds to meet his financial obligations or had depleted his financial resources. Being “broke” suggests a temporary or ongoing lack of financial stability or the inability to afford basic necessities or desired goods and services.", "annotation_id": "28636634", "url": "https://genius.com/28636634", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
