{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Countup", "line": "Yeah, huh, we just count up, huh, we don’t pull up to parties, huh (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, huh, we just count up, huh, we don't pull up to parties, huh (Huh)"], "meaning": "With this lyric, yeat means that he would rather stay home, get money, and count the money than go get sucked up by the bitches.", "annotation_id": "27045836", "url": "https://genius.com/27045836", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
