{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "In the H", "vault_lines": ["I got thе racks in, I get the backend"], "meaning": "The H is another word for the city of Houston, Texas. Kankan is from Dallas so it wouldn’t be uncharacteristic of him to be there.", "annotation_id": "27271188", "url": "https://genius.com/27271188", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "I love cars with high speed I fell in love with Tris though", "vault_lines": ["I fell in love with Tris though"], "meaning": "Despite loving the feeling of high speed luxury vehicles, Kankan enjoys sipping Tris to feel slow\n\nAlong with Wock, Tris is one of the most common Promethazine-Codeine cough syrups used in lean, a drink that is sipped to get high off of.", "annotation_id": "27271162", "url": "https://genius.com/27271162", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "You can get split up You can get lit up Christmas tree, lil’ bitch, ha, Christmas tree, lil’ bitch", "vault_lines": ["You can get split up"], "meaning": "Yeat displays his clever wordplay – comparing a potential murder victim to a Christmas tree.\n\nGetting “split up” can refer to either being stabbed or shot and “lit up” refers to being shot by a firearm – a reference to the flash a gun makes when fired.\n\nYeat compares his intended target to a Christmas tree, as they get “split up” (chopped down) and lit up to celebrate the holidays.\n\nAdditionally – Yeat has a leaked song called “Christmas” where he raps about Christmas trees", "annotation_id": "27271120", "url": "https://genius.com/27271120", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "Muddy drink", "vault_lines": ["My nigga on muddy drink"], "meaning": "“Muddy drink” or “muddy cup” is a slang term for lean, a concoction that contains Promethazine and Codeine cough syrup, Sprite and jolly ranchers mixed in a styrofoam cup.\n\nOriginally from Houston, people sip lean in order to get high from the promethazine and codeine contained in the cough syrup.", "annotation_id": "27271085", "url": "https://genius.com/27271085", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "I got new Alexander McQueen", "vault_lines": ["I got new Alexander McQueen"], "meaning": "Alexander McQueen is a high-end fashion company known for producing very expensive clothing.\n\nGoonie is boasting about being able to afford such expensive clothing that is not owned by the majority of people.", "annotation_id": "27271073", "url": "https://genius.com/27271073", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
