{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "zaza", "line": "The Xans got me on go", "vault_lines": ["The Xans got me on go"], "meaning": "Xans is a annotation of Xanax, A prescription drug. If took at correct dosage Xanax can get rid of headaches and slight Temps. But when Took in higher dosages, Xanax can cause Slowed Vision, headaches, and a Feeling of euphoria. Goonie is stating that Xans keep him perked up and on the ‘Go’.", "annotation_id": "26353125", "url": "https://genius.com/26353125", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
