{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "try me", "line": "So much money it don’t make no sense", "vault_lines": ["Bands on these bands, so much money it don't make no sense"], "meaning": "It’s a way of bragging about how successful and wealthy the speaker is, beyond what most people could ever imagine. It highlights the speaker’s elevated status and abundance.", "annotation_id": "35416106", "url": "https://genius.com/35416106", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
