{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "try me", "line": "I’m high as shit drivin’", "vault_lines": ["'Cause driver gon' drive me around when I'm high, high as shit"], "meaning": "Yeat (and artists in similar genres) often uses this kind of line to paint a picture of chaotic luxury—being rich, high, and untouchable all at once.", "annotation_id": "35416070", "url": "https://genius.com/35416070", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
