{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "tonka freestyle", "line": "Tonka, Tonka, Tonka, Tonka (Skrrt, skrrt, Tonka) Tonka, Tonka, Tonka, Tonka (Skrrt, skrrt, Tonka) Tonka, Tonka, Tonka, Tonka (Skrrt, skrrt, Tonka, Tonka)", "vault_lines": ["Tonka, Tonka, Tonka, Tonka (Skrrt, skrrt, Tonka)"], "meaning": "Yeat is known to call any car of his one of his “Tonkas”, as he majorly delves into supercars such as Jeep Trackhawks, Dodge Hellcats, Maybachs, Bentley cars, Lamborghini, and Rolls Royce cars.\n\nIn these three lines, Yeat continuously says the word Tonka and includes “Skrrt” adlibs in order to mimic a supercar engine driving off, after a line insisting he wants a “big ol' truck outside”, possibly of one of his houses or places of residence.\n\nRegardless of whether this is his first song regarding the word “Tonka”, the usage of the self-made word shows his love for supercars even before the word Tonka had been popularized.", "annotation_id": "30116221", "url": "https://genius.com/30116221", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "tonka freestyle", "line": "I don’t even gotta rhyme, bitch, I do what I want to You can suck my dick, yeah, if you want three", "vault_lines": ["I don't even gotta rhyme, bitch, I do what I want to"], "meaning": "In these two lines, Yeat shows his early development and complexity based on his usage of bars/wordplay by implying that he is so great at rhyming that he doesn’t even need to rap at the end of his verse because he does what he wants “to”, and that if one (in terms of a hater or music critic) shows clear dismay of his sudden change in care for the end of the verse, they can “suck my dick..if you want three”.\n\nThe fact that Yeat does not say one can give him oral sex in spite of his flow choice in terms of if they want “to” and instead “three” displays his wordplay in action, as two is behind three in the basic numeric system.", "annotation_id": "30099229", "url": "https://genius.com/30099229", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
