{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "bigger thën everything", "line": "All my diamonds moats, yeah", "vault_lines": [", all my diamonds moats, yeah"], "meaning": "Term ‘moats’ might be a reference to a business concept of ‘moat’. It is a slang word between business guys used to descirbe company’s competitive advantage. So basically yeat is claiming to be better than his competition in the industry.", "annotation_id": "34766249", "url": "https://genius.com/34766249", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
