{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "bigger thën everything", "line": "I rock APs, yeah, get fleezy (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I rock APs, yeah, get fleezy (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In this Lyric, Yeat was using his unique language to mention that he wears the brand “AP”, which stands for Audemars Piget, A wrist watch brand. The average price of a AP brand watch is usually around 50,000 USD, More than the average price of a Rolex with its average being 20,000 USD.", "annotation_id": "29258342", "url": "https://genius.com/29258342", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
