{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "I’m a fiend to be high, yeah, I can’t feel a thing", "vault_lines": ["I'm a fiend to be high, yeah, I can't feel a thing"], "meaning": "A fiend in slang in someone who craves a drug or substance, which relates to the use of “high” in this line. He craves drugs or substances to get high, and as a result he can’t feel a thing due to the inhibiting effects of said substances.", "annotation_id": "27976010", "url": "https://genius.com/27976010", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "They asked, “How many square feet in your house?” I said, “A lot, lot”", "vault_lines": ["They asked, \"How many square feet in your house?\" I said, \"A lot, lot\""], "meaning": "Rhyming this line with the previous, he says here that he is asked how many square feet he has in in his house, which he responds with a “lot, lot”. We can assume this is because Yeat’s fame and riches allows him to splurge on nice residences.", "annotation_id": "27976000", "url": "https://genius.com/27976000", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "I had to take a break from X, I feel it in my heart", "vault_lines": ["I had to take a break from X, I feel it in my heart"], "meaning": "Yeat says that he had to take a break from X, which is slang for MDMA aka ecstasy. He had to quit his usage temporarily because he could feel the side affects so bad he could figuratively feel it in his heart.", "annotation_id": "27975986", "url": "https://genius.com/27975986", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "If you push me to the edge, I’m jumpin’ extra far", "vault_lines": ["If you push me to the edge, I'm jumpin' extra far"], "meaning": "Might be a reach, but I assume what Yeat meant here is that he is so ambitious and bold, that even if you were to push him to the edge, literally or figuratively, he would jump extra far as an act of ambition and audacity.", "annotation_id": "27919076", "url": "https://genius.com/27919076", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
