{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "I just bought the AP, bitch, I got a million sinks", "vault_lines": ["I just bought the AP, bitch, I got a million sinks"], "meaning": "AP, Audemars Piguet is a company selling swiss luxury watches. Yeat may be saying that he’s so swaggy he be drippin' like million sinks.", "annotation_id": "26637297", "url": "https://genius.com/26637297", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "They asked if I make money, I said, “Ya-ya”", "vault_lines": ["They asked if I make money, I said, \"Ya-ya\""], "meaning": "Yeat’s recent co-signings have gave him the opportunities to gain hundreds of thousands of dollars, or as Yeat calls it, “Honey Buns” (100 thousand dollars)", "annotation_id": "25491483", "url": "https://genius.com/25491483", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "Racks on the table, yeah, racks on the yacht", "vault_lines": ["Racks on the table, yeah, racks on the yacht"], "meaning": "Yeat could be claiming that he is so rich that he keeps his multiple “racks” (thousands of dollars) in multiple places. On a table and on his yacht, which is a very expensive and luxurious sea vessel. It’s doubtful that he owns a yacht but he flexes it anyway.\n\nHowever, this could also mean that he is spending his racks on these items, a table or a yacht.", "annotation_id": "24923574", "url": "https://genius.com/24923574", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "Racks on the table, yeah, racks on the yacht", "vault_lines": ["Racks on the table, yeah, racks on the yacht"], "meaning": "Yeat could be claiming that he is so rich that he keeps his multiple “racks” (thousands of dollars) in multiple places. On a table and on his yacht, which is a very expensive and luxurious sea vessel. It is incredibly doubtful that he owns a yacht but he flexes it anyways to further show his wealth.", "annotation_id": "24923408", "url": "https://genius.com/24923408", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "Finna touch a mill’ then open the world’s first lean bar", "vault_lines": ["Finna touch a mill' then open the world's first lean bar"], "meaning": "Yeat plans on opening the world’s first bar that serves lean (a recreational drug beverage, usually prepared by mixing codeine-promethazine cough syrup with a soft drink) after obtaining a million dollars.", "annotation_id": "24922379", "url": "https://genius.com/24922379", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "I just went and bought the Urus then I took it off the lot", "vault_lines": ["I just went and bought the Urus then I took it off the lot"], "meaning": "Yeat references the Urus, an SUV by Italian car manufacturer Lamborghini. Its starting price is $218,000, so it makes sense that Yeat would want to show it off. This could also be a reference to his song “Off Tha Lot” from his 2021 album, 4L.", "annotation_id": "24834797", "url": "https://genius.com/24834797", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "I just called the devil, go ahead, upside-down the T", "vault_lines": ["I just called the devil, go ahead, upside-down the T"], "meaning": "Yeat is most likely referring to the cross of Saint Peter, aka the upside down cross, the cross has multiple meanings but Yeat is probably talking about it symbolising anti-christ and association with the devil.", "annotation_id": "24766508", "url": "https://genius.com/24766508", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "Yeah, this syrup not no maple, bitch, I’m sippin’ on that Wock’, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, this syrup not no maple, bitch, I'm sippin' on that Wock', yeah"], "meaning": "What Yeat is referring to is a type of cough syrup containing Promethazine and Codeine produced by the company Wockhardt. So he doesn’t mean maple syrup that is typically used on sweets such as pancakes and waffles, but instead wock. Wock is also used as a sedative effect and usually is mixed with a soft drink when taken recreationally. (Credit to SemmyXOXO for helping me use their definition).", "annotation_id": "23948965", "url": "https://genius.com/23948965", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ya Ya", "line": "Yeah, this syrup not no maple, bitch, I’m sippin’ on that Wock’, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, this syrup not no maple, bitch, I'm sippin' on that Wock', yeah"], "meaning": "What Yeat is referring to is a type of cough syrup  containing Promethazine and Codeine produced by the company Wockhardt. So he doesn’t mean maple syrup that is typically used on sweets such as pancakes and waffles, but instead wock. Wock is also used as a sedative effect and usually is mixed with a soft drink when taken recreationally. (Credit to SemmyXOXO for helping me use their definition).", "annotation_id": "23948909", "url": "https://genius.com/23948909", "state": "pending", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
