{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Xtra Krazy", "line": "Yeah, I seen them copying all the swag, whole lot of fuckin’ babies (Haha)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I seen them copying all the swag, whole lot of fuckin' babies (Haha)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying these rappers are his kids or “babies” because similarly to children, they copy his swag and his moves.", "annotation_id": "28772534", "url": "https://genius.com/28772534", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
