{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WΤw??", "line": "This shit gon’ extra hit, just like a baseline (Ah-ah)", "vault_lines": ["This shit gon' extra hit, just like a baseline (Ah-ah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is comparing this song to a hit in baseball. He is saying this song will “extra hit,” which means it will hit harder than usual.\n\nIn baseball, if you hit the ball down the baseline, it usually is an “extra base hit,” which means instead of just going to first base, you go to second or third.\n\nhttps://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRqDaAI6zqv77Dflzz5uh5HcsVidVn1FnyH6g&s", "annotation_id": "34716835", "url": "https://genius.com/34716835", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
