{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "Yeah, some broke-ass bum-ass boys, they ain’t got no sauce", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, some broke-ass bum-ass boys, they ain't got no sauce"], "meaning": "Yeat is seen making fun of his haters in this line, he says they ain’t go not “sauce”, which means money, so Yeat is therefore just calling his haters broke and bum ass niggas", "annotation_id": "31167256", "url": "https://genius.com/31167256", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "Pull up in the fucking Tonka", "vault_lines": ["Pull up in the fucking Tonka"], "meaning": "A “big body” car, fast car, SUV, Mercedes G Wagon, Lamborghini Urus, or just any big car is referred to as a “tonka.” Although the word has been around for a while, it has recently gained popularity again when rapper Yeat began referring to Lamborghini Urus, G wagons, and other vehicles with it.", "annotation_id": "30864805", "url": "https://genius.com/30864805", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "I’m high as the muh’fuckin’ Gods, lil’ bitch, I am flying above ’em (Yeah-ah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm high as the muh'fuckin' Gods, lil' bitch, I am flying above 'em (Yeah-ah)"], "meaning": "Noah says he takes high enough doses of drugs that it feels like he is with the God/s as we think of them high above everything.", "annotation_id": "30458514", "url": "https://genius.com/30458514", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
