{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "Wake up in the morning, geek up in the morning, bitch, I’m ’boutta tweak, huh", "vault_lines": ["Wake up in the morning, geek up in the morning, bitch, I'm 'boutta tweak, huh"], "meaning": "Mr. Twizzy, real name: Noah Oliver Smith is speaking about “cranky” which is a perc or percocet. More specifically speaking about waking up in the morning to “geek” which means to be high essentially, then he says Bitch I feel asleep. Which is common side effect of drug use.", "annotation_id": "29878995", "url": "https://genius.com/29878995", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
