{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "Yeah, smell this shit from a mile away Shit all cap, l could tell it’s that new cologne", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, smell this shit from a mile away"], "meaning": "A cologne test is a smaller sized version of an existing cologne for sample or research purposes\n\n\n\nYeat disses the other side claiming he can smell that what they have on is only testers as opposed to the real thing.\n\nHe lets them know they don’t really have the real twizzy sauce like they think they do and it is shamefully obvious to him.", "annotation_id": "29878966", "url": "https://genius.com/29878966", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
