{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wtf thëy on", "line": "Uh, I don’t give a fuck what you said, lil’ bitch, I got muhfuckin’ money-money", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I don't give a fuck what you said, lil' bitch, I got muhfuckin' money-money"], "meaning": "Yeat is speaking about an encounter with someone who said something, but he doesn’t give a fuck since he has muhfuckin’ money money. Year has signed a deal with interscope records and also griffen records for a record 7 million USD reportedly. He has well over 10-15 million USD in my opinion. I hear he has 4 properties and serveral cars such as Porsche Taycan, 918, Urus, G Wagon, Bentayga, Mclaren 765 LT Spyder. He is a very wealthy individual, Mr. Smith is certain not rap cap like these other imposters who rent cars and houses.", "annotation_id": "29850866", "url": "https://genius.com/29850866", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
