{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Woulda ya (Stylerz)", "line": "Bought a bitch", "vault_lines": ["Bought a Tonka, bought a bitch"], "meaning": "Yeat has begun a new trend while creating his album lyfestyle. He has been spotted frequently in south-east asia within the past year, and this line leads us to believe he has engaged in human trafficking. Yeat has refused to answer multiple questions about this in interviews, answering “I don’t really remember… it was just some whatever sh*t.” This line implies that yeat has bought at least one human around the same time he bought a tonka. He bought his Mercedes-Benz GLE either at the end of 2021, or early 2022. This means that yeat may have been doing these activites before he became famous. It’s not very well understood how yeat got his money, and this line sheds some light on the dark nature of it. The “tonka” in reference could also be the Lamborghini Urus he bought in 2022, so this could also be a more recent endeavor of Noah.", "annotation_id": "29855904", "url": "https://genius.com/29855904", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
