{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Went Wrong", "line": "To see where we would miss", "vault_lines": ["To see where we would miss"], "meaning": "stupid yeat fans took the good verse :\nOh, we was waitin' (Oh, oh)\nTo see where we went wrong\nWatch us fail\nLike we didn’t exist (Heartbeat all gone, my heartbeat burnin’ down)\nLike we didn’t exist (My heartbeat burnin' down, my heartbeat burnin' down)\nLike we didn’t ex— ah (My—)\n\nthis is what bro really meant :\n@SYMONERYLEY", "annotation_id": "39206864", "url": "https://genius.com/39206864", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
