{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "We Up", "line": "Chanelly", "vault_lines": ["I think we did it, yeah we up (Woah, woah)"], "meaning": "Chanelly, a term coined by fellow rapper and frequent collaborator Summrs, is a nickname for the designer brand Chanel. Chanel is a French luxury fashion house that was founded by couturière Coco Chanel in 1910. It focuses on women’s ready-to-wear clothes, luxury goods and accessories.", "annotation_id": "26601467", "url": "https://genius.com/26601467", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "We Up", "line": "Called up Eliantte, said he’d clean the diamonds wipe the dust", "vault_lines": ["Called up Eliantte, said he'd clean the diamonds wipe the dust"], "meaning": "For over 10 years, Eliantte has been one of the most trusted names in jewelry. Known for extravagant high-end jewelry focused on detailed diamond setting. Serving celebrity clientele as their trusted jeweler for brilliant diamonds, beautiful fine jewelry, elegant watches, custom made styles and expert jewelry repairs", "annotation_id": "26601463", "url": "https://genius.com/26601463", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
