{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wavëy Krazy", "line": "All that clout, it don’t mean shit", "vault_lines": ["All that clout, it don't mean shit"], "meaning": "Noah constantly reminds his listeners clout doesn’t mean anything to him. He’s never really been the guy to boast or brag as he says in the titled song “woah…!” He also says “ I don’t even be postin' no pics on the Instagram, bitch, I just muhfuckin' stay out“ on “Out thë way”.. He doesn’t care about clout. Just the bag, as we all should.", "annotation_id": "28442564", "url": "https://genius.com/28442564", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
