{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Watch It", "line": "Don’t know enough", "vault_lines": [", don't know enough"], "meaning": "Yeat would like you to gain wisdom, as he cares for everybody. He says you dont know enough, suggesting you must know more. Yeat is known to study at the Library 6 days a week when hes not producing. Among many different activities, one of Yeat’s favourites is reading/writing his own novels, which are currently on sale on my Ebay account for £10,000.", "annotation_id": "29503363", "url": "https://genius.com/29503363", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Watch It", "line": "Snippet", "vault_lines": ["m goin' up, I'm goin' up"], "meaning": "This is not infact an entire song, only a SNIPPET.\n\nHope you enjoyed my annotation!", "annotation_id": "29503351", "url": "https://genius.com/29503351", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Watch It", "line": "Watch it up, watch it up", "vault_lines": ["Watch it, watch it up, watch it up"], "meaning": "Possibly a lyrical reference to the 2009 movie, Up. Yeat is saying he will watch this movie instead of playing poker, as he can easily call the bluff.", "annotation_id": "29503336", "url": "https://genius.com/29503336", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
