{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Watch Dis", "line": "If this bitch keep on calling, I’ma block it (Watch this)", "vault_lines": ["If this bitch keep on calling, I'ma block it (Watch this)"], "meaning": "In this day and age, love partners typically communicate over text or phone call, but Yeat is not in favor of communicating with them when he is busy making music. In fact, Yeat has gone on record saying that all he does is record music. He has little, if any time or desire to consult with other people.", "annotation_id": "30482121", "url": "https://genius.com/30482121", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Watch Dis", "line": "Put ’em in a coffin, no Steve Austin (Watch this)", "vault_lines": ["Put 'em in a coffin, no Steve Austin (Watch this)"], "meaning": "Yeat references the WWE superstar Steve Austin, and his faked death on stage at the hands of Kane.", "annotation_id": "24426496", "url": "https://genius.com/24426496", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
