{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "My diamonds hitting crazy, they so hard, they were like twenty each (Twenty each)", "vault_lines": ["My diamonds hitting crazy, they so hard, they were like twenty each (Twenty each)"], "meaning": "yeat always shows off his flawless diamonds which are the highest rank of diamonds\n\ntwenty each here means each of his diamonds were 20 grand which is very expensive", "annotation_id": "31116843", "url": "https://genius.com/31116843", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "24/7 we geeked up, 7/11 double cup, my vision been blurry", "vault_lines": ["24/7 we geeked up, 7/11 double cup, my vision been blurry"], "meaning": "he is high on lean and his vision is blurry because of lean he overdoses lean too as its very addictive\n\nlean is a drug drink where codeine (a opioid) cough syrup is mixed with a soft drink like sprite", "annotation_id": "31116815", "url": "https://genius.com/31116815", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
