{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "My hands clean I don’t gotta do nothing for me, all my twizzy gon’ shoot for me They on payroll, I don’t even gotta pull the trigger", "vault_lines": ["I don't gotta do nothing for me, all my twizzy gon' shoot for me"], "meaning": "Yeat is implying he pays hitman to kill his enemies, and he doesn’t get his hands dirty, because he “don’t even pull the trigger”.", "annotation_id": "29848199", "url": "https://genius.com/29848199", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "7/11 double cup", "vault_lines": ["24/7 we geeked up, 7/11 double cup"], "meaning": "This relates to drugs in a sense. Yeat is talking about his heavy drug use as he does in multiple other hits. Using “7/11 double cup” implying he’s drinking Lean aka Promethazine with Codeine mixed with soda, and a jolly rancher.", "annotation_id": "29848161", "url": "https://genius.com/29848161", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "Slow off these Percs, bitch, I feel like a worm", "vault_lines": ["Slow off these Percs, bitch, I feel like a worm"], "meaning": "Yeat is on percocets (percs is an abbreviation for percocets) and is being slow, meaning it takes time for him to understand things.\n\nA worm is a small crawling animal that are slow.", "annotation_id": "29743718", "url": "https://genius.com/29743718", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "Bitch, I be geeked, you can call me a “nerd”", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I be geeked, you can call me a \"nerd\""], "meaning": "Geek and nerd are different words with the same meaning. A geek/nerd is someone people usually think is smart.\n\nTo be geeked is another saying for being on drugs.\n\nYeat is saying he is on drugs.", "annotation_id": "29743694", "url": "https://genius.com/29743694", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat ü want", "line": "My twizzy gon’ pull up from long-range Hit him thirty times, yeah, calling him “Curry”", "vault_lines": ["My twizzy gon' pull up from long-range"], "meaning": "Wardell Stephen “Steph” Curry II is an American professional basketball player for the Golden State Warriors of the National Basketball Association. He wears the number “thirty” on his jersey and is known for his “long range” accuracy when shooting thre-pointers.\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephen_Curry", "annotation_id": "25553143", "url": "https://genius.com/25553143", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
