{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "Why they all tryna be inside my business? I’m just tryna get me that bread", "vault_lines": ["Why they all tryna be inside my business? I'm just tryna get me that bread"], "meaning": "Yeat says he doesnt want others to be in his business while he is trying to get ‘bread\", which is a another word for getting money", "annotation_id": "39121428", "url": "https://genius.com/39121428", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "BNYX", "vault_lines": ["Uh, everything 'bout this shit come down to real life"], "meaning": "Benjamin Saint Fort, known professionally as Bnyx is an American record producer and songwriter. He is known for extensively working with Yeat and has also produced for many artists, such as Drake, Nicki Minaj, Lil Tecca, Travis Scott, YoungBoy Never Broke Again, Kid Cudi, Lil Uzi Vert and Trippie Redd among others.", "annotation_id": "38072886", "url": "https://genius.com/38072886", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "Yeah, if you gon’ pop that Perc’, you ’bout that pill life", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, if you gon' pop that Perc', you 'bout that pill life"], "meaning": "An honest take on drug use, similar to “No such thing as ‘just one more time’”. If you’re popping a Perc, you’re probably a pillhead. We are what we do.", "annotation_id": "33532284", "url": "https://genius.com/33532284", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "Yeah, if you gon’ pop that Perc’, you ’bout that pill life", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, if you gon' pop that Perc', you 'bout that pill life"], "meaning": "King Twizzy Yeat: is referring to, PERCOCET which is indicated for the relief of moderate to moderately severe pain. PERCOCET tablets should not be administered to patients with known hypersensitivity to oxycodone, acetaminophen, or any other component of this product. Also in this case he is saying that if you pop one if these pills you are apart of his, “pill life”.", "annotation_id": "29695034", "url": "https://genius.com/29695034", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "Tall money, big money, small money", "vault_lines": ["Tall money, big money, small money"], "meaning": "Hes definitely saying, “Tall money, big money,small money\"", "annotation_id": "29481236", "url": "https://genius.com/29481236", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Wat it feel lykë", "line": "Heard you went back like PEZ", "vault_lines": ["Heard you went back like PEZ"], "meaning": "I believe Yeat is referring to the PEZ candy, which comes with a refillable dispenser. You can fill the dispenser with the tiny pieces of candy, and then open the dispenser’s head to grab a piece.", "annotation_id": "28660304", "url": "https://genius.com/28660304", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
