{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WYE?", "line": "Okay, bet, go on Instagram and just DM one of my mans He said “Yeat, what the fuck? I just got scammed” Then I go out and dip, then I block him on the ’Gra—", "vault_lines": ["I been off the drugs (Swerve)"], "meaning": "Referring to Yeat’s former collaborator SeptembersRich having the nickname of SeptembersSwiper who has a history of scamming others through Instagram, in which he originally accumulated his wealth from.\n\n\n(𝗦𝗲𝗽𝘁𝗲𝗺𝗯𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗥𝗶𝗰𝗵 𝗶𝗻 𝗙𝗲𝗯𝗿𝘂𝗮𝗿𝘆 𝟮𝟮, 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟭)", "annotation_id": "37019936", "url": "https://genius.com/37019936", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
