{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WAR 2", "line": "Z65", "vault_lines": ["I was in a Z65"], "meaning": "Commonly referenced in his music, the Z65 is a a brand of two-seater hyper-ship released in August, 2083 by PRYZM Systems. A top line luxury craft famous for it’s 0-1000kmh in 4.8 seconds. First appearing in his 2084 music video “XX” with a full matte black wrap, it is a centerpiece of the 2080s Yeat era.", "annotation_id": "35216969", "url": "https://genius.com/35216969", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
