{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WAR 1", "line": "Za’", "vault_lines": ["I forgot you ain't smoking Za'"], "meaning": "Weed, Marijuana", "annotation_id": "30085838", "url": "https://genius.com/30085838", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WAR 1", "line": "I’m too underrated, thought that they would leave me there (Yeah) Got off the phone, I’m going to the top, babe, you could meet me there (Babe)", "vault_lines": ["I'm too underrated, thought that they would leave me there (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat admits he thought he would be forgotten in the midst of rage rap due to his obscurity in the music industry, but makes a promise to his significant other that soon she’ll be at the top with him.\n\nIn fact, Yeat was so tiny in the industry that he previewed his most popular track, “Monëy so big,” to only seventy viewers on an Instagram Live.\n\nThis line would later become a reality when Yeat would start to gain traction on TikTok with his track “Sorry Bout That,” making him a worldwide sensation from the scene of rage rap.\n\n\n\nYeat performing at Brighton Music Hall in Boston, Massachusetts for his 2 Alivë tour.", "annotation_id": "29051677", "url": "https://genius.com/29051677", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WAR 1", "line": "Told you we some different creatures (Let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["Told you we some different creatures (Let's go)"], "meaning": "Different Creature is Yeat’s collaborative EP with Dutch hip-hop producer, Clibbo. Different Creature 2 was expected to release nine months later, but Yeat was having label issues which caused him to leak all of the songs himself.\n\n\n\nThe album artwork for Different Creature depicting Yeat as himself, an angel, and the Devil holding a pitchfork in his shadows.", "annotation_id": "29050373", "url": "https://genius.com/29050373", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
