{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "WAR 1", "line": "I forgot, I made fifty bands off this laptop", "vault_lines": ["I forgot, I made fifty bands off this laptop"], "meaning": "Yeat used to commit to the act of “swiping,” where blank cards were written with other peoples' card information so that he could withdraw at an ATM, but ever since he started to gain traction as a recording artist, he has since stopped scamming.\n\n\n\nAn exchange between Yeat and a fan allegedly swiping together.\n\nYeat allegedly cut off his close friend, SeptembersRich due to him still pursuing the dishonest act.\n\n\n\nBlank EMV cards like these would be used to write other peoples' card information on them.", "annotation_id": "24718348", "url": "https://genius.com/24718348", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
