{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Urus", "line": "Too many damn percs up in my head, I see too blurry (See too blurry)", "vault_lines": ["Too many damn percs up in my head, I see too blurry (See too blurry)"], "meaning": "Percocet is the brand name for a painkiller that contains oxycodone and acetaminophen. It doesn’t normally change how you see.\n\nHowever, in some cases, especially if taken in high doses or mixed with other substances, it can cause “blurred vision.”", "annotation_id": "36774037", "url": "https://genius.com/36774037", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
