{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Up off X", "line": "And that drink to me like wine (Skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["And that drink to me like wine (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "This bar could be taken in many ways. The drank is obviously lean in this context but he’s comparing it to wine. How is he comparing it to wine tho. One way could be through color which the lean could be made with red cough syrup which is why it could look like wine. It could also be how strong the drink is, the lean could be consumed so much to where the point that the effect of the lean is less effective to where the point it’s on the same level as wines", "annotation_id": "31281558", "url": "https://genius.com/31281558", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
