{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Up off X", "line": "Livin’ however I like, yeah I’m livin’ this shit it my life, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Livin' however I like, yeah"], "meaning": "Mentioning how he don’t give a fuck how people think about his lifestyle and how he is going to live the way he wants. Yeat has said that all he does is make music, and he doesn’t do much else.", "annotation_id": "28532021", "url": "https://genius.com/28532021", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
