{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "US", "line": "We sip drank, yeah, drank, yeah (Yeah) Drank, yeah, mud, yeah, mud, yeah, drank, no-no-no, drank (Woo, skrr’, skrrh, skrrh) Drown up, mud (Yeah), Percs, lean, Percs, Percs, no-no-no, Percs, no-no-no, Oxy, yeah, uh (Buh-buh-buh, boom) (Yeah) We smoke dank, we take drank, fuck what you think", "vault_lines": ["We sip drank, yeah, drank, yeah (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to drank and mud, slang for Codeine. He also brings up Oxycodone and dank, aka. Marijuana.", "annotation_id": "27547897", "url": "https://genius.com/27547897", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
