{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "U could tëll", "line": "You don’t know how the fuck it feel to be this fuckin’ rich", "vault_lines": ["You don't know how the fuck it feel to be this fuckin' rich"], "meaning": "Yeat reflects on the astronomical amount of wealth that he has accumulated throughout his career. By saying “you don’t know how the fuck it feel,” Yeat implies that his level of richness is so incomprehensibly high that the average human brain could never fully process it. Similar to how medieval peasants would view a king sitting upon mountains of gold.", "annotation_id": "39690088", "url": "https://genius.com/39690088", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "U could tëll", "line": "I’m just ridin’ in the Tonka, bitch, I know I’m the shit", "vault_lines": ["I'm just ridin' in the Tonka, bitch, I'm on this shit"], "meaning": "he’s on drugs in his “Tonka” (large SUV)", "annotation_id": "32825784", "url": "https://genius.com/32825784", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "U could tëll", "line": "Huh, when you rich like this, it feel great When you get a lot of shit on your plate, huh When you get to the top with the dogs, huh You get to flex all that shit in they face You can tell them lil’ boys a disgrace Yeah, you can tell that we been in first place Ayy, you can tell that I’m going to the top", "vault_lines": ["When you rich like this, it feel great"], "meaning": "He is talking about him getting rich, in term going to the “top” meaning going above his competitors. Yeat also talks about his “Tonka” meaning large SUV.", "annotation_id": "32825751", "url": "https://genius.com/32825751", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
