{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Type monëy", "line": "No green", "vault_lines": ["I'm sippin' on lean, lean, no green"], "meaning": "For “lean” to take on its purple look, it needs to have the main ingredient (cough syrup with codeine) otherwise the drink will be just green.\n\nYeat is claiming that he doesn’t sip fake lean and does the real thing. He has multiple photos of his lean habits.", "annotation_id": "36684522", "url": "https://genius.com/36684522", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
