{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Type monëy", "line": "Swervin’ the motherfuckin’ madness (Skrrt), I already said that shit (Skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["Swervin' the motherfuckin' madness (Skrrt), I already said that shit (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "Yeat might be referring to a line from one of his hits from his 2022 EP Lyfë, “Out thë way” where Yeat said a similar line.\n\n“Yeah, I’m swervin' it daily (Ooh, oh)\nYeah, I’m causin' a madness (Ooh, oh)”", "annotation_id": "34042435", "url": "https://genius.com/34042435", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
