{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Type monëy", "line": "Made this shit out the motherfuckin’ lab", "vault_lines": ["Made this shit out the motherfuckin' lab"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining how he built his career from the ground up. He was hated at first, but caught on with millions, each album, each lego piece adding to his career and blowing him up in popularity. He went from some unknown soundcloud artist, to the most unique mainstream rapper out there.", "annotation_id": "33205286", "url": "https://genius.com/33205286", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
