{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Type monëy", "line": "Bitch, you gon’ need a mil’ to feature one of us", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, you gon' need a mil' to feature one of us"], "meaning": "Due to inflation, Yeat’s feature prices went from 85 honey buns ($850,000) to just one million dollars, making it extremely expensive for someone to get a verse on his track.\n\n\n\n“Honey bun” is a slang term for a hundred band, which resembles a stack of $100,000", "annotation_id": "27884053", "url": "https://genius.com/27884053", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Type monëy", "line": "I ain’t no nerd, bitch", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm poppin' the motherfuckin' X (Hol' on), lil' bitch, I ain't no nerd, bitch (Hol' on, hol' on)"], "meaning": "A youtuber Asherjax has once called yeat the nerdiest rapper of all time, Asherjax is also the one who made a video ‘Why Doesn’t Yeat Say N word\" and went viral. which currently has 712k views on youtube.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?\nv=NB8an_xbIow\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KEmEipR3kGE", "annotation_id": "27880839", "url": "https://genius.com/27880839", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
