{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Twizz", "line": "Eliantte diamonds", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, Eliantte diamonds, watch the way they shine (Flooded)"], "meaning": "Likely referring to the New York Jeweler Eliantte & Co. The company curates fine custom jewelry pieces including pendants, chains, bracelets, grills, engagement rings and more. Known for providing the pink diamond for Lil Uzi Verts 24 million dollar diamond forehead implant. They’ve also curated custom jewelry for Kendrick Lamar, Travis Scott, Roddy Ricch, Rich The Kid amongst other rappers.", "annotation_id": "35245851", "url": "https://genius.com/35245851", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
