{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Turban", "line": "Told ’em I needed that money to pay all my bros, you ain’t even close to us Told ’em it is how it is, that’s how this shit goes", "vault_lines": ["Told 'em I needed that money to pay all my bros, you ain't even close to us"], "meaning": "Yeat seems to be explaining to a unnamed person the reason for needing money.\nPerhaps their money specifically.\nYeat might be referencing scamming in these lines while having a one sided convo with someone who perhaps was asking by Yeat wiped their bank. He claims he needed that money to pay all his bros, and the person he took from isn’t even close to him and thus they shouldn’t even be complaining.\n\nIt’s js how it goes.", "annotation_id": "35216922", "url": "https://genius.com/35216922", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
