{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Turban", "line": "She said that she wanna come pull up and suck on my cock, told her, “Drink my kids” I knew all this shit from the start, so I already told you what it all is Oh my, oh my gosh, oh my goodness, ah", "vault_lines": ["She said that she wanna come pull up and suck on my cock, told her, \"Drink my kids\""], "meaning": "Yeat graphically explains the events occurring during one of his affairs, including an excerpt in which he replicates noises of pleasure which might occur during intercourse or other acts. The line “drink my kids” is a reference to the type of sex act which Yeat’s companion is performing.", "annotation_id": "32669291", "url": "https://genius.com/32669291", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Turban", "line": "I better sign for a lot ’cause this shit ain’t urgent (Okay)", "vault_lines": ["I better sign for a lot 'cause this shit ain't urgent (Okay)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying that he is waiting to get signed by a record label so he can get signed for much more money. By claiming “this shit ain’t urgent,” Yeat is explaining that he knows his value as a rapper and will continue to release music independently until he is being signed by a label that recognizes his worth.", "annotation_id": "32669283", "url": "https://genius.com/32669283", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
