{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Turban", "line": "I got a whole lot of money comin’ in (All day)", "vault_lines": ["I got a whole lot of money comin' in (All day)"], "meaning": "Yeat, an American rapper from Irvine, California, who has achieved much success from the release of his past few albums, says that he accrues significant amounts of currency as a result of his artistic endeavors. He also talks about how this currency never stops arriving at his financial institutions of-choice, as his collection of money occurs from the time he wakes up until the time he goes to bed.", "annotation_id": "26947128", "url": "https://genius.com/26947128", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
