{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "I don’t know who the fuck you is, I’m definitely not your friend", "vault_lines": ["I don't know who the fuck you is, I'm definitely not your friend"], "meaning": "Yeat alludes to constantly being approached by fans saying they want to be friends with him. Yeat has said in previous interviews that he spends a lot of time at home and keeps his friend-circle small, so he likely finds this annoying.", "annotation_id": "27650554", "url": "https://genius.com/27650554", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
