{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "This not Breaking Bad, but my brother selling methods", "vault_lines": ["This not Breaking Bad, but my brother selling methods"], "meaning": "Yeat relates his life to the popular tv show Breaking Bad\n\nIn the show, the main characters sell methamphetamine, but Yeat’s brother is selling methods, as opposed to meth", "annotation_id": "24775804", "url": "https://genius.com/24775804", "state": "pending", "votes": 25, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "He thought he my twizzy, smoked him like a stizzy", "vault_lines": ["He thought he my twizzy, smoked him like a stizzy"], "meaning": "Somebody thought they were Septembersrich’s twizzy. (twin) So septembersrich smoked him like a “stizzy” A stizzy is a thc distillate smoking device from the LA based brand Stiiizy. They’ve done a lot of branching out in their company and now sell prerolls, flower and edibles.", "annotation_id": "24200108", "url": "https://genius.com/24200108", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "Yeah, okay, I woke up at seven PM for breakfast", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, okay, I woke up at seven PM for breakfast"], "meaning": "Yeat wakes up at 7pm, a fairly late time to be eating your first meal of the day. Despite this he still wakes up at 7pm for breakfast.", "annotation_id": "24101109", "url": "https://genius.com/24101109", "state": "pending", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "I just came from Neiman’s, I put Diors on my feet (Cost me fourteen)", "vault_lines": ["I just came from Neiman's, I put Diors on my feet (Cost me fourteen)"], "meaning": "Yeat just got back from a trip to Neiman Marcus, a luxury goods store. He refers to dior shoes on his feet, and recounts spending one thousand four hundered dollars.", "annotation_id": "24101096", "url": "https://genius.com/24101096", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "Toseína got me dizzy, called my bitch to get some nizzy", "vault_lines": ["Toseína got me dizzy, called my bitch to get some nizzy"], "meaning": "Septembersrich is dizzy off the toseina, and called his bitch to give him some “nizzy.” This refers to “head” or a “blowjob.”", "annotation_id": "24100554", "url": "https://genius.com/24100554", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "Bitch pulled out the E, made her brush her teeth", "vault_lines": ["Bitch pulled out the E, made her brush her teeth"], "meaning": "Oftentimes, when women take “E”, short for ecstasy, they become very sexually motivated. September already knows the woman wants to have sex with him because she pulled out some “E” in order to get in the “mood”. So, he has her brush her teeth to make sure she’s up to par with his standards.", "annotation_id": "24042115", "url": "https://genius.com/24042115", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "We got all types of lines, Tose’ strawberry", "vault_lines": ["We got all types of lines, Tose' strawberry"], "meaning": "Lines are a slang term for a fluid oz of cough syrup which Yeat will use to get high. Even though he has a multitude of types of these lines, Yeat points out that his Tose' is red just like a strawberry. Tose' is a shortening of the codeine cough syrup manufacturer Toseina, and Italian company.", "annotation_id": "23950937", "url": "https://genius.com/23950937", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trëndy way", "line": "First my money twerk, now it’s lifting weights Money in the gym, now it’s heavyweight", "vault_lines": ["First my money twerk, now it's lifting weights"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat is referring the the 16th track on his LP “4L,” Money Twerk. It is not uncommon that he makes sequels to songs or mentions past tracks in later songs.", "annotation_id": "23928292", "url": "https://genius.com/23928292", "state": "pending", "votes": 38, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
