{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trënds & Topics*", "line": "Every time I’m out the cut,", "vault_lines": ["Every time I'm out the cut,"], "meaning": "Yeat says, “Every time I’m out the cut.” What he means here is that every single time he is out the mix or out of the way, he’s still the muh'fuckin numba one trendin' topic ah.\n\nAlso, Every couple of months, Yeat periodically emerges from obscurity and steadily rises to a prominent position at the center of intense cultural attention.", "annotation_id": "29893593", "url": "https://genius.com/29893593", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trënds & Topics*", "line": "I pop back out of the cut every lil’ two months and I’m muh’fuckin’ trendin’, ah", "vault_lines": ["I pop back out of the cut every lil' two months and I'm muh'fuckin' trendin', ah"], "meaning": "Yeat periodically resurfaces from obscurity every interval consisting of a couple months, consistently attaining a prominent status within the cultural forefront of high-level attention.", "annotation_id": "29669662", "url": "https://genius.com/29669662", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trënds & Topics*", "line": "I’m the muh’fuckin’ number one trendin’ topic,", "vault_lines": ["I'm the muh'fuckin' number one trendin' topic,"], "meaning": "Yeats statement is bold, self-assured, and representative of the confidence often associated with the hip-hop genre. By using explicit language and claiming to be the top trending topic, Yeat is showcasing his prominence and dominance in the music industry and the online sphere.", "annotation_id": "29132950", "url": "https://genius.com/29132950", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trënds & Topics*", "line": "Yeah, I’m booted and zooted and booted and zooted, I fly (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm booted and zooted and booted and zooted, I fly (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying he gets real high.", "annotation_id": "28556254", "url": "https://genius.com/28556254", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Trënds & Topics*", "line": "All of these trash-ass rappers cannot touch me and I’ma tell you why (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["All of these trash-ass rappers cannot touch me and I'ma tell you why (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is fundamentally asserting his position as the pre-eminent rapper in the world, a claim for which there is strong justification, such as his high-grade masterwork.", "annotation_id": "28489526", "url": "https://genius.com/28489526", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
