{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Tru to U", "line": "Really, I just try to sleep when I’m on the codeine, but I took me some Molly", "vault_lines": ["Really, I just try to sleep when I'm on the codeine, but I took me some Molly"], "meaning": "While Yeat’s intention was to fall asleep, his urge to consume MDMA, also known as Molly, prevented him from doing so. This is because one of the most prominent physical effects of MDMA is central nervous stimulation, which can cause restlessness. Codeine, on the other hand, is known to cause drowsiness.", "annotation_id": "35773788", "url": "https://genius.com/35773788", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Tru to U", "line": "Finna go change my name to “Private Jet” ’cause of how much I’m high flying", "vault_lines": ["Finna go change my name to \"Private Jet\" 'cause of how much I'm high flying"], "meaning": "Yeat metaphorically states that he will change his name to “Private Jet” because of how often he consumes psychoactive substances.  Here, “high flying” is him saying he is high off of drugs.", "annotation_id": "35773773", "url": "https://genius.com/35773773", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
