{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Took a break", "line": "(Welcome to 1st Class)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, they said, \"How'd you get it?\" (Yeah) (Welcome to 1st Class)"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag of ‘1st Class’.\n\n1st Class, whose real name is Khaleel Griffin, is an accomplished hip-hop producer renowned for his work in the industry. He has amassed an impressive list of production credits, collaborating with notable artists such as Chance the Rapper, Gucci Mane, DaBaby, Moneybagg Yo, French Montana, G-Eazy, Dro Kenji, and numerous others. 1st Class frequently works alongside fellow producer jetsonmade and is a member of jetsonmade’s collective known as boymeetspace.", "annotation_id": "28775726", "url": "https://genius.com/28775726", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
