{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Tonka", "line": "I tried to quit them Percs with Kratom but that ain’t do me bad", "vault_lines": ["I tried to quit them Percs with Kratom but that ain't do me bad"], "meaning": "Kratom leaf, and or MIT extract come from a south-asian tree that is mostly unregulated in the US. The plant’s leaves have opiate-like effects including sedation and euphoria with a possibility of developing dependency, or addiction\n\nPercs (Percocet), are usually a misnomer and reference for regular oxycodone IR pills, whereas Percocet itself is a a brand name for oxycodone mixed with acetaminophen.\n\nSwitching to Kratom can often be seen as a potential method to control withdrawal, but is not always effective when coming off of stronger opiates", "annotation_id": "34746397", "url": "https://genius.com/34746397", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Tonka", "line": "Audemars with the baguettes on it", "vault_lines": ["Audemars with the baguettes on it"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to the luxury watches brand “Audemars Piguet”. Furthermore, baguettes is slang for Baguette diamonds. The Baguette cut of diamond is similar in shape to a baguette in that it is long and rectangular in shape. Thus, his watch has diamonds all over it", "annotation_id": "29794614", "url": "https://genius.com/29794614", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Tonka", "line": "Swerving, dodging, oppies, coppers", "vault_lines": ["Swerving, dodging, oppies, coppers"], "meaning": "Yeat is Talking about swerving his car and dodging his ops and the cops. This could have a deeper meaning. For example, Yeat is swerving trying to get through his life and dodging his ops (or enemies) and the law (coppers).", "annotation_id": "29681810", "url": "https://genius.com/29681810", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
