{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Told Ya / Arceteryx", "line": "I don’t wait in line, I just hopped in front of the jets (Woo, woo, ah)", "vault_lines": ["I don't wait in line, I just hopped in front of the jets (Woo, woo, ah)"], "meaning": "Instead of dealing with airport security or waiting in commercial lines, he skips the entire process by stepping straight onto a private jet on the tarmac.", "annotation_id": "41600727", "url": "https://genius.com/41600727", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Told Ya / Arceteryx", "line": "The GLE be farting, but the Hellcat be whining", "vault_lines": ["The GLE be farting, but the Hellcat be whining"], "meaning": "In this bar he refers to his black and green Mercedes AMG GLE.  (The OG Tonka) as shown in the Big tonka music video, and what he describes as farting is actually the car backfiring due to having an upgraded and tuned turbo system under the hood.\nWhen he describes the Dodge Hellcat as whining its actually pretty accurate because the hellcats supercharger makes a high pitched noise under heavy load", "annotation_id": "41000871", "url": "https://genius.com/41000871", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Told Ya / Arceteryx", "line": "I’ve been killing shit like Columbine", "vault_lines": ["I've been killing shit like Columbine"], "meaning": "Referring to the Columbine High School massacre, commonly referred to as Columbine, was a school shooting and attempted bombing that occurred on April 20, 1999, at Columbine High School in Columbine, Colorado, United States", "annotation_id": "30397512", "url": "https://genius.com/30397512", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Told Ya / Arceteryx", "line": "Arc’teryx", "vault_lines": ["I be rocking Arc'teryx"], "meaning": "Arc'teryx is a Canadian high-end design company specializing in outdoor apparel and equipment headquartered in North Vancouver, British Columbia. It focuses on technical apparel for mountaineering and Alpine sports, including related accessories", "annotation_id": "30397505", "url": "https://genius.com/30397505", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
