{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Time Again", "line": "PART II: 293842341", "vault_lines": ["Keep showin' love to me, yeah, ah"], "meaning": "“293842341” is a seemingly demo track where Yeat is saying a bunch of random numbers without any correlation.\n\nPreviewed at a show with Zack Bia in Japan on October 31st 2023 alongside Riot & set it off and the album’s track title 2093\n\nabout 47 seconds of the track were later reused as the outro for this song in 2024.\nBoth fully leaked as part of a Yeat mass leak on February 1st 2026.", "annotation_id": "38512167", "url": "https://genius.com/38512167", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
