{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "The Bell", "line": "New twat ring the bell when she wanna get fucked I ring that bell when I wanna get sucked", "vault_lines": ["New twat ring the bell when she wanna get fucked"], "meaning": "“New twat”, is in reference to Yeat’s new girlfriend, prior to his break up with Symone. In several photos, Yeat has been seen beside what appears to be his new girlfriend, however her name is currently unknown.\n\nYeat, with his rumored dating companion in 2025.\n\nIn this line, Yeat is implying that they both ring the bell to communicate with each other sexually.", "annotation_id": "35504696", "url": "https://genius.com/35504696", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
