{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "The Bell", "line": "Song was already turnt but the bell turned up (Tonka), oh", "vault_lines": ["Song was already turnt but the bell turned up (Tonka), oh"], "meaning": "A call back to “Gët Busy”, one of his many viral hits of 2021 that would help him establish his name in the industry:\n\nYeah, this song already was turnt, but here’s a bell (Yeah)\n\nYeat was well-known for adding repeating bells to many of his songs, such as “Mad bout that” and “Cmon”.\n\nYeat has also bragged about this before in a similar line on his 2022 track “Nëw turban”:\n\nI add a bell to the beat ‘cause it turn shit up, yeah, they know it’s my thang", "annotation_id": "35141558", "url": "https://genius.com/35141558", "state": "accepted", "votes": 39, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
