{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Team ceo", "line": "Yeah, I’m a futuristic Al Capone", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm a futuristic Al Capone"], "meaning": "Al capone was an American gangster and businessman who attained notoriety during the Prohibition era as the co-founder and boss of the Chicago Outfit, a criminal organization\n\nyeat is saying he is a futuristic version of him, implying he is a boss of criminal organizations and notorious gangster but in the future since he lives in 2093", "annotation_id": "30901444", "url": "https://genius.com/30901444", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Team ceo", "line": "They might not get this shit at first It’s like fittin’ all that Porsche up inside a purse", "vault_lines": ["They might not gеt this shit at first"], "meaning": "Yeat suggests that comprehending the intricacies of his album, “2093,” may pose a challenge for some listeners initially, likening it to the task of fitting a luxurious Porsche into a compact purse. In essence, the depth and complexity of the music might not be immediately apparent, requiring a closer and more attentive exploration to truly appreciate its nuances.", "annotation_id": "30900241", "url": "https://genius.com/30900241", "state": "pending", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Team ceo", "line": "They might not get this shit at first", "vault_lines": ["They might not get this shit at first"], "meaning": "Yeat is implying that the audience will not understand this project in first listen but will grow into it and understand it later on.\n\nSimilar effect of what happened with Playboi Carti’s “Whole lotta red”", "annotation_id": "30898841", "url": "https://genius.com/30898841", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
