{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Talk 2 God", "line": "I’ma take a ecstasy", "vault_lines": ["I don't see the sun, I'ma take a ecstasy"], "meaning": "Ecstasy is the pill form of MDMA, a popular drug that causes extreme feelings of euphoria, increased levels of energy, and distorts time. I can see why Yeat would be taking some.\n\nEcstasy however is not a pure form of MDMA. Molly is pure MDMA, while ecstasy is mixed with other drugs.\n\nMDMA also goes by the street name of “Bean(s),” something important to know as Yeat will make use of this popular phrase in this song.", "annotation_id": "27420614", "url": "https://genius.com/27420614", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
