{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Talk 2 God", "line": "Yeah, I just popped a bean (Bean)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I just popped a bean (Bean)"], "meaning": "To “pop” a pill, capsule, etc. simply means ingesting it.\n\nMDMA, which goes by the street names of “Molly” or “Bean(s)” is a synthetic drug that produces feelings of increased energy and pleasure while distorting sensory and time perception. Usually taken as a capsule or tablet, Yeat tells us he has done just that.", "annotation_id": "27420491", "url": "https://genius.com/27420491", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Talk 2 God", "line": "You can tell just by the look, yeah, if they true or not (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["You can tell just by the look, yeah, if they true or not (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat can tell if people are real or fake to him based off of the look, probably because now that he is up in the rap industry he comes by many fake people who only want to use him for clout and money.", "annotation_id": "26284402", "url": "https://genius.com/26284402", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
