{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Talk 2 God", "line": "Like somebody asking a question, off the opiates, I nod", "vault_lines": ["Like somebody asking a question, off the opiates, I nod"], "meaning": "Crazy how nobody caught this one yet: Yeat is referring to the “nod” one achieves while high on opiates (nodding in and out of consciousness), and employs a clever play on words by also referencing an affirmative but dismissive head-nod in response to any question someone may ask, all while he’s “off the opiates”.", "annotation_id": "25343655", "url": "https://genius.com/25343655", "state": "pending", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
