{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Taliban", "line": "I’m a geek always, it’s my life", "vault_lines": ["I'm a geek always, it's my life"], "meaning": "“Im a geek always, it’s my life” What Yeat means by this is that he is going to take any amount of “Percocets” it doesn’t matter as long as it makes him feel normal. “Normal” in this case, isn’t actually normal but it is what the percs make him believe is “normal.” Yeat claiming it is his life also confirms that he always needs to be “high” to feel “normal”", "annotation_id": "28566350", "url": "https://genius.com/28566350", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
