{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "THEY TELL MË", "line": "Yeah, I whipped the Lambo’ truck, all the way out today, now it’s back in my garage", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I whipped the Lambo' truck, all the way out today, now it's back in my garage"], "meaning": "Yeat is clearly referring to the Lamborghini Urus, a luxury sports SUV. Yeat has mentioned his urus in many of his other songs, and commonly refers to his urus as a ‘Tonka’", "annotation_id": "33323116", "url": "https://genius.com/33323116", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
