{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "THE COSTËS", "line": "You know it’s 10s when we comin’ through", "vault_lines": ["You know it's 10s when we comin' through"], "meaning": "This may be a sneak diss directed towards rappers Playboi Carti and Homixide Gang that are affiliated with a Atlanta gang ‘HOMIXIDE’. Number ‘5’ is a symbol/theme number of this gang.  Homixide Gang robbed summrs (yeat’s friend) on stage during his performance in 2023 at a Box Fest Show in NYC.\nWhen yeat constantly saying things with number ‘10’ (double five) throughout the whole album he may be claiming that his people and he himself are better than Opium.", "annotation_id": "34766400", "url": "https://genius.com/34766400", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
