{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "THE COSTËS", "line": "White tee, plain jane, diamonds on my neck, sure", "vault_lines": ["White tee, plain jane, diamonds on my neck, sure"], "meaning": "‘plain jane’ means something basic, ordinary. He talkin bout wearing white tee (t-shirt) which is very basic and still having his chain on. So he is sayin that no matter in what situation he is he always got his diamons on (probably his diamond chain).", "annotation_id": "34766342", "url": "https://genius.com/34766342", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "THE COSTËS", "line": "Heard you wanna do is live like us, you don’t have no chauffeur", "vault_lines": ["Heard you wanna do is live like us, you don't have no chauffeur"], "meaning": "He is adressing someone that wants to be like him, copy his style (this may be diss directed to someone in the industry but i guess we will never know). He says that this person cant be like him because he doesnt have a chauffeur (private driver) like him.", "annotation_id": "34766320", "url": "https://genius.com/34766320", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
