{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "THE COSTËS", "line": "Mink coat, you rock faux fur", "vault_lines": ["Diamonds on me, mink coat, you rock faux fur"], "meaning": "Mink coats are made with the fur of Minks, which is highly expensive to manufacture, thus associated with luxury. Faux fur is mainly plastic, which is far cheaper.", "annotation_id": "33323318", "url": "https://genius.com/33323318", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
