{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Supër Test", "line": "Eliantte, O-X-Y, I’m missing my ho (Eliantte)", "vault_lines": ["Eliantte, O-X-Y, I'm missing my ho (Eliantte)"], "meaning": "A reference to another song in the album “Alivë” called Oh Ex Why (oxy, or oxycontin). This reference is also a double entendre with the following line “I’m missing my ho”. Asking his past relationship “Oh Ex, Why?” while also alluding to his use of the oxycontin narcotic.", "annotation_id": "33775970", "url": "https://genius.com/33775970", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
