{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Supër Test", "line": "I be in Dover Street Market, I don’t shop at no Pacsun (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I be in Dover Street Market, I don't shop at no Pacsun (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Dover Street Market is a retailer that mainly sells high fashion products, but also features items from more urban, streetwear brands. The concept of Dover Street Market was largely based upon the Kensington Market that was the fashion hub for Britain for over 40 years.\n\nPacific Sunwear of California, LLC, commonly known as PacSun, is an American retail clothing brand. The company sells lifestyle apparel, along with swim, footwear and accessories designed for teens and young adults.\n\nYeat states that he only shops for high designer and doesnt want the  basic clothes everyone else has", "annotation_id": "32588484", "url": "https://genius.com/32588484", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Supër Test", "line": "Bitch, what do I want, yeah, the ’Vette or the ’Cat? (Ack)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, what do I want, yeah, the 'Vette or the 'Cat? (Ack)"], "meaning": "Yeat is unsure whether to buy a Corvette or a Hellcat. But it is also a play on words because a “Vet” also known as a “veterinarian” specializes in injured animals such as a “Cat”.", "annotation_id": "31968836", "url": "https://genius.com/31968836", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Supër Test", "line": "Yeah, y’all late to all of this shit, yeah, you still on the PS1", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, y'all late to all of this shit, yeah, you still on the PS1"], "meaning": "He’s making fun of his haters by claiming that they are so behind that they’re still playing on the “PlayStation 1”.", "annotation_id": "30365085", "url": "https://genius.com/30365085", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
