{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Super Surfer", "line": "They repeating my swag like Spongebob and Doodlebob", "vault_lines": ["They repeating my swag like Spongebob and Doodlebob"], "meaning": "DoodleBob is a living two-dimensional drawing resembling SpongeBob SquarePants, appearing in the episodes “Frankendoodle” and “Doodle Dimension”\n\nYeat is saying people are copying his swag, but not pulling it off like him.", "annotation_id": "27548175", "url": "https://genius.com/27548175", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Super Surfer", "line": "No I don’t care ’bout a view, if I did I’d be industry plant to a label", "vault_lines": ["No I don't care 'bout a view, if I did I'd be industry plant to a label"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining that his success is natural, and if he wanted clout he’d become an industry plant. Yeat took his time since this, and after 3 years it’s clear his patience paid off.", "annotation_id": "27548172", "url": "https://genius.com/27548172", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
