{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sum 2 do", "line": "Yeah, lil’ bitch, I live on the— uh, I live on the moon, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, lil' bitch, I live on the— uh, I live on the moon, yeah"], "meaning": "This line is a boastful and exaggerated statement that suggests the speaker is in a position of wealth and power. By claiming to live on the moon, the speaker is implying that they have achieved a level of success and affluence that is beyond the reach of most people.", "annotation_id": "28430797", "url": "https://genius.com/28430797", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
