{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Strogänoff", "line": "[Intro] Who’d you say? (Yeah) (Oogie Mane killed it) Not me (Yeah) Who’d you say was broke not me (Yeah) [Chorus] Who’d you say was broke? Not me It’s definitely not me, bitch how bout you Who’d you say fell off? Not me It’s probably you or somethin’ (huh) Who’d you say was broke not me Who’d you say was broke I got big bank rolls Yeah I got knots on me (On me) (Yeah, let’s go) Got way too much guap Got too much drop on me (Drop) Got way too much ops ’Cause they can’t move like me Hold’up Bitch get the fuck up out my way when I’m steppin’ through I went up on these kids, no I didn’t use a stepping stone Get high every day No I don’t have a schedule (Nah) Hit up [?] That’s a easy lil’ band or two Lil boy broke fell off he ask me if I manage you [Verse] (Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go, ... let’s) Turn this hoe to a moshpit Turn this hoe to a moshpit And, I, rock Montclizzy winter wear anywhere She said he is so damn fushy call’em a pear so high I might walk’up inside’a the barber cut off my hair No, don’t try, no its not fair I just went bought me Chanel (Yeah) Lil boy you been broke I can tell (Yeah) I got money, good for my health (Yeah) No I don’t listen, I’m not a elf (Shh) You went out so sad they put you on a shirt how’d you let’em My bitch got a bag it’s Marc Jacob I’m rockin’ Margiela She askin’ me way too many questions I told’er that I’m a good felon (I’m good) [Bridge] (Uh) Tomato ([splat] Uh, uh [splat]) Potato ([splat], Uh, uh) Celery (Celery, uh, uh) Tomato (soup, you get turn into soup, you get turn into soup, ...) Tomato (Uh, uh) Celery (Uh, uh) Tomato (Uh) Celery. Soup (Uh) Broccoli You get turn into soup (You get turn into soup) You get turn into soup (You get turn into soup) You get put on the news (On the TV screen) You not gettin’ no views (No you not) You got it confused like a [bandit too?] Watch who you talkin’ too This shit could damage you Bitch got me sick so I callin’ her Tamiflu I told you I don’t ask me why I’m mad at you [Chorus] Who’d you say was broke? Not me It’s definitely not me, bitch how bout you Who’d you say fell off? Not me It’s probably you or somethin’ (huh) Who’d you say was broke not me Who’d you say was broke I got big bank rolls Yeah I got knots on me (On me) (Yeah, let’s go) Got way too much guap Got too much drop on me (Drop) Got way too much ops ’Cause they can’t move like me Hold’up Bitch get the fuck up out my way when I’m steppin’ through When my money [kiss?] Nah I didn’t use a steppin’ scale Get high every day No I don’t have a schedule (Nah) Hit up [?] That’s a easy lil’ band or two Lil boy broke fell off he ask me if I manage you (huh) [Outro] (Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go, let’s go) (Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go, let’s go) (Whoo, whoo!) (Let’s go, let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["Got way too much ops"], "meaning": "This is not a real song the song is here: Yeat – Soup", "annotation_id": "30503402", "url": "https://genius.com/30503402", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
