{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stood Taller", "line": "Cutlis", "vault_lines": ["I was pushing wide-body Cutlis, you Impala"], "meaning": "Yeat, in the year of 2021, had judged the listener after observing the listener (you, in the lyric’s case) driving a reliable, yet cheap-to-afford vehicle like a Chevrolet Impala, whilst Yeat was sporting a Range Rover “Cutlass” car.", "annotation_id": "34761523", "url": "https://genius.com/34761523", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
