{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "I ain’t tryna hear your music, turn it off, that shit some trash", "vault_lines": ["I ain't tryna hear your music, turn it off, that shit some trash"], "meaning": "This is referring to Yeat’s old friend, Autumn, that copied his style in one of his songs. After Yeat saw that song, Yeat posted on his story, “Mf really tryna sound like me bro go do some else dat shit suck” (Probably or he might just be referring to one of his other previous beefs but thats what first came to mind).", "annotation_id": "32157685", "url": "https://genius.com/32157685", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "Pull up to the show, and I’m breakin’ the ceiling (Turn up)", "vault_lines": ["Pull up to the show, and I'm breakin' the ceiling (Turn up)"], "meaning": "He is saying that his shows are so exciting, energetic, and the “roof blows off”.", "annotation_id": "29635726", "url": "https://genius.com/29635726", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "Percs, they gon’ take me, I booted up, yeah (Booted up)", "vault_lines": ["Percs, they gon' take me, I booted up, yeah (Booted up)"], "meaning": "Kind of saying he got so high, that the perc or x has taken him over. he has no control of him self the përcs are controlling him.", "annotation_id": "29635718", "url": "https://genius.com/29635718", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "I touched me a mil’, and I bought me a building", "vault_lines": ["I touched me a mil', and I bought me a building"], "meaning": "Here we see Luh Kranky mentioning a “mil”, a slang term for “million”, referencing a million dollars. Although Yeat (Geek Pack) is not physically touching this “stack of racks”, dare I say, it is to infer he has an abundance of American currency in his bank account. Yeat next implies he has purchased a physical building with all of his revenue brought in from a stupendous rapping career thus far.", "annotation_id": "28432894", "url": "https://genius.com/28432894", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "Bitch say she love me, she addicted to crank (Whew, whew)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch say she love me, she addicted to crank (Whew, whew)"], "meaning": "The original lyric says “Krank” not “crack”. I interpret this meaning she is in love with someone else and not Noah. She is only in love with the clout.", "annotation_id": "27716581", "url": "https://genius.com/27716581", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "I been outside in the Lamb’, you don’t even have you a car (Ooh-ooh)", "vault_lines": ["I been outside in the Lamb', you don't even have you a car (Ooh-ooh)"], "meaning": "When Yeat says “Lamb” hes most likely referring to a Lamborghini which is an Italian luxury supercar brand. Basically he’s saying that he’s in these expensive cars when you (a regular person) don’t even have a car.", "annotation_id": "25348946", "url": "https://genius.com/25348946", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "I just pulled up in the Track’, hundred-forty, watch it fall", "vault_lines": ["I just pulled up in the Track', hundred-forty, watch it fall"], "meaning": "“Track” is a shortened name of the Jeep Grand Cherokee Track Hawk", "annotation_id": "25262122", "url": "https://genius.com/25262122", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "I ain’t tryna hear your music, turn it off, that shit some trash", "vault_lines": ["I ain't tryna hear your music, turn it off, that shit some trash"], "meaning": "This is most likely Yeat making a reference to all of the clones who have popped up and started stealing yeats whole style and brand", "annotation_id": "25262113", "url": "https://genius.com/25262113", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "All of you rappers be soundin’ the same, bitch, I couldn’t even tell you apart", "vault_lines": ["All of you rappers be soundin' the same, bitch, I couldn't even tell you apart"], "meaning": "Most rappers either mumble rap or use autotune, so it’s hard to identify what rapper it is\n\nLUH CRANK LUH CRANK LUH CRANK", "annotation_id": "25216155", "url": "https://genius.com/25216155", "state": "pending", "votes": -16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
