{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Still countin", "line": "Big bag, lil’ Glock (Ooh-ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Big bag, lil' Glock (Ooh-ooh)"], "meaning": "This refers to Noah Oliver “Yeat” Smith “Bag” being big. which is poetic comparison to his money being of substanial size, as Bag is slang for money. Yeats oppa stoppa also know as his glock, is also refered too as lil (little), because Yeat does what he wants", "annotation_id": "25160299", "url": "https://genius.com/25160299", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
