{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I just walk around my mansion, let my nuts hang", "vault_lines": ["I just walk around my mansion, let my nuts hang"], "meaning": "Noah briefly, yet, explicitly describes the way in which he waltzes around his home – with his testicles hanging low.\n\nAt the time of this recording, Yeat would stay at Airbnb’s around Los Angeles with buddies and collaborators Kankan, SeptembersRich, and Two Cup Terry. However, Yeat did in fact recently purchase a real mansion which he now owns. Whether or not he continues to walk around this mansion with his balls hanging is unknown.", "annotation_id": "28316784", "url": "https://genius.com/28316784", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "Yeah, one of my bitch a junkie, she a fried bitch", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, one of my bitch a junkie, she a fried bitch"], "meaning": "A junky or junkie is a drug addict, many junkies need their drugs to function on a day to day basis. Being fried means to be high or intoxicated off of a drug or drink.", "annotation_id": "27181889", "url": "https://genius.com/27181889", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I take the Perc’ and meditate, I’m a fuckin’ monk", "vault_lines": ["I take the Perc' and meditate, I'm a fuckin' monk"], "meaning": "Yeat tend to get a lüh geeky while ascending to enlightenment.", "annotation_id": "27114795", "url": "https://genius.com/27114795", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "Yeah, I, I, I just walk in with the I, I, with the same gang I got rich with the same gang", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I, I, I just walk in with the"], "meaning": "Since the rise of celebrities, some have been subject to claims that they have “switched up” on their comrades from the earlier stages of the celebrity’s career. Yeat, however, is not among these types of celebrities; he makes sure to let ya know that he not only struck gold with his Twizzys, but also still walks in with them wherever he goes.", "annotation_id": "26326297", "url": "https://genius.com/26326297", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "Bitch, it’s been fuck what they said, yeah, TwizzyRich", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, it's been fuck what they said, yeah, TwizzyRich"], "meaning": "TwizzyRich is a record label created by Noah Oliver Smith, who is equally as recognized by his stage name “Yeat”", "annotation_id": "25924657", "url": "https://genius.com/25924657", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "Yeah, I was shippin’ ‘za, I was shippin’ skunk", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I was shippin' 'za, I was shippin' skunk"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about how he used to deal drugs, by shipping them. In this bar he talks about dealing weed, as “Za” is short for “Zaza”, and skunk is another name for weed due to weeds smell being very similar to that of a skunk.", "annotation_id": "24929635", "url": "https://genius.com/24929635", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "Yeah, I was shippin’ ‘za, I was shippin’ skunk", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I was shippin' 'za, I was shippin' skunk"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about how he used to deal drugs, by shipping them. In this bar he talks about dealing weed, as “Za” is short for “Zaza”, and skunk is another name for weed due to weeds smell being very similar to that of a skunk.", "annotation_id": "24929611", "url": "https://genius.com/24929611", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I be walkin’ ’round my mansion, let my nuts hang", "vault_lines": ["I be walkin' 'round my mansion, let my nuts hang"], "meaning": "In this lyric, Yeat describes how his level of success has led to two things: his ownership of a large house has allowed him to live a relaxed lifestyle; letting him explore his manor with his genitals free, a sign that he has made it in the world. Yeat’s poetic “show don’t tell” method of rapping evokes an emotion that is difficult to describe. I too, would one day like to walk around a mansion and let my nuts hang.", "annotation_id": "24141727", "url": "https://genius.com/24141727", "state": "pending", "votes": 30, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I just touched an M, Buffet rich (Milli’)", "vault_lines": ["I just touched an M, Buffet rich (Milli')"], "meaning": "Yeat just acquired a million dollars and is feeling as rich as the billionaire Warren Buffet. Buffet owns the Berkshire Hathaway conglomerate and is estimated to be worth a hundred billion dollars.", "annotation_id": "23950792", "url": "https://genius.com/23950792", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I be higher than God, bitch, I’m a crane", "vault_lines": ["I be higher than God, bitch, I'm a crane"], "meaning": "Yeat referring to himself as a ‘crane’ could be in reference to either the bird or the construction machines. While the tallest crane machine, the Kroll K10000, reaches nearly 500ft tall, it is more likely that he is referring to the birds which can fly at heights of over 12,500ft.", "annotation_id": "23950777", "url": "https://genius.com/23950777", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Stayëd tha same", "line": "I take the Perc’ and meditate, I’m a fucking monk", "vault_lines": ["I take the Perc' and meditate, I'm a fucking monk"], "meaning": "Monks, whomst are a part of many religions, are known to meditate for long periods every day. They meditate in order to induce a heightened state of attention and awareness. When meditating they are very low energy and sit very still, basically sleeping. Yeat is comparing how he feels under the influence of a Percocet pill to a Monks mediation habits.", "annotation_id": "23928261", "url": "https://genius.com/23928261", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
