{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Soup", "line": "Uh, uh, tomato (Splat, splat), woo, woo, woo Uh, uh, uh, potato (Splat, phew, phew-phew), woo, woo Uh, uh, celery (Celery, phew), tomato (Soup, soup, soup, soup) (Ooh, ooh, ooh) He get turned into soup, he get turned into soup (Bih) (Uh, uh, tomato) He get turned into soup, he get turned into soup (Bih, bih) (Uh, uh, celery) He get turned into soup, he get turned into soup (Bih) (Uh, uh tomato) Celery, soup, broth He get turned into soup, he get turned into soup He get turned into soup, he get turned into soup He get put on the news (On the TV screen)", "vault_lines": ["Uh, uh, tomato (Splat, splat), woo, woo, woo"], "meaning": "Yeat is comparing killing somebody to making soup, comparing his insides to ingredients and his dead body to the finished soup. At the end he gets put on the news, as do most murders.", "annotation_id": "27548093", "url": "https://genius.com/27548093", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Soup", "line": "And I, rock Moncleezy, winterwear, anywhere (Nah ah)", "vault_lines": ["And I, rock Moncleezy, winterwear, anywhere (Nah ah)"], "meaning": "Moncleezy is a nickname for Moncler, originally coined by frequent collaborator Summrs, then popularized by Autumn!/Twinuzis.", "annotation_id": "27548092", "url": "https://genius.com/27548092", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
