{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "(Wake up, F1LTHY)", "vault_lines": ["Phew, phew (Woo), yeah (Yeah)"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag of F1LTHY. It’s unknown who voices the line, but you can distinctly hear a female voice. The chirp sound heard in the first part of the tag is sampled from the Nextel Motorola. The tag itself first made an appearance on Karmah & Phlegm’s July 2014 track “Racks Up Part II”, featuring Avi Twat.\n\nIt’s also worth noting that there is an alternate version to the tag, as used on Goth Money’s October 2015 track “Young Taliban”. The alternate tag line goes:\n\nWake up F1LTHY, you little fuck boy", "annotation_id": "35297891", "url": "https://genius.com/35297891", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "(Wake up, F1LTHY)", "vault_lines": ["Phew, phew (Woo), yeah (Yeah)"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag of F1LTHY. It’s unknown who voices the line, but you can distinctly hear a female voice. The chirp sound heard in the first part of the tag is sampled from the Nextel Motorola. The tag itself first made an appearance on Karmah & Phlegm’s July 2014 track “Racks Up Part II”, featuring Avi Twat.\n\nIt’s also worth noting that there is an alternate version to the tag, as used on Goth Money’s October 2015 track “Young Taliban”. The alternate tag line goes:\n\nWake up F1LTHY, you little fuck boy", "annotation_id": "35297889", "url": "https://genius.com/35297889", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "They be high talkin’ crazy, look, they don’t really got courage", "vault_lines": ["They be high talkin' crazy, look, they don't really got courage"], "meaning": "This could possibly be a reference to the Cartoon Network series “Courage the Cowardly Dog.”", "annotation_id": "29813587", "url": "https://genius.com/29813587", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
