{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "And to be honest, they can’t even do it like me, so I could care less", "vault_lines": ["And to be honest, they can't even do it like me, so I could care less"], "meaning": "Yeat knows that other rappers aren’t on the same level as him so he doesn’t care.", "annotation_id": "27946996", "url": "https://genius.com/27946996", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "I don’t even flex a lot, but when I do, couple peoples embarrassed", "vault_lines": ["I don't even flex a lot, but when I do, couple peoples embarrassed"], "meaning": "Yeat explains how he doesn’t flex often but when the circumstance of him doing so, people become embarrassed of how much wealthier Yeat is.", "annotation_id": "27946970", "url": "https://genius.com/27946970", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "They watching everything I do, repeat it like parrots", "vault_lines": ["They watching everything I do, repeat it like parrots"], "meaning": "Parrots are notorious for the way they repeat humans and human behavior. Yeat is saying people are copying his style.", "annotation_id": "26776757", "url": "https://genius.com/26776757", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "I told the dealership I’m a star, put it in the ceilings", "vault_lines": ["I told the dealership I'm a star, put it in the ceilings"], "meaning": "The luxury car company Rolls-Royce offers\nstarlight headliners in a few of their models, so\nbecause Yeat is a “star” he would like for his car\nto reflect this stardom as-well.", "annotation_id": "26053213", "url": "https://genius.com/26053213", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "I’m knowing this album ’bout to go platinum, put it on my parents (Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["I'm knowing this album 'bout to go platinum, put it on my parents (Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh)"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat shows his undying trust in his music. He says he, “puts it on” his parents.\n\n“Putting it on” something is a popular metaphor in new age culture, meaning to have so much trust in something, that you would give up said thing you “put it on”, if the promised event did not occur.", "annotation_id": "25679243", "url": "https://genius.com/25679243", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "I been takin’ the Perc’ for anxiety, but I don’t get nervous", "vault_lines": ["I been takin' the Perc' for anxiety, but I don't get nervous"], "meaning": "It seems that Yeat was prescribed the Percocet he’s been taking to treat anxiety, but he admits to not experiencing symptoms that would require medication. This line could be referring to Yeat lying to a doctor about his symptoms in order to obtain more prescription medication.", "annotation_id": "25509008", "url": "https://genius.com/25509008", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Smooktobër", "line": "Tapped in with the fashion, pulled up on Virgil outside in Paris (Ooh, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Tapped in with the fashion, pulled up on Virgil outside in Paris (Ooh, ooh)"], "meaning": "Virgil Abloh is a fashion designer most notable for making designs like Off-White and Louis Vitton (L.V). In November, It was announced that the late designer has passed away due to a two-year-battle against a rare cancer.\n\nYeat has mentioned the late artist name on “No fëelingz”.\n\nRockin' brand new L.V., Virgil sent the newest drip (Uh-uh)\n\nHe also mentioned his name on “All Lies”\n\nI just called Virgil, I told him I need the newest bag, bitch", "annotation_id": "25152385", "url": "https://genius.com/25152385", "state": "pending", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
