{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slimd Em Out", "line": "Just touched down, just touched down, I’m at LAX (LAX, phew) Just touched, (Go) just touched down with a pound of X (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Just touched down, just touched down, I'm at LAX (LAX, phew)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying he just touched down on a plane at LAX (Los Angeles Internation Airport), with a pound of ecstasy (X).", "annotation_id": "27920799", "url": "https://genius.com/27920799", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
