{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "I got ’em sick, Corona", "vault_lines": [", I got 'em sick, Corona"], "meaning": "Here Yeat references “Corona” also known as “Coronavirus” which is a type of virus that can cause respiratory illness in humans. The current strain, known as COVID-19, was first identified in 2019 and became a global pandemic. It spreads through respiratory droplets and close contact with infected individuals. Symptoms can range from mild to severe and can include fever, cough, and difficulty breathing. Prevention measures such as wearing masks, social distancing, and vaccination can help reduce the spread of the virus.", "annotation_id": "28464071", "url": "https://genius.com/28464071", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "Standin’ on these pussies and I’m rich", "vault_lines": ["Standin' on these pussies and I'm rich"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat is stating how he is above all the people hating on and/or not supporting him. Yeat then further adds salt to the wound by saying he’s rich, because the pussies in question are most likely not on his level financially either.", "annotation_id": "28464070", "url": "https://genius.com/28464070", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "Pulled up in that Porsche, seven hundred horses", "vault_lines": ["Pulled up in that Porsche, seven hundred horses"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to the The 2018 911 GT2 RS. With 700 horsepower, it sits at a price tag of $300,000.", "annotation_id": "28145972", "url": "https://genius.com/28145972", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "Slam, I be slidin’ in ’em (BNYX)", "vault_lines": ["Slam, I be slidin' in 'em (BNYX"], "meaning": "Benjamin Saint Fort, professionally known as BNYX® (pronounced Benny X), is a record producer from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He is known for his production for Lancey Foux, Yeat, and Lil Uzi Vert among others.", "annotation_id": "27971570", "url": "https://genius.com/27971570", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
