{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "Slam, I got", "vault_lines": ["Slam, I got red bottom (I-I-I'm working on dying)"], "meaning": ":SLAMMM I GOT RED BUTTON!!\n\n-this is in reference too a red switch, suitably for the 9x Glock/ Glock 19 usually. This added feature the the pistol more often turns the semi automatic pistol full auto! Which is a federal crime that can land you 5-15 years of jail time. (Hence why he said it in a distorted way whilst starting his intro verse )", "annotation_id": "27938441", "url": "https://genius.com/27938441", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Slamm", "line": "If I jump up off this bridge, my fuckin’ fans are jumpin’ off with me (Yeah, my cult, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["If I jump up off this bridge, my fuckin' fans arе jumpin' off with me (Yeah, my cult, yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is comparing himself to James Warren Jones , inferring that his fans love him so much that they kill themselves if he does as well", "annotation_id": "27929114", "url": "https://genius.com/27929114", "state": "pending", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
