{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Skervem", "line": "[Open Verse]", "vault_lines": ["I've been countin' up, don't give no fucks, I'm on that big shit"], "meaning": "“Guap” is slang for money. Yeat boasts about counting his cash, then mentions that he “had to stop,” though he doesn’t specify the reason.", "annotation_id": "40139628", "url": "https://genius.com/40139628", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
