{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sit bakk", "line": "(Damn, Trgc made that?)", "vault_lines": ["I just been so high, been with the gods (Yeah), been with the birds, yeah (Yeah) (Damn, Trgc made that?)"], "meaning": "Jammarius Hill, better known as Trgc, is an American record producer. He is best known for co-producing some of American rapper Yeat’s biggest hits, most notably “Sorry Bout That,” “Monëy so big,” and “Money Twërk.”\n\nHe has also notably produced for Lil Yachty, SoFaygo, Yung Mal, and Summrs, among others.", "annotation_id": "41600585", "url": "https://genius.com/41600585", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
