{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sit bakk", "line": "Flawless VVS the diamonds, these bitches McFlurry (Yeah, McFlurry)", "vault_lines": ["Flawless VVS the diamonds, these bitches McFlurry (Yeah, McFlurry)"], "meaning": "Yeat compares his high-end VVS diamonds to a McDonald’s McFlurry. Since VVS is a high rating for diamond clarity, the white icy look of his jewelry literally reminds him of a cold McFlurry. It’s just another way for him to flex how frozen his chains are.", "annotation_id": "41600553", "url": "https://genius.com/41600553", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
