{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sit bakk", "line": "[Chorus] (Swerve) What’s a swerve to a swerve? Yeah (Yeah) I just been so high, been with the gods (Yeah), been with the birds, yeah (Yeah) (Damn, Trgc made that?) Three ecstasy pills and a Perc’ (X) Ecstasy pills and a Perc’, left the Earth (Perc’) Yeah, go berserk (Phew) All my money twerk (Twerk) Money flirt (Yeah), in a hurry (Hurry) Flawless VVS the diamonds, these bitches McFlurry (Yeah, McFlurry) Twizzy pull up with the buh-buh-buh, yeah, Curry (Phew, phew) Yeah, I don’t give no fuck-fuck-fuck, I’m still sippin’ dirty (Yeah) Yeah, I just took the Lamb’ out the shop, yeah (Swerve) Boy, the way you ridin’ ‘round it, you gon’ turn a twelve o’clock (Woah) I just took it up a notch (Turn it up a–, yeah) Yeah, went and put baguettes all in my watch (Baguettey) Yeah, you ain’t with the gang, ain’t with the mob (Mob) Sit back and watch, yeah Inside the Cayenne all brown, it’s butter scotch (Ack) Yeah, hunnids, big money, got a whole lotta bread,", "vault_lines": ["I just been so high, been with the gods (Yeah), been with the birds, yeah (Yeah) (Damn, Trgc made that?)"], "meaning": "arfiumy bad\ndhvsgerhjgfuygjuivghbdcghjhjbvn bro my stomach hurts not even trying to be funnyimgonna take a turd ahahhahahhahahahsahahhahahhah6766767854879475", "annotation_id": "37877190", "url": "https://genius.com/37877190", "state": "pending", "votes": -9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
