{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Simplë", "line": "Tatted the Devil on me, so it’s two more six’s", "vault_lines": ["Tatted the Devil on me, so it's two more six's"], "meaning": "Yeat claims he has a connection to the devil, and even got a satanic tattoo, a Sigil on his arm, among others.\n\nTwo more six refers to the devil’s number, 666.", "annotation_id": "26601556", "url": "https://genius.com/26601556", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Simplë", "line": "A year ago, they wasn’t tryna sound like me (No)", "vault_lines": ["A year ago, they wasn't tryna sound like me (No)"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to his explosive growth following the release of his album 4L, where many emerging and established artists alike copied his style and beat selection to try to land their own hits.", "annotation_id": "26601533", "url": "https://genius.com/26601533", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Simplë", "line": "A year ago, I had Chanelly’s on my feet", "vault_lines": ["A year ago, I had Chanelly's on my feet"], "meaning": "Chanelly is a nickname for the designer brand Chanel.", "annotation_id": "26601525", "url": "https://genius.com/26601525", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Simplë", "line": "Not no SI, all my diamonds swim like Michael Phelps", "vault_lines": ["Not no SI, all my diamonds swim like Michael Phelps"], "meaning": "Michael Fred Phelps II is an American former competitive swimmer. He is the most successful and most decorated Olympian of all time with a total of 28 medals. Yeat claims his diamonds are swimming, similar to dripping, just like the famous swimmer.", "annotation_id": "26601511", "url": "https://genius.com/26601511", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Simplë", "line": "Forgiatos", "vault_lines": ["Got a brand new Trackhawk Jeep got Forgiatos"], "meaning": "Forgiato, or Forgiato Designs, is an American company based in Los Angeles, California. The company was founded in 2006. It designs and builds wheels for performance cars, which are built in the United States. The company holds an annual festival, Forgiato Fest, to showcase their wheels", "annotation_id": "26601499", "url": "https://genius.com/26601499", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
