{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Shhhh", "line": "Yeah, I’m poppin’ the X again, really I’m off of the hose til’ I feel again (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm poppin' the X again, really I'm off of the hose til' I feel again (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In this line Yeat describes his repetitive drug abuse and claims to be “off of the hoes til' I feel again” this may be linked to his battles with his demons showing that he feels emotionless and needs to teak a break from love until his feelings return.", "annotation_id": "28464232", "url": "https://genius.com/28464232", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Shhhh", "line": "Pull up, Isis flag, need no coupe, watch you sled", "vault_lines": ["Pull up, Isis flag, need no coupe, watch you sled"], "meaning": "Yeat is right in that the typical vehicle ISIS terrorists use is not a coupe, but real life Tonka trucks: the Toyota Hilux!\n\nhttps://www.businessinsider.com/why-isis-uses-toyota-trucks-2015-10", "annotation_id": "28226608", "url": "https://genius.com/28226608", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Shhhh", "line": "This shit like Hocus Pocus, tryna get your money, bitch, you turn to a fan", "vault_lines": ["This shit like Hocus Pocus, tryna get your money, bitch, you turn to a fan"], "meaning": "“Hocus Pocus” typically refers to the actions or words an illusionist would use during their magic tricks to distract their audience from noticing them such as sleight of hand.\n\nYeat is using this term as an analogy to how his music is the Hocus Pocus behind the trick of taking money from those who stream  his discography, buy his merch, or go to his concerts.\n\nAnother bonus is that the line can also be interpreted where Yeat is the magician and is literally changing people to fans.", "annotation_id": "28226522", "url": "https://genius.com/28226522", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
