{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Screwed Up", "line": "Outta H-Town, it get screwed up", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, I'm still in my bag, outta H-Town, it get screwed up"], "meaning": "H-Town / Screwston / DJ Screw", "annotation_id": "38974862", "url": "https://genius.com/38974862", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Screwed Up", "line": "Outta H-Town, it get screwed up", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, I'm still in my bag, outta H-Town, it get screwed up"], "meaning": "“H-Town” is a nickname for Houston, Texas. The line “it get screwed up” also points to the city’s rap culture, especially the influence of DJ Screw, who helped create the chopped and screwed sound that became one of Houston’s most recognizable musical styles. So the lyric connects Houston itself with a sound and identity that are closely tied to the city.", "annotation_id": "38974851", "url": "https://genius.com/38974851", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
