{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "If I told you I love you, I lied, I was high, I’m sorry it’s a simple mistake (High) I’m asking my demon to give me forgiveness for all of the good and the hate (Argh) I hope you don’t listen to shit that I tell you, unless you wanna go that way (Woah)", "vault_lines": ["If I told you I love you, I lied, I was high, I'm sorry it's a simplе mistake (High)"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat reflects on his mistakes off the drugs, and how his demons will react to his actions. He also tells us to only listen to him if we’re gonna follow through with it.", "annotation_id": "27548302", "url": "https://genius.com/27548302", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "I’m not here for the politicking, I stay out the way (Way) They stay watching they every move (Why), tryna see how the hell we so paid (What, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I stay out the way, cause I get way, way, way too paid (Real)"], "meaning": "Yeat stays out the way and isn’t very involved, but those jealous of him still manage to figure out what he’s doing and who he’s with. Instead of doing their own thing, they look at the successful to copy them.", "annotation_id": "27548295", "url": "https://genius.com/27548295", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "Told ’em I’m ready to go, ready to change my life (Life) Yeah, they already seen that I went up, now it’s time to go up twice (Go)", "vault_lines": ["Told 'em I'm ready to go, ready to change my life (Life)"], "meaning": "Yeat may be insinuating him proving his worth to his “Demons”, who have helped him in his music career. He’s asking them to change his life.", "annotation_id": "27547521", "url": "https://genius.com/27547521", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "Twizzy got rid of the rest of the chicken, that boy going MIA", "vault_lines": ["Twizzy got rid of the rest of the chicken, that boy going MIA"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying his twizzy (twin) either shipped out or sold all the cocaine in his possession, then went MIA (Missing in action), implying he was avoiding suspicion.", "annotation_id": "26620252", "url": "https://genius.com/26620252", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "I remember back in the day, as a kid, asking a bitch for a TBH", "vault_lines": ["I remember back in the day, as a kid, asking a bitch for a TBH"], "meaning": "In social media TBH is used when a follower tells an account owner to explain to them what they think of them, how they feel about them, etc.", "annotation_id": "26620237", "url": "https://genius.com/26620237", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "line": "Brand new crib in the hills with a view of the city, call MTV (Brr)", "vault_lines": ["Brand new crib in the hills with a view of the city, call MTV (Brr)"], "meaning": "MTV Cribs is an American documentary television show that originated on MTV and features tours of the private homes of celebrities.", "annotation_id": "26620236", "url": "https://genius.com/26620236", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Sacrafice", "status": "done", "targets": 6, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Yeat-sacrafice-lyrics", "genius_title": "Sacrafice", "genius_id": 8338188, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SYMPATHY4ME", "line": "Don’t gotta explain for all the haters, I gotta keep it on the hush (Shh) Don’t give it out, don’t share too much, keep it on a— (Shh)", "vault_lines": ["Don't gotta explain for all the haters, I gotta keep it on the hush (Shh)"], "meaning": "Yeat uses a clever wordplay here with “keep it hush.” The phrase usually means to keep something secret, but he extends it into the next line with “keep it on a—,” cutting himself off before finishing the sentence. That pause adds to the secrecy and makes it feel like he’s intentionally hiding information from outsiders and haters. The repeated “shh” ad-lib reinforces the idea of silence, privacy, and not revealing too much.", "annotation_id": "39907580", "url": "https://genius.com/39907580", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
