{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "Yeah, got this Rolls-Royce (I don’t give a fuck) Got this Rolls-Royce truck", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, got this Rolls-Royce (I don't give a fuck)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to the Rolls-Royce Cullinan, a British Luxury SUV. Yeat is always seen in and always mentions luxury SUV’s, such as the Lamborghini Urus and Mercedes GLE.", "annotation_id": "33333551", "url": "https://genius.com/33333551", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "I like it, when I’m on this private jet, oh, I like it", "vault_lines": ["I like it, when I'm on this private jet, oh, I like it"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying here that he likes being on his private jet. Private jets are very expensive and thus it is rare to be on them, therefore Yeat is enjoying the riches he has.", "annotation_id": "33333538", "url": "https://genius.com/33333538", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "I’m on X too", "vault_lines": ["I'm on X too"], "meaning": "X is a derived term for Ecstacy, a commonly used drug with many rappers such as Yeat and Ken Carson. Yeat being on X is a very common appearance with Yeat, as he has mentioned this many times previously in his songs, Such as Up off X.", "annotation_id": "33241179", "url": "https://genius.com/33241179", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "We always run it up, huh, greyhound (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["We always run it up, huh, greyhound (Woo)"], "meaning": "Greyhounds are common racing dogs, symbolizing going up fast.", "annotation_id": "32741633", "url": "https://genius.com/32741633", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "X games", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, got this coke, white, the pope, I'm on X games"], "meaning": "A triple entendre referring to doing X, the drug; X games, the sport; and going X games mode (which means doing something extreme).", "annotation_id": "32741568", "url": "https://genius.com/32741568", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "STYLE LYFE", "line": "She love when she bike", "vault_lines": ["And I'm high all night, she love when she bike"], "meaning": "“She love me, she bite” is probably referring to a hickey\n\n“Hickey” is a slang term for a bruise caused by sucking or kissing a person’s skin (also biting, which leaves in a deeper scar)", "annotation_id": "31721451", "url": "https://genius.com/31721451", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
