{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SPEEDBALL", "line": "You ain’t never did none of the shit that you said you gon’ do, but you gon’ be yourself", "vault_lines": ["(Yeah) You ain't never did none of the shit that you said you gon' do, but you gon' be yourself"], "meaning": "Yeat points out that talk is cheap with a fatalistic twist – that despite what people say they are going to do, he expects their eventual default to never doing anything, because that’s who they are.", "annotation_id": "33532214", "url": "https://genius.com/33532214", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SPEEDBALL", "line": "Bands, I get these motherfuckin’ bands and I put it all on top", "vault_lines": ["Bands, I get these motherfuckin' bands and I put it all on top"], "meaning": "Yeat is talking about accumulating a lot of money. “bands” refer to stacks of cash. A band equals $1 thousand.", "annotation_id": "33449048", "url": "https://genius.com/33449048", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
