{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SOSAYEAT", "line": "This song will never be dropped unless it’s Sosa on it (Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm)", "vault_lines": ["This song will never be dropped unless it's Sosa on it (Mm-mm-mm-mm-mm)"], "meaning": "Right here, Yeat deliberately announces to the listeners of this song that it will never be dropped unless Sosa (also known as Chief Keef) is featured on it, hence why it stayed unreleased.\n\n\n\nPROPOSED SUGGESTION: Weiland likely might have been able to supply Yeat with a possible Chief Keef feature around this time as well.", "annotation_id": "36845760", "url": "https://genius.com/36845760", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
