{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SO WHAT", "line": "[Chorus]", "vault_lines": ["And I'm high, so what? And I'm rich, so what? (Woo)"], "meaning": "Yeat has reached a level of fame and success where he feels entirely detached from the need for external validation, openly boasting about his wealth, constant intoxication, and the presence of his girlfriend by his side. His unapologetic attitude is reinforced by his nonchalant dismissal of these flexes, often responding with “so what,” signaling that he doesn’t care how others perceive him. This indifference is further emphasized in the track “More” from his album 2093, where he raps, “Put a condo on the moon so they can’t talk to us (Huh, huh).” This line encapsulates his sense of superiority, suggesting he views himself as existing on a plane so elevated—figuratively and literally—that ordinary people can’t even reach him. The metaphor of the moon condo symbolizes not just his wealth but his complete separation from societal norms, reinforcing his stance that he’s beyond critique, unreachable, and indifferent to the opinions of others.", "annotation_id": "33332183", "url": "https://genius.com/33332183", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SO WHAT", "line": "Yeah, yeah, you fake streams, you fakin’ this money, you fakin’ views", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, yeah, you fake streams, you fakin' this money, you fakin' views"], "meaning": "Could possibly be a Rich Amiri diss as he faked streams before also could relate to French Montana", "annotation_id": "33329556", "url": "https://genius.com/33329556", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SO WHAT", "line": "I got these shades on me, ’cause I’m fried", "vault_lines": ["I got these shades on me, 'cause I'm fried"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying here that he has sunglasses on him as he is high, and being high can make your eyes appear bloodshot. Therefore he is wearing sunglasses to hide this.", "annotation_id": "33323616", "url": "https://genius.com/33323616", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SO WHAT", "line": "Yeah, she like when she come, she love when she cum too", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, she like when she come, she love when she cum too"], "meaning": "This bar is a double entendre, the woman in question (presumably his girlfriend Symone Ryley) loves coming to visit him. The other interpretation of this would be that the woman loves having sex with Yeat every time she visits.", "annotation_id": "33319311", "url": "https://genius.com/33319311", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
