{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SKLUB", "line": "I fuckin’ hate these people, people afraid of me I put money in your pocket, you switch up on me", "vault_lines": ["I fuckin' hatе these peoplе, people afraid of me"], "meaning": "Yeat could be referencing his old “Twizzy”, SeptembersRich and calling him out in this bar.\n\nThey are beefing because SeptembersRich was accused scamming fans and engaging in bad activities and switching up on Yeat.", "annotation_id": "30949503", "url": "https://genius.com/30949503", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SKLUB", "line": "Trust me, I know shit get hard, that’s why you can’t run", "vault_lines": ["Trust me, I know shit get hard, that's why you can't run"], "meaning": "Yeat may be talking about life in general, how he said he knows shit gets hard and you cannot “run” from your sins, and karma gon' eventually reach up to you.", "annotation_id": "28393350", "url": "https://genius.com/28393350", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "SKLUB", "line": "I would know shit get hard, that’s where I came from", "vault_lines": ["I would know shit get hard, that's where I came from"], "meaning": "Yeat has a very distinctive past with drugs, and it is still ongoing to this day! He has mentioned drugs at least once in most of his songs so other get the point and understanding of how much a “junkie” he is.\n\n“Bitch, I be high on these drugs every day of my life\nI don’t know at all if I should quit or not (Woo, woo)” Sorry bout that – Yeat\n\n“I’m on the Perc' so I call up my bae like,” Sorry bout that – Yeat\n\n“When I’m talking ‘bout lean I’m talking 'bout Wock’, that’s my favorite drug, got me slow like a slug (Yeah)” Cali – Yeat\n\n“Back in the day, I was pill poppin', big junkie” Slamm – Yeat\n\n“I will take Percs on a bus, I took the nearest stop (Give me them)” Talk 2 God – Yeat", "annotation_id": "28393167", "url": "https://genius.com/28393167", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
