{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rëal six", "line": "It be your own city that’ll kill you, like R.I.P. Nip", "vault_lines": ["It be your own city that'll kill you, like R.I.P. Nip"], "meaning": "Yeat pays homage to the “Victory Lap” rapper Nipsey Hussle, who was shot ten times and killed in March of 2019 in his hometown of Los Angeles, California.", "annotation_id": "24600554", "url": "https://genius.com/24600554", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
