{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Run Thëy Mouth", "line": "You always talking but I ain’t heard a thing (I ain’t heard shit)", "vault_lines": ["You always talking but I ain't heard a thing (I ain't heard shit)"], "meaning": "Relating to the mass amount of hate and backlash all rappers get including himself, though Yeat suggests he doesn’t listen to any of it and could care less what people think.", "annotation_id": "30907457", "url": "https://genius.com/30907457", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Run Thëy Mouth", "line": "You red, you need to take a breath before you pass out", "vault_lines": ["You red, you need to take a breath before you pass out"], "meaning": "Yeat may be referencing Playboi Carti’s notoriously influential album ‘Whole Lotta Red’, which is supported by track 3 being titled ‘Stop Breathing’.\n\n\n\n‘𝘚𝘵𝘰𝘱 𝘉𝘳𝘦𝘢𝘵𝘩𝘪𝘯𝘨’, 𝘵𝘳𝘢𝘤𝘬 3 𝘰𝘧 ‘𝘞𝘩𝘰𝘭𝘦 𝘓𝘰𝘵𝘵𝘢 𝘙𝘦𝘥’\n\nWhole Lotta Red is often credited as one of the biggest factors in Yeat and his sound blowing up due to its popularisation of the ‘rage’ genre, with Yeat previously remixing songs off the album, notably including track 11 ‘Meh’ with Autumn, as well as track 15, ‘Punk Monk’.\n\n\n\n𝘠𝘦𝘢𝘵’𝘴 ’𝘗𝘶𝘯𝘬 𝘔𝘰𝘯𝘬’ 𝘳𝘦𝘮𝘪𝘹\n\nBoth artists are often drawn to comparison, even more so with both now returning to drop new music. Yeat references 4 of his post-WLR albums in the previous bar, showing the longevity of the album’s influence.", "annotation_id": "30905961", "url": "https://genius.com/30905961", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Run Thëy Mouth", "line": "I got four rings, four albums, bitch, I’m out", "vault_lines": ["I got four rings, four albums, bitch, I'm out"], "meaning": "Retirement, hes accomplished what he wanted", "annotation_id": "30902611", "url": "https://genius.com/30902611", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
