{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "Yeah, I know that you cappin’ in all of your raps, ’cause you don’t do shit ’bout the shit that you say", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I know that you cappin' in all of your raps, 'cause you don't do shit 'bout the shit that you say"], "meaning": "In this line, Yeat is accusing someone of lying or exaggerating in their rap lyrics. He is saying that this person doesn’t actually do any of the things they claim in their songs.", "annotation_id": "31810030", "url": "https://genius.com/31810030", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "Best believe I got Percs and they stashed in the attic, but I can’t talk ’bout it, they pass through quick", "vault_lines": ["Best believe I got Percs and they stashed in the attic, but I can't talk 'bout it, they pass through quick"], "meaning": "In this line, Yeat is saying that he has Percocet pills (a prescription pain medication) hidden in the attic. However, he notes that he can’t talk much about it because they are used up or moved quickly.", "annotation_id": "31810029", "url": "https://genius.com/31810029", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "When we pull up to cities, we buy all the drop, yeah, we buy all the lean, yeah, we sippin’ on Act", "vault_lines": ["When we pull up to cities, we buy all the drop, yeah, we buy all the lean, yeah, we sippin' on Act"], "meaning": "In this line, Yeat is saying that when they arrive in cities, they purchase all the “drop” (likely referring to a type of drug) and all the “lean” (a recreational drug mix of prescription cough syrup with codeine and soda). He specifies that they are drinking Actavis, a brand of cough syrup commonly used in making lean.", "annotation_id": "31810027", "url": "https://genius.com/31810027", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "I ain’t signin’ no deal ’less it’s more than I make, and then times it by eight because that’s what I said", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, this shit part two"], "meaning": "In this line, Yeat is saying he won’t sign a contract unless the amount offered is more than what he currently earns, multiplied by eight. This emphasizes his high financial expectations and self-worth.", "annotation_id": "31810026", "url": "https://genius.com/31810026", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
