{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "This is a Roley, that is a AP This is my story, I don’t care if they hate me This is a Roley, that is a AP This is a Roley (Let’s go), this is a Roley (Let’s go) This is a Roley, this is a Roley (Let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["This is a Roley, that is a AP"], "meaning": "Yeat repeatedly contrasts between a ‘Roley’ and a ‘'AP’. The ‘Roley’ he is referring to is most likely his, while the AP could his mates watch.\n\nIt is also possible that the AP is indeed his, and Yeat is just flexing his expensive watch collection.\n\nAlso, his ‘Roley’ refers to a Rolex™ which is an luxury watch company that sells ostentatious watches.\n\n\n\nLastly, the aforementioned ‘AP’ refers to Audemars Piguet™ which is also a luxury watch company that sells high-status watches.", "annotation_id": "29528891", "url": "https://genius.com/29528891", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "Money came in, it’s a Roley day", "vault_lines": ["Money came in, it's a Roley day"], "meaning": "Noah Oliver Smith tells his fans that whenever he receives his salary he goes and buys a Rolex, an expensive watch that only the highest of people own.", "annotation_id": "28634346", "url": "https://genius.com/28634346", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "You ain’t smokin’ on shit, you just smokin’ on mid, boy, what the fuck is a VLONE Runtz? (VLONE Runtz) Bro, we been off the E, I feel all electric like Elon Musk (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["You ain't smokin' on shit, you just smokin' on mid, boy, what the fuck is a VLONE Runtz? (VLONE Runtz)"], "meaning": "Likely a reference to the song “Elon Musk” by Lancey Foux\n\nhttps://genius.com/22998714", "annotation_id": "26682468", "url": "https://genius.com/26682468", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "RolËy DÆ 2", "line": "Yeah, all these diamonds on my body, yeah, muh’ fuckin’ carats, I feel like I’m Bugs (Eer)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, all these diamonds on my body, yeah, muh' fuckin' carats, I feel like I'm Bugs (Eer)"], "meaning": "Mr Yeat elaborates on how his diamonds have carats, this is a word play on Carrots. Mr Yeat later says he feels like Bugs, by Bugs he means the fictional character Bugs Bunny. Bunnies eat Carrots.", "annotation_id": "26039584", "url": "https://genius.com/26039584", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
