{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rollin", "line": "Big-body stizz or the Benz or the big-body Lam’, boy, that bitch ’bout to brrr Yeah, I just pulled up like a yankee, in London might shank you, the bitch ’bout to brrr", "vault_lines": ["Rollin', I'm just rollin', I'm just rollin' in the big body"], "meaning": "Yeat’s Benz and Lambroghini are so large and loud they make a “brrr” sound.\nYeat arriving in London from America makes him the yankee. London has a very high stabbing rate, as Jack the Ripper is one of the most common English serial killers. Yeat may be comparing himself to him in this instance.\n\nThese particular lyrics became a viral trend on Youtube and TikTok due to the speed and inflection of the way Yeat says them, making them indecipherable to most people.", "annotation_id": "25173654", "url": "https://genius.com/25173654", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rollin", "line": "I just pulled up outta Paris, then hit Saint Laurent (West)", "vault_lines": ["I just pulled up outta Paris, then hit Saint Laurent (West)"], "meaning": "Yeat states he went to Yves Saint Laurent (YSL) in Paris. Yeat is known for wearing YSL, mostly around 2022.\n\nYeat Wearing YSL Clothing:", "annotation_id": "37869279", "url": "https://genius.com/37869279", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
