{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rollin", "line": "All of my diamonds, they smackin’ the shit out of you like the motherfuckin’ lights", "vault_lines": ["All of my diamonds, they smackin' the shit out of you like the motherfuckin' lights"], "meaning": "Yeat claims that his diamonds are incredibly luxurious and grand, and upon witnessing them, his diamonds provide a disorienting effect similar to that of a sudden exposure to light, such as a light switch being flicked on prior to a lengthy period of darkness.\n\nGoing further in depth, Yeat’s diamonds are a reflection of himself, as a sudden, disorienting light that leaves a lasting effect on others. This could be implied due to Yeat’s new style of music, in comparison to other, more popular forms of rap from the likes of Kendrick Lamar.", "annotation_id": "29646022", "url": "https://genius.com/29646022", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rollin", "line": "Yeah, I ain’t even rock with nobody at all, so stop callin’ my phone, no advice", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I ain't even rock with nobody at all, so stop callin' my phone, no advice"], "meaning": "Yeat has said multiple times that he doesn’t like people in general and keeps his circle very very small, only a couple of people", "annotation_id": "28183557", "url": "https://genius.com/28183557", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rollin", "line": "My fans just like a cult, they read my Bible (Bible)", "vault_lines": ["My fans just like a cult, they read my Bible (Bible)"], "meaning": "Yeat is implying through his masterful wordplay and flow that he and his fans are almost similar to a cult where he is either the leader or a god and his followers read his Bible.\n\nThis is due to Yeat’s large amount of money and massive success that was strengthened through the use of his music on social media apps such as tiktok.", "annotation_id": "27930637", "url": "https://genius.com/27930637", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
