{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rokstar", "line": "I just bought a building ’cause I want one (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I just bought a building 'cause I want one (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat explains his acquirement of a new building just because he wanted one. This is used to display Yeat’s wealth and the vast quantity of money available to him; he can spend large amounts of money on things just “‘cause I want one”.", "annotation_id": "31017373", "url": "https://genius.com/31017373", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
