{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Risk", "line": "Yeah, when I stand on it, I’m 6'11, I’m Giannis tall", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, when I stand on it, I'm 6'11, I'm Giannis tall"], "meaning": "With this bar, Yeat pays homage to Lil Uzi Vert with his famous references to the height of his money and him standing on it: “In reality I’m 5'4\nStand on my money now I’m 6'6” – Uzi on Sanguine Paradise. Uzi has also referred to NBA players, like Scottie Pippen. In this bar, Yeat refers to 2 time NBA MVP and NBA champion Giannis Antetokounmpo, who is listed at 6'11.", "annotation_id": "26620195", "url": "https://genius.com/26620195", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
