{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rav3 p4rty", "line": "Fill him with lead (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah), make him slumber", "vault_lines": ["(Yeah, yeah) Fill him with lead (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah), make him slumber"], "meaning": "The term “fill him with lead” is often used to describe the action of ‘filling’ a member of the opposition with bullets, ammunition containing so called lead.\n\nThe following term ”make him slumber” refers to the action of sleeping, though the slumber of this description is one that cannot be exited, insinuating that the victim has been stretched", "annotation_id": "27883323", "url": "https://genius.com/27883323", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
