{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "I don’t know when them people would stab my back, but I know that my money would never", "vault_lines": ["I don't know when them people would stab my back, but I know that my money would never"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying that no matter what he can’t tell if someone would betray him. But he knows one thing, the feeling he gets from stacking his money is like no other, and he knows his money will always be there and he will never be broke again. In my words, mfs really be moving shiesty fr.", "annotation_id": "31279304", "url": "https://genius.com/31279304", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
