{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "I know you dig it, bitch, yeah, I’m a shovel", "vault_lines": ["I know you dig it, bitch, yeah, I'm a shovel"], "meaning": "Yeat uses play on words on this line, as he says “dig it” then proceeds to say “I’m a shovel” which is a tool used for digging.", "annotation_id": "27179737", "url": "https://genius.com/27179737", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
