{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "I’m takin’ these Percs, I get high as a bitch", "vault_lines": ["I'm takin' these Percs, I get high as a bitch"], "meaning": "Percs is slang for Percocet pills, one of Yeat’s favorite drugs to take regularly. Here, Yeat brags about getting “high as a bitch” from taking these Percocet pills.\n\nBoth Yeat and Gunna reference Percs throughout this track. They claim that unlike “everybody,” these drugs will not fail to please the rappers on demand, by getting them high.", "annotation_id": "26146355", "url": "https://genius.com/26146355", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "Percs don’t stab my back, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Percs don't stab my back, yeah"], "meaning": "This line is counterintuitive because although the opiates help yeats mentality they are meant for severe pain and are bad for the user’s cardiovascular system if abused, hence “stabbing him in the back”.", "annotation_id": "25202971", "url": "https://genius.com/25202971", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "Elliot, VVS", "vault_lines": ["Racks don't stab my back"], "meaning": "Elliot Eliantte is one of the most renowned celebrity jewelers in the world, known for serving rappers such as Nicki Minaj, 21 Savage, and Gunna’s very close affiliate Young Thug. VVS, an initialism of “Very Very Slightly,” is the quality of diamonds used to bling out jewelry.\n\nGunna is a known fan of Eliantte’s work, purchasing a diamond and sapphire ring as seen on Eliantte’s instagram in January 2022.\n\n\n\nGunna’s diamond and sapphire ring\n\n\nHe previously name-dropped Elliot Eliantte in his 2019 hit song “Baby Birkin”:\n\nAll my Elliot diamonds is water (Water)", "annotation_id": "25191003", "url": "https://genius.com/25191003", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "Yeah, I just added up bands for some Rick, I just pulled up on them with the twenty-two fit", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I just added up bands for some Rick, I just pulled up on them with the twenty-two fit"], "meaning": "A trend becoming big in 2022 is the designer Rick Owens shoes. You might recognize this iconic shoe, as they are described as looking like fake Converse.  They are an essential in archive fashion.", "annotation_id": "25179614", "url": "https://genius.com/25179614", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "I’m in my LV bag, in my duffle", "vault_lines": ["I'm in my LV bag, in my duffle"], "meaning": "Louis Vuitton is a designer-fashion brand based in Paris, France. They are mainly known for their high-end clothes or accessories—one of their most popular being their bags or purses.\n\n\n\nLouis Vuitton duffle bag\n\n\nThe expression “in my bag” is akin to the phrase “bag of tricks\" — Yeat is saying that he is in his element, and he has the “sauce” and money.", "annotation_id": "25172210", "url": "https://genius.com/25172210", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Rackz got më", "line": "Look at my bitch, she snatched She a lil’ two piece snack Bend her and break her back Let her count a few racks", "vault_lines": ["Racks don't stab my back"], "meaning": "In these lines, Gunna is referencing R&B artist Chloe Bailey. The two have recently went public with their relationship, and even have a song together on Gunna’s recent project DS4EVER:\n\nDon’t listen to what people say\nThey don’t know about, ‘bout you and me\nKeep it out your mind 'cause it’s jealousy\nThey don’t know", "annotation_id": "25163815", "url": "https://genius.com/25163815", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
