{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Pull Up", "line": "Lil Vamp", "vault_lines": ["Lil' shawty said she want Lil Vamp"], "meaning": "“Lil Vamp” comes from Ken Carson’s dark, vampire-inspired aesthetic. He started using it as a nickname, and “LV” can also mean “Lil Vamp” instead of Louis Vuitton. It became part of his identity and Opium’s dark style.", "annotation_id": "41093602", "url": "https://genius.com/41093602", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
