{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Pull Up", "line": "I got licks, pull up, bitch Let’s do a motherfuckin’ drill It’s a mill’ in the house up the hill", "vault_lines": ["We got sticks, pull up, bitch"], "meaning": "Ken Carson interpolated these lyrics into the song Me N My Kup:\n\nHuh, let’s go hit a lick\nHuh, let’s go do a drill\nI heard he got a mill' in his crib, and he stay up the hill", "annotation_id": "30299427", "url": "https://genius.com/30299427", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
