{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Psycho CEO", "line": "Yeah, my money tall, huh, heard it’s tall as God", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, my money tall, huh, heard it's tall as God"], "meaning": "God is known as “the highest power” to multiple religions.\n\nI will cry unto God most high; unto God that performeth all things for me.\n—Psalm 57:2\n\nYeat uses this as a device to flex his money as infinitely high; taller than the tallest being. This may also put Yeat’s power into an overwhelming perspective, dwarfing God with merely his monetary value.", "annotation_id": "30939104", "url": "https://genius.com/30939104", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Psycho CEO", "line": "We so clean, yeah, we in Nike, uh", "vault_lines": ["We so clean, yeah, we in Nike, uh"], "meaning": "Yeat, on multiple occasions has collaborated with or worn the brand of Nike, most recently a picture of him being near a Nike building.\n\nThe first public collaboration Yeat did with Nike was in a commercial for Dick’s Sporting Goods, where the instrumental to Turban was played shortly.\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GBSnVzybgAAbQSZ?format=jpg&name=large\n\nYeat, and his current affiliate Zack Bia next to a Nike building.\n\n\nIn September of 2023, Drake came to Instagram to tease the long-awaited snippet that is now Yeat’s most-known song, IDGAF through a video displaying Nike’s NOCTA Glide collection.\n\nYeat has also been gifted NOCTA shoes by Drake beforehand in March of 2022.", "annotation_id": "30934748", "url": "https://genius.com/30934748", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Psycho CEO", "line": "Wear your diamonds clean like me, but can you wife that?", "vault_lines": ["Wear your diamonds clean like me, but can you wife that? (Ah, ah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is wearing flawless VVS diamonds and notices others wearing similar jewelry but he isn’t so sure their diamonds are real like his. He’s curious to know if you wipe them with a wet cloth that they might show their lack of validity.", "annotation_id": "30922386", "url": "https://genius.com/30922386", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Psycho CEO", "line": "When we pull up, we courtside, yeah, where your seats at? (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["When we pull up, we courtside, yeah, where your seats at? (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat attended a Portland Trail Blazers game Courtside in late 2023.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/Rap/status/1737511755436171691", "annotation_id": "30899494", "url": "https://genius.com/30899494", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
