{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Probably!", "line": "I made a lil’ too much money this year, had to save, fuck a bank, stuff this shit in the sofa", "vault_lines": ["I made a lil' too much money this year, had to save, fuck a bank, stuff this shit in the sofa"], "meaning": "In this verse Autumn! speaks of stuffing money in a sofa to either hide his income from the IRS to evade taxes or hide possible illegal means of income from the IRS if it does not match up with their possible range of how much money Autumn! should have from legal means of income.", "annotation_id": "26443003", "url": "https://genius.com/26443003", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Probably!", "line": "Rino just poured up a whole ’nother deuce, man, I swear it’s like he never run out of soda", "vault_lines": ["Rino just poured up a whole 'nother deuce, man, I swear it's like he never run out of soda"], "meaning": "In this verse Autumn! mentions Rino; Friend and rapper of him in the same “slayworld” collective. The verse mentions how Rino (Better known as Summrs) poured a second duece meaning he made another bottle of lean and Autumn! puts a low-key flex in the song as he is more concerned about running out of soda rather than actual codeine.", "annotation_id": "26442981", "url": "https://genius.com/26442981", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
