{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Probably!", "line": "Used to get curved by this one bitch ’til she seen the blue check, and now she really got fond of me", "vault_lines": ["I told that bitch, \"You can fuck who you want, you just can't fuck a nigga who really ain't hard as me\""], "meaning": "A blue check is a verification tag that is received via Twitter or Instagram, given to users with a very high follower count. Autumn! reminisces on a female that showed him no attention until he received verification.", "annotation_id": "24792707", "url": "https://genius.com/24792707", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
