{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Probably!", "line": "Ain’t got a million, it’s more like a hundred thousand in my bank, but I promise that’s fine with me", "vault_lines": ["Ain't got a million, it's more like a hundred thousand in my bank, but I promise that's fine with me"], "meaning": "Autumn! states that he does not have the million dollars most rap stars have, he only has about one hundred thousand. But Autumn! stays humble and says that he is okay with what he has.", "annotation_id": "24792693", "url": "https://genius.com/24792693", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Probably!", "line": "The XD, the XD, the XD, yeah, I got the XD, she be everywhere with a holster Come test me, come test me, come test me, lil’ nigga, come test me, I’m not like the rest of these locals Confetti, confetti, confetti, shit blow like confetti, oh, what? You thought it wasn’t loaded?", "vault_lines": ["The XD, the XD, the XD, yeah, I got the XD, she be everywhere with a holster"], "meaning": "Autumn! reiterates his cadence on his November 2020 feature on Supa Bwe’s single “Koolaide Man,” where he rapped similar lines:\n\nThe XD, the XD, the XD, yeah, I got the XD if you tryna shoot shit or somethin'\nBalenci', Balenci', Balenci', got too much Balenci', I feel like Lil Uzi or somethin'", "annotation_id": "21518247", "url": "https://genius.com/21518247", "state": "accepted", "votes": 25, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
