{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Power Trip", "line": "I’m a G-Wagon, you a Range Rover", "vault_lines": ["I'm a G-Wagon, you a Range Rover"], "meaning": "Yeat compares himself to his car of choice, the G-Wagon against his opponents as Rolls Royces revealing where his loyalties lie between the major luxury car bands.\n\nG-Wagons are luxury SUVs produced by Mercedes-Benz. Yeat also referenced the model on the album’s first song Psycho CEO on this album.\n\n\nThe 2024 G-Wagon model.", "annotation_id": "31008220", "url": "https://genius.com/31008220", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
