{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Power Trip", "line": "And a whole lot get worse when you try That’s why I’ll let a lot of things fly", "vault_lines": ["A whole lot of things look worse in the light"], "meaning": "Yeat says that a lot of things can get worse if you try interfering. Whether its trying to help, fix, or change a situation. Trying to make it better, might actually make it worse. He’s had experience with this before, and now knows to just “let things fly.” Embracing an ‘IDGAF’ attitude.", "annotation_id": "30913245", "url": "https://genius.com/30913245", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
