{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Power Trip", "line": "I might go crazy, I’m out my head I might kill ’em and drop ’em dead I might have did it but I don’t think I did I might have done some things I never did", "vault_lines": ["I might have did it but I don't think I did"], "meaning": "In this line, Yeat is stating that he might be having some episodes where he “goes crazy” and kills people and that he doesn’t think he did it, but he might have.", "annotation_id": "30324778", "url": "https://genius.com/30324778", "state": "pending", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Power Trip", "line": "A cut across the eyes will leave you blind for life It only takes one time, it only takes a night", "vault_lines": ["A cut across the eyes will leave you blind for life"], "meaning": "Yeat raps in the perspective of the unnamed drug he is talking about. A cut across the eyes will leave you blind for life likely means that, after taking this drug, you will never see the world in the same perspective again. It only takes one time, it only takes one night is saying that, even after the first try of such drug, that’s enough for you to never see the world again.", "annotation_id": "30324773", "url": "https://genius.com/30324773", "state": "pending", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Power Trip", "line": "You don’t have to say what you did I already know before you say it", "vault_lines": ["I might have did it but I don't think I did"], "meaning": "He is saying that, you, or whomever he is speaking with, does not need to let yeat know that they did something, because he already know. He is also perhaps saying this in an eerie, creepier way, in reference to his “Lyfestyle Security” commercial posted to his labels instagram, where it is eerily stated in his futuristic “2093” setting for his new album.", "annotation_id": "30324739", "url": "https://genius.com/30324739", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
