{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Poppin", "line": "If a problem come up (Yeah), you know I’m not gon’ run", "vault_lines": ["If a problem come up (Yeah), you know I'm not gon' run"], "meaning": "Yeat expresses that if an issue arises, wether that be within his gang, or with his opposition, he will not show cowardice and confront the ‘problem’ firsthand, conveying that he has a bold nature. Additionally, this sends a message to his enemies that if they bother him he will confront them personally.", "annotation_id": "27821015", "url": "https://genius.com/27821015", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
