{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Pop Out", "line": "I got a whole lotta diamonds, whole lotta chains, keep ’em all in an igloo (Igloo)", "vault_lines": ["I got a whole lotta diamonds, whole lotta chains, keep 'em all in an igloo (Igloo)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying here that all of his jewelry is so iced out that he should keep them in an igloo. When he says iced out he means that all of his jewelry is covered in diamonds.", "annotation_id": "28404195", "url": "https://genius.com/28404195", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
