{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Pop Out", "line": "Yeah, ’lil thotty wifey, pull up eat my pickle (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Yеah, 'lil thotty wifey, pull up eat my pickle (Woo)"], "meaning": "What Mr. Smith is cracking at here is that his “wifey” is a “lil thotty” because she pulls up and eats his pickle. When he says pickle he is actually referring to his male genitalia because of its similar size and shape to a pickle. His “lil thotty wifey” therefore is not actually eating his pickle but this is a reference to falatia. The woo at the end signifies his enthusiasm for this. This line is a very clever play on words from Noah Oliver Smith, who is a very intelligent writer.", "annotation_id": "27528762", "url": "https://genius.com/27528762", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
