{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Playd da coupe", "line": "Yeah, I’m turnt when I walk, through", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm turnt when I walk, through"], "meaning": "Yeat is erect while walking through an undisclosed doorway\nThis is a reference to a time when yeat went live on instragram in early 2022, he first states “this wokky got me bricky” as the camera pans over to his erect penis while he holds a bottle of promethazine solution cough syrup beside it, he takes a few steps forward through a white doorway before the live abruptly ends. No screen recordings are known to exist but this is a discussed event in many yeat forums and chat rooms.", "annotation_id": "37156167", "url": "https://genius.com/37156167", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
