{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Percasseur", "line": "Give me, Felacio, 1 me 3 bitches that’s the ratio", "vault_lines": ["Give me, Felacio, 1 me 3 bitchеs that’s the ratio"], "meaning": "The phrase ‘give me felacio’ refers to Plsbug requesting some of that sloppy bobby boom whap 30,000x106.  Followed by ‘1 me 3 bitches that’s the ratio’; where ratio cleverly rhymes with felacio whilst sticking to the motif of sexual intercourse. ‘1 me’ clearly meaning himself, ‘3 bitches’ along with the word ‘ratio’ lets us assume that this young gentleman is infact not only having sexual intercourse with one woman, nor two but three ‘bitches’. Thus giving the reader some form of respect towards plsbug or even jealousy, wanting to ‘be like him’ perhaps even trying to clone him. However, such an occurrence is somewhat rare to come by for the ‘average joe’, perhaps even yeat himself whomst features on the song.\n\nIn conclusion, plsbug uses his sexual experiences as a way to boast his popularity and breadwinning abilities.", "annotation_id": "24918779", "url": "https://genius.com/24918779", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
