{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "PROJECT LYFESTYLE", "line": "Yeah, I got Yves Laurent, baggage on my jawn (Jawn)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got Yves Laurent, baggage on my jawn (Jawn)"], "meaning": "Yves Laurent is a luxury clothing store, named after deceased French-Algerian fashion designer Yves Saint-Laurent. Jawn is a piece of slang from Philidelphia, and other parts of Eastern Pennsylvania. It refers to a thing, place, person, or thing (essentially a placeholder word for something). In this case, he is likely referring to a woman, probably his girlfriend Symone Ryley. Yeat is referring to the fact that he can afford to buy designer pieces, like Saint-Laurent, for the women in his life.", "annotation_id": "33354472", "url": "https://genius.com/33354472", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
