{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "PROJECT LYFESTYLE", "line": "Yeah, I know they like the sound of bell hittin’ every time", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I know they like the sound of bell hittin' every time"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to the viral bell sound that was present in songs like Get Busy and helped Yeat get more recognition. Yeat then plays the bell sound in the rest of the chorus, as he knows his fans like the sound of the bell.", "annotation_id": "33333532", "url": "https://genius.com/33333532", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
