{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Out thë way", "line": "I don’t even be postin’ no pics on the Instagram, bitch, I just muhfuckin’ stay out (Ooh, oh)", "vault_lines": ["I don't even be postin' no pics on the Instagram, bitch, I just muhfuckin' stay out (Ooh, oh)"], "meaning": "The line “I don’t even be postin' no pics on the Instagram, bitch, I just muhfuckin' stay out” states the Yëat is rebellious. “muhfuckin'” Is common slang terminology for being the rizzliest bear, meaning that Yëat is flexing on his Instagram followers.", "annotation_id": "29766162", "url": "https://genius.com/29766162", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Out thë way", "line": "I bought me the gems", "vault_lines": ["I bought me the gems"], "meaning": "He is implying that due to his new found wealth, he now has been enabled to increase his disposable income. Gems is in reference to the Roblox experience “Tapping Simulator” in which gems is a currency that Yeat is suggesting he was been able to purchase a large quantity of.", "annotation_id": "29495495", "url": "https://genius.com/29495495", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
