{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Out thë way", "line": "(BNYX, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I make money, my thot-thot-thot 'bout to fuck that money all up (BNYX, ooh)"], "meaning": "Benjamin Saint Fort, professionally known as BNYX® (pronounced Benny X), is a record producer from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. This is his producer tag.", "annotation_id": "28771518", "url": "https://genius.com/28771518", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
