{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On tha linë", "line": "Yeah, sippin’ on syrup all day, couldn’t hold it in, I’m pissin’", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, sippin' on syrup all day, couldn't hold it in, I'm pissin'"], "meaning": "Wock made bro piss himself😭\n\nIn the now distant past, Yeat described a state of being he suffered known as “YÖNKY.”\n\nThe condition was caused by his frequent abuse of pills and various opioids. Most notably “DRANK” (lean).\n\nThe following is a quote from a now infamous Instagram story…\n\n“Piss yonky mean when Im sippin drank an ion wanna piss out tha drank high so it be gettin me yonky.”\n\nThis troubling condition likely explains Yeat’s sudden lapse of bladder control described in the line.", "annotation_id": "28486268", "url": "https://genius.com/28486268", "state": "pending", "votes": -8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
