{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On tha linë", "line": "Forty-five seconds, you in and you out for a dozen (Phew) Yeah, and it’s way too far gone to save that shit, I won’t touch it (Yeah) Back of a shotgun barrel kick back like buckets", "vault_lines": ["Forty-five seconds, you in and you out for a dozen (Phew)"], "meaning": "Sounds like Yeat is planning a murder. Hes saying that in 45 seconds he’ll enter your building and shoot you a dozen times until you’re gone. Then he wont save you because he went too far. His shotgun that he used has heavy recoil.", "annotation_id": "25303307", "url": "https://genius.com/25303307", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
