{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "Can’t believe clout’s such a drug, y’all do some shit for fifty likes", "vault_lines": ["Can't believe clout's such a drug, y'all do some shit for fifty likes"], "meaning": "Yeat criticizes the influence of social media (“clout”) and how it can be like a drug, suggesting that people are willing to do things, possibly compromising their values or authenticity, just to gain popularity or approval on social media (“for fifty likes”).", "annotation_id": "30200496", "url": "https://genius.com/30200496", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "I stayed down with the same people, y’all be switching sides", "vault_lines": ["I stayed down with the same people, y'all be switching sides"], "meaning": "Yeat expresses loyalty by staying true to the same group of people. In contrast, others are portrayed as disloyal or unfaithful, constantly changing allegiances.", "annotation_id": "30200475", "url": "https://genius.com/30200475", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "I just been sittin’ at the top, with a whole lot of guap, I been rockin’ them Rick Owens", "vault_lines": ["I just been sittin' at the top, with a whole lot of guap, I been rockin' them Rick Owens"], "meaning": "Rick Owens is a valued fashion icon known for his luxury accessories and clothes. Launching his fashion line in 1994, Rick Owens has gradually earned an admirable status for his work over the years.\n\nYeat is notorious for wearing designer clothing such as Rick Owens, as seen in 2023’s “bigger thën everything’s” music video, where he is spotted wearing full Rick Owens attire.\n\n\n\n\nPictured head-to-toe: Black Lemeget Distressed Balaclava/Ski Mask, beige Rick Owens Leather Overshirt, black Rick Owens DRKSHDW Distressed-Effect Skinny Jeans, Rick Owens DRKSHDW Off-White Strobe Fogachine Boots\n\n\nYeat’s interest in the Rick Owens brand stretches back to 2022 in an Instagram post where he can be seen wearing DRKSHDW FW15 Sphinx Memphis Trousers among other expensive attire.", "annotation_id": "29333878", "url": "https://genius.com/29333878", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "I seen a lot of y’all bitin’ the swag, y’all be copyin’ the swag, bitch, I seen my kids growing (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Heard you wan' talk to the mob"], "meaning": "It’s not new that people are starting to copy Yeat’s style and flow—with DDG’s April 2022 “Whiskey Freestyle” sounding awfully close to Yeat’s signature flow among other underground rappers trying to mimic Yeat in the sense that they can also receive the same amount of ubuiquity.\n\nConveying that “he’s seeing his kids growing,” Yeat claims that people who wear the mask and mimic the flow of his music are the next generation of him and are considered his descendants.\n\nDDG has also shared a photo on a now-deleted Instagram post wearing a face mask that looks identical to the type that Yeat wears; however, UnoTheActivist was the first to popularize these types of masks. Regardless, it still shows how artists like DDG are quick to bandwagon other artists.\n\n\n\nA comparison between DDG and Yeat’s masks.", "annotation_id": "29309364", "url": "https://genius.com/29309364", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "I take the top off the truck, lil’ bitch, in the G65, got the wind blowin’", "vault_lines": ["I take the top off the truck, lil' bitch, in the G65, got the wind blowin'"], "meaning": "The Mercedes-Maybach G65 G-Class is a convertible that features an electrically operated folding fabric roof, allowing for wind to blow through as Yeat conveys in this line.\n\nThis version of the truck can easily be confused with the G65 Mercedes-Benz; however, the G65 does not feature a removable roof.\n\n\n\nA side view of the Mercedes-Maybach G65 G-Class.", "annotation_id": "29309334", "url": "https://genius.com/29309334", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "All my diamonds Michael Phelps, these bitches been swimming on me", "vault_lines": ["All my diamonds Michael Phelps, these bitches been swimming on me"], "meaning": "Yeat makes a reference to Michael Phelps, born Michael Fred Phelps II, who is a former American swimmer. He is the most successful Olympian, receiving a total of twenty-eight medals and also holds the all-time records for Olympic gold medals.\n\nClaiming that his diamonds “are swimming on him,” Yeat flaunts his luxury-branded accessories.  Yeat has multiple notable pieces that he wears, such as his Tonka Truck Pendant, which was created in collaboration with Icebox. A video behind the creation has been posted to YouTube.\n\n\n\nA closeup of Yeat’s Tonka Truck Pendant.\n\nYeat also owns multiple Rolex watches, one supposedly as a gift to his girlfriend and social media influencer, Symone Ryley.", "annotation_id": "29306505", "url": "https://genius.com/29306505", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "On Livë", "line": "Y’all so broke, them boys SI", "vault_lines": ["All my diamonds flawless, y'all so broke, them boys SI"], "meaning": "yeat is talking about a standing instruction basically you have to take out little amounts of money in your bank account instead of a bunch at once ✅", "annotation_id": "28885743", "url": "https://genius.com/28885743", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
