{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ok Kool", "line": "Yeah, we laughin’ at your track, boy, Druski", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, we laughin' at your track, boy, Druski"], "meaning": "Drew “Druski” Desbordes is a popular comedian best known for his internet sketches. Druski, being a popular comedian, will often generate a lot of laughter from his comedy. Yeat likens the laughter of Druski’s audience to the large amount of laughter him and his associates make when they listen to this person’s track.", "annotation_id": "27380924", "url": "https://genius.com/27380924", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
