{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ok Kool", "line": "I just woke up to some bullshit, going back to bed", "vault_lines": ["I just woke up to some bullshit, going back to bed"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Yeat’s song “Bäk 2 BED” on the album Alivë. The song Bäk 2 BED features the lyrics:\n\nI just woke up to some bullshit, I went Bäk 2 BED", "annotation_id": "25506863", "url": "https://genius.com/25506863", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
