{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Oh eX whY", "line": "Brand new diamonds I got from Eliantte, they got pee inside ’em", "vault_lines": ["Brand new diamonds I got from Eliantte, they got pee inside 'em"], "meaning": "Elliot Eliantte is a high end jeweler, famous for  extravagant custom pieces made for celebrities like lil Uzi, Young Thug, 21 Savage and Kylie Jenner.\nYëat uses pee as a metaphor for the color of canary yellow diamonds.\nThis line could be inspired by Chief Keef’s song Pee Pee’d, which includes the bar “My wrist look like pee”, referencing Chief Keef’s iced out watch.\n\n\n\nLil Uzi’s chains, made by Eliantte & Co", "annotation_id": "24999627", "url": "https://genius.com/24999627", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Oh eX whY", "line": "I’m on that O-X-Y", "vault_lines": ["Just want S-E-X when I'm on that O-X-Y"], "meaning": "oxy (O-X-Y) is slang for oxycodone or Oxycontin, an opioid medication used to treat pain. It is highly addictive and a common drug of abuse. Consumption of oxycodone causes feelings of euphoria and relaxation.", "annotation_id": "24999555", "url": "https://genius.com/24999555", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
