{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Off Tha Lot", "line": "Being at the tippity-top, it’s hard, I got beef with my kidney He ask me why the hell I take all these Percs, I told that boy “Shut up” (Shut up) Yeah, ’cause they feel good as shit (Why), huh, why else would I? (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Being at the tippity-top, it's hard, I got beef with my kidney"], "meaning": "Yeat may at some point have some issues with his kidney due to the drugs he consumes. He then imitates what his kidney would say if it could speak by asking “Why the hell I take all these Percs”. He answers the question by just pointing out he only takes them ‘cause “they feek good as shit”.\n\nThose lines were fire.", "annotation_id": "26635243", "url": "https://genius.com/26635243", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
