{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "OH I DID", "line": "Uh, uh, uh, and I did Uh, did you fuck her? Did you? I did", "vault_lines": ["Uh, did you fuck her? Did you? I did"], "meaning": "Yeat emphasizes blunt honesty and dominance. The repetition of “I did” reinforces confidence and ownership of his actions.", "annotation_id": "38798101", "url": "https://genius.com/38798101", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "OH I DID", "line": "My money longer than Shaq feet, I heard that your pockets look short, it’s on midget", "vault_lines": ["My money longer than Shaq feet, I heard that your pockets look short, it's on midget"], "meaning": "He is comparing his money to the size of former NBA star Shaquille O'Neal, Shaq is an American former professional basketball player who is a sports analyst on the television program Inside the NBA. He is a 7-foot-1-inch  and 325-pound (147 kg) shoe size Men’s 23, center who played for six teams over his 19-year career in the National Basketball Association (NBA) and is a four-time NBA champion. O'Neal is widely regarded as one of the greatest basketball players and centers of all time.", "annotation_id": "37889198", "url": "https://genius.com/37889198", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
