{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "OH I DID", "line": "Bitch, I’m an alien, E.T., middle finger", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm an alien, E.T., middle finger"], "meaning": "E.T (the alien character from the movie E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial) became globally recognized for his in-movie action of touching the main character Elliott’s finger with his glowing finger.\n\n\n\nYeat has personified the theme of extraterrestial life (E.T, to be specific) since he had started rapping. Since then, he’s:\n\n\nReleased a single called Feel Like E.T\n\nConfirmed with The Fader that his 2023 Instagram story has truth in him stating that “When i was young i seen a alien n they told me what to do,”\nHad a fellow affiliate-producer Clibbo release songs like “Soup” on SoundCloud with the E.T finger-touch cover", "annotation_id": "36434542", "url": "https://genius.com/36434542", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
