{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "I got a Richard Mille, yeah (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["I got a Richard Mille, yeah (Ugh)"], "meaning": "Richard Mille is a Swiss luxury watch company.\nYeat is saying that he is so rich that he can buy expensive watches.", "annotation_id": "29192263", "url": "https://genius.com/29192263", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
