{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "Yeah, I’m in high demand", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm in high demand"], "meaning": "Now that Yeat has found viral success with hit singles such as “Sorry Bout That” and “Gët Busy,” he receives promotional offers from various corporations requesting his services for profuse opportunities.\n\nThis line would later be referenced in Yeat’s June 2022 track “Rich Minion” for the Minions: The Rise of Gru (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack).", "annotation_id": "26172408", "url": "https://genius.com/26172408", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
