{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "I got a Richard Mille, yeah (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["I got a Richard Mille, yeah (Ugh)"], "meaning": "Richard Mille is a Swiss luxury watch company founded in 2001 by Dominique Guenat and Richard Mille, and based in Les Breuleux, Switzerland. The brand specialises in ultra-high-end luxury watches.", "annotation_id": "25923723", "url": "https://genius.com/25923723", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "Yeah, mud in my cup, yeah, mud in my cup", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, mud in my cup, yeah, mud in my cup"], "meaning": "“ Mud in my cup ” is a line that yeat used referring the the drink “ lean ” or “ wock ” which is a mix of sprite (usually) and cough syrup. Mud is just another name for it", "annotation_id": "25484351", "url": "https://genius.com/25484351", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
