{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "Yeah, I run my money up to the moon, I feel like Usain", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I run my money up to the moon, I feel like Usain"], "meaning": "On this line, Yeat is referencing Olympic sprinter Usain Bolt, who also has multiple track world records, which one of them being his infamous 9.58 100 Meter Dash. Yeat is basically saying he runs his money up to high amounts, similar to how Usain Bolt runs.", "annotation_id": "25079048", "url": "https://genius.com/25079048", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "Bugz Ronin, he gon’ run it up", "vault_lines": ["Bugz Ronin, he gon' run it up"], "meaning": "Producer tag for Bugz Ronin, he is best known for producing on Yung Bans debut studio album “Misunderstood” and Lil Uzi Vert’s second studio album Eternal Atake, as well as several other prominent artists.", "annotation_id": "24136111", "url": "https://genius.com/24136111", "state": "pending", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nëw turban", "line": "I add a bell to the beat ’cause it turn shit up, yeah they know it’s my thang", "vault_lines": ["I add a bell to the beat 'cause it turn shit up, yeah they know it's my thang"], "meaning": "Yeat is well-known for adding repeating bells to many of his songs, such as “Mad bout that,” “Cmon,” and more notably in his viral hit song, “Gët Busy.”\n\nHe has also mentioned his bells in “Gët Busy”, on the following line:\n\nYeah, this song already was turnt, but here’s a bell (Yeah)\n\nThis line was the reason to the song’s popularity, causing the song to trend before it even was released, with it being a popular trend on TikTok. It had also caught the attention of Drake, who quoted it in a now-expired Instagram story.", "annotation_id": "24006998", "url": "https://genius.com/24006998", "state": "accepted", "votes": 41, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
