{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "Lived a lot of life, not a thing’s changed, uh A lot of things change, people don’t change", "vault_lines": ["Lived a lot of life, not a thing's changed, uh"], "meaning": "Psycho CEO has been around for a long time (just how long is a bit of a mystery), and while a lot of things have changed in that time, he hasn’t. That’s because, according to him, people never change.", "annotation_id": "31883442", "url": "https://genius.com/31883442", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "When I take a breath, no, I don’t inhale", "vault_lines": ["When I take a breath, no, I don't inhale"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying here he takes a breath but clarifies he doesn’t inhale.\nThis could mean he took the breath away from someone by killing them.", "annotation_id": "31569726", "url": "https://genius.com/31569726", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "We don’t link and build, we make buildings build", "vault_lines": ["We don't link and build, we make buildings build"], "meaning": "instead of “linking and building” (collaborating or working with other people) yeat is saying he’s building stuff by himself, like literal buildings being erected at his command", "annotation_id": "30941609", "url": "https://genius.com/30941609", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "I’m gon’ call up Elon Musk and ask him, ”Where we landin’", "vault_lines": ["I'm gon' call up Elon Musk and ask him, \"Where we landin'"], "meaning": "Elon Musk is the owner of the company SpaceX, America’s leading company in the Rocket Ship industry. Elon has also made many statements about wanting humans to colonize Mars, and perhaps other planets. Whether it’s just taking a ride in a Rocket Ship, or traveling to a different planet, here Yeat is referencing taking a ride in a spaceship with Elon.", "annotation_id": "30925472", "url": "https://genius.com/30925472", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "I wanna feel like normal human, don’t wan’ pop a pill", "vault_lines": ["I wanna feel like normal human, don't wan' pop a pill"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about his struggles with addiction a lot throughout this album. On previous albums Yeat has been very open about his use of drugs, especially opioids like Oxycodone (aka Oxy, Percocet, Yerky). Opioids are very hard to quit for most people, often leading to intense battles with addiction to get off them. Here, Yeat details his desire to get off of drugs, however his addiction is rendering him unable to get clean and be a ‘normal human’.", "annotation_id": "30925363", "url": "https://genius.com/30925363", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "Dystopian society on Silent Hill", "vault_lines": ["Dystopian society on Silent Hill"], "meaning": "Silent Hill is a horror video game series that takes place in a very dark and eerie town of the same name. Yeat is comparing the dystopian society depicted throughout the album and promotion for the album to the video game.", "annotation_id": "30925325", "url": "https://genius.com/30925325", "state": "pending", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "Yeah, coverin’ my face like Jimmy Butler, man, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, coverin' my face like Jimmy Butler, man, yeah"], "meaning": "Jimmy Butler is an NBA player for the Miami Heat. He has a running gag where he shows up to NBA Media Day (the day on which the pictures for all NBA media outlets and player graphics are taken) with some silly hairstyle or look.\n\nThis past season, Butler showed up to NBA media day sporting an Emo-bob style haircut that covered half of his face, as well as multiple piercings.\n\n\n\nhttps://www.nbcnews.com/news/nbcblk/jimmy-butler-new-emo-look-internet-shambles-rcna118628", "annotation_id": "30905661", "url": "https://genius.com/30905661", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Nothing Changë", "line": "I can’t listen to no music, I can’t fuckin’ stand it", "vault_lines": ["I can't listen to no music, I can't fuckin' stand it"], "meaning": "This could be referring to his music taste. His love for classical music and how he delves into his creative mind. Like he expressed in an interview: slide 3\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/C0Iy2AmOElt/?igsh=MWwwMXM1NTNkN2h4Yg==", "annotation_id": "30901095", "url": "https://genius.com/30901095", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
