{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Not Enough", "line": "She want Timmy, she want Turner things (Let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["She want Timmy, she want Turner things (Let's go)"], "meaning": "Timmy Turner is a cartoon character from The Fairly OddParents, known as an “average kid that no one understands”.\nIn this lyric, Yeat is saying that she wants luxurious things.", "annotation_id": "39764587", "url": "https://genius.com/39764587", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
