{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No fëelingz", "line": "Rockin’ brand new L.V., Virgil sent the newest drip (Uh-uh, uh-uh)", "vault_lines": ["Rockin' brand new L.V., Virgil sent the newest drip (Uh-uh, uh-uh)"], "meaning": "L.V is a slang for Louis Vuitton.\n\nVirgil Abloh, is a founder of the big brand Off-White and also the former artistic director of Louis Vuitton. On December 3rd 2021, Virgil sadly passed away after a two-year battle with cardiac angiosarcoma, a rare cancer.\n\nYeat also mentioned the big designer name on “All Lies”\n\nI just called Virgil, I told him I need the newest bag, bitch", "annotation_id": "25120936", "url": "https://genius.com/25120936", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
