{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No cosign", "line": "I got them all behind me, no cosign (I ain’t need no help)", "vault_lines": ["I got them all behind me, no cosign (I ain't need no help)"], "meaning": "Yeat says he got his money on his own, and didn’t need any external help, aside from his close friends.\n\nHe’s previously said he could’ve blown up easily as an industry plant, but took his time and grew naturally instead.", "annotation_id": "27548475", "url": "https://genius.com/27548475", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
