{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No commënt", "line": "They checking my Feng shui", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, they checking my Feng shui (Rah), I don't got nothing, bitch I'm off the Earth"], "meaning": "Feng shui is an ancient Chinese practice that involves arranging objects and spaces to create balance and harmony.\n\nWhat Yeat means by “they checking my Feng Shui” is that they are checking his harmony and arrangement of his lyrics and music/beats.", "annotation_id": "32964474", "url": "https://genius.com/32964474", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
