{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No commënt", "line": "Got thirteen mill’ from the deal, pockets so real (Ha, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Got thirteen mill' from the deal, pockets so real (Ha, yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to his recent signee record deal with Geffen Records, in which they loaned him a total of $13,000,000 USD.\n\nFor reference, both of his albums 2 Alivë and 2 Alivë (Geëk Pack) were released through Geffen Records on behalf of Field Trip Recordings and LISTEN TO THE KIDS as a result of the record deal.", "annotation_id": "25532140", "url": "https://genius.com/25532140", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
