{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "This bitch got an ass, this bitch got a donkey", "vault_lines": ["This bitch got an ass, this bitch got a donkey"], "meaning": "The term “ass” is derived from the Latin word for donkey, “asinus”.\n\nSimultaneously, he expresses how his partner has a well-developed backside, or, in this case, “ass”.\n\nYeat is essentially saying the same sentence, only having swapped out a single word.", "annotation_id": "40302834", "url": "https://genius.com/40302834", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Rio", "vault_lines": ["Hey, hey, hey, hey"], "meaning": "This is the tag for one of the song’s producers, Rio Leyva.", "annotation_id": "31079983", "url": "https://genius.com/31079983", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Yeah, I got a cross on my crotch, yeah, the Chrome Hearts on my waist", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got a cross on my crotch, yeah, the Chrome Hearts on my waist"], "meaning": "Chrome Hearts is a respected luxury brand founded by Richard Stark in 1988 and based in Hollywood, Los Angeles.\n\nBy Yeat stating he has a cross on his crotch, he makes a reference to the valuable Chrome Hearts Black Cross Pant, which features multiple crosses running over the lap area and down the leg.\n\n\n\nA photo of the Chrome Hearts Black Cross Pant.", "annotation_id": "29315895", "url": "https://genius.com/29315895", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Yeah, I got bags sitting on top of the bags, boy, that’s a Virgil piece (Virgil)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got bags sitting on top of the bags, boy, that's a Virgil piece (Virgil)"], "meaning": "Virgil Abloh was an admired American fashion designer and entrepreneur. He was best known for founding Off White and serving as the artistic director of menswear at Louis Vuitton.\n\nFollowing that, “That’s a Virgil piece,” asserts to Yeat unequivocally purchasing a series of Virgil-designed bags, in order to pay tribute after his passing.\n\n\n\nLouis Vuitton bags designed by Virgil Abloh.", "annotation_id": "26535461", "url": "https://genius.com/26535461", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "In the Maybach, recline in the seats", "vault_lines": ["In the Maybach, recline in the seats"], "meaning": "Yeat is speaking of the Mercedes Maybach. The Maybach is a luxury car created by the German automotive giant Mercedes-Benz. These cars are revered for their spaciousness and the ability to recline the seats is an additional benefit of the cars.", "annotation_id": "26518472", "url": "https://genius.com/26518472", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Hit from the three, I feel tall like McGrady (Bop)", "vault_lines": ["Hit from the three, I feel tall like McGrady (Bop)"], "meaning": "Tracy McGrady is a retired NBA player who is the very tall height of 6’8”.", "annotation_id": "25713392", "url": "https://genius.com/25713392", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Your bitch gon’ jump on my dick, yeah, that bitch gon’ pull up, do hurdles", "vault_lines": ["Your bitch gon' jump on my dick, yeah, that bitch gon' pull up, do hurdles"], "meaning": "Hurdles are objects that people jump over in races, workouts, etc.\n\nYeat is saying that the woman he’s having sex with is going to jump on his dick like you jump over a hurdle.", "annotation_id": "25713361", "url": "https://genius.com/25713361", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Bitch ’bout to Uber, she eat (Eat up)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch 'bout to Uber, she eat (Eat up)"], "meaning": "Yeat uses a play on words of the food delivery service Uber Eats to when presumably a female will perform oral sex on him, described as “eating him up.”\n\nYeat has used similar lines like this before in songs like his breakout single, “Sorry Bout That”:\n\nShe eat me up like it’s Beni-bachi", "annotation_id": "25703338", "url": "https://genius.com/25703338", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "No Handoutz", "line": "Twin finna smoke that boy just like a Russian (Buh, buh, buh, buh)", "vault_lines": ["Twin finna smoke that boy just like a Russian (Buh, buh, buh, buh)"], "meaning": "This line references the ongoing conflicts between Russia and Ukraine of 2022. Starting in early 2022, Russia is in the process of a full-scale invasion of the country which will bring dangerous circumstances to the citizens of Ukraine due to the violence of the war.\n\nYeat is comparing how Russian military soldiers may incite violence on Ukraine citizens to his opposition who he will also incite violence onto.\n\n\n\nReal footage of Ukrainian soldiers discovering the aftermath of an attack from Russia.\n\nThis line could also potentially be a reference to popular cigar brand Backwoods and their product “Russian Cream.”", "annotation_id": "25703299", "url": "https://genius.com/25703299", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
