{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Night Time", "line": "And just like Goonie said, I can’t believe we just lost Kobe (RIP)", "vault_lines": ["And just like Goonie said, I can't believe we just lost Kobe (RIP)"], "meaning": "In Can’t Believe it, Yeat’s frequent collaborator and friend GOONIE sings “Still can’t believe we really lost Kobe”. This was only months after the Kobe Bryant, the NBA Legend, passed away on the 26th of January 2020.", "annotation_id": "27547866", "url": "https://genius.com/27547866", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Night Time", "line": "First time kickin’ and it’s fun Two weeks later, look back, you been havin’ fun (Let’s go-go go) You been doin’ things you never did before, you done (I did that today) Now it’s money comin’ in, you think you won (Think it’s done) No, that’s just the start money, this that star money (This that star) This that go and buy that whip, that push-to-start money (Start money)", "vault_lines": ["This not TikTok, no, this not no fun (Fun)"], "meaning": "Yeat tells a story of someone thinking they’re on his level, only to find out they’re only in the beginning and he’s on another level.", "annotation_id": "27547864", "url": "https://genius.com/27547864", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
