{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "Matter fact, I don’t even wanna see you die, wanna see you live So you can think about all the shit you did and where you went wrong and what the fuck you thought you coulda’ did", "vault_lines": ["And I live like God (God, God-God)"], "meaning": "Yeat is dissing SeptembersRich, saying he can re-think his bad moves such as talking bad behind Yeat’s back while being his best friend", "annotation_id": "31007177", "url": "https://genius.com/31007177", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "You beggin’ please on your knees sayin’, “Accept me”", "vault_lines": ["You beggin' please on your knees sayin', \"Accept me\""], "meaning": "These lines highlight a sense of disillusionment with the world and needing to seek validation from others.", "annotation_id": "30962346", "url": "https://genius.com/30962346", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
