{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "I’m way too rich, I’m diabolical as shit I’m way too rich, don’t give a fuck if you get hit", "vault_lines": ["I'm way too rich, I'm diabolical as shit"], "meaning": "Yeat repeats “I’m way too rich” three times in this verse. He says he is diabolical as shit. Yeat being diabolical is a common theme in his music he even has a song called “Met Tha Devil”. He has a disregard for his haters safety and he does not care if they live or die. Carelessness is a common trait of Yeat.", "annotation_id": "30953454", "url": "https://genius.com/30953454", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
