{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "I love sittin’ in a bottomless pit full of—", "vault_lines": ["I love sittin' in a bottomless pit full of—"], "meaning": "Yeat doesnt finish the sentence hear because a bottomless pit would be full of nothing\n\nSo Yeat opts so just not say anything, referencing the nature of a bottomless pit being empty.\n\nIt also could symbolize a comfort in embracing darkness and isolation.", "annotation_id": "30937954", "url": "https://genius.com/30937954", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
