{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "I think the whole world fake, except me", "vault_lines": ["I think the whole world fake, except me"], "meaning": "Yeat has mentioned before that he is believes he is the realest in the game. Stating in his song “Psycho ceo” on 2093, “I’m the realest in this game, know I bleed that.” Him being “Real” could mean many things but it is most likely about him not faking his life and or him being a real friend and not turning his back on friends now that he is a prominent figure in the rap industry.", "annotation_id": "30929179", "url": "https://genius.com/30929179", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "You don’t fit inside my fuckin’ shoe, right? (Right?)", "vault_lines": ["You don't fit inside my fuckin' shoe, right? (Right?)"], "meaning": "People cant put themselves in Yeats shoes because they don’t even fit in them in the first place. He also addresses the copy’s of him who try to copy his sound and how they still can’t be like him.", "annotation_id": "30926146", "url": "https://genius.com/30926146", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never quit", "line": "I feel like God (God, goddammit) And I live like God (God, God-God)", "vault_lines": ["I feel like God (God, goddammit)"], "meaning": "Yeat has a god-like persona mentioning several times that he lives and feels like god. Almost inferring that he is on a whole other level and can’t be compared to others. As well as how much power he has due to his influence in the rap industry.", "annotation_id": "30926087", "url": "https://genius.com/30926087", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
