{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Never Changëd", "line": "This not Scooby Doo, my dawg’ll pull up and light ‘em, talkin’ ’bout “Zoink”", "vault_lines": ["This not Scooby Doo, my dawg'll pull up and light 'em, talkin' 'bout \"Zoink\""], "meaning": "In Scooby Doo, Shaggy is known for saying “zoinks Scoob!”. “Zoinks” means to express surprise or panic, so here Yeat is basically saying his bro’s actions should not be a surprise as “this not Scooby Doo.”", "annotation_id": "25898561", "url": "https://genius.com/25898561", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
