{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "You could get smacked with this TEC", "vault_lines": ["You could get smacked with this TEC"], "meaning": "Kel-Tech is an American firearms manufacturer. Rappers typically refer to it as a Tec, shortening the brand to a slang term in order to sustain an easier flow.\n\nHowever, it is also generally used as a slang term to convey possesion of a firearm, as Kel-Tech manufactures a wide range of arnaments, including pistols and automatic rifles.", "annotation_id": "35007709", "url": "https://genius.com/35007709", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "She got good brain, she got good knowledge (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["She got good brain, she got good knowledge (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Brain is also a slang term for oral sex. Yeat compliments the quality of his sexual partner’s performance, whilst insinuating that she is intelligent and educated. However, the good knowledge could simply refer to the quality of her technique.", "annotation_id": "35007662", "url": "https://genius.com/35007662", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
