{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "I want the narcotics", "vault_lines": [", I want the narcotics"], "meaning": "This line (Including the first half not annotated) is most likely a diss towards Ken Carson, who Kayo supposedly had beef with around the time of this song’s release.\n\nKen is friends with rapper Playboi Carti, and is even signed to his label, Opium. Carti has been referred to as a “narcissist” multiple times, mostly by his ex-girlfriend Iggy Azalea.\n\nKen would later diss Kayo on his song “MDMA,\" where he says:\n\nLil' boy, you should’ve signed to Opium, I laugh at that nigga, he slavin'", "annotation_id": "27896227", "url": "https://genius.com/27896227", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "That boy got an old gun, it’s a gen’ three", "vault_lines": ["That boy got an old gun, it's a gen' three"], "meaning": "Yung Kayo is most likely referring to the different generations of semi automatic handguns from Glock which currently go up to generation 5.\n\nGen 3 Glocks were released back in 1998, but they are by no means dated as they are probably the most popular generation of Glock in America. Glocks gen 3 – 5 are all viable as they offer a wide arrangement of attachments and accessories whereas gen 1-2 do not offer these options", "annotation_id": "26631789", "url": "https://genius.com/26631789", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "Narcissists", "vault_lines": ["You hang with narcissists"], "meaning": "He talking bout Playboi Carti", "annotation_id": "26308228", "url": "https://genius.com/26308228", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "Snot nose, pull up on them, they do bunny", "vault_lines": ["Snot nose, pull up on them, they do bunny"], "meaning": "Here  “Snot nose”  refers to the term “slime”; to slime someone is to betray, go against, or even kill someone.", "annotation_id": "25745000", "url": "https://genius.com/25745000", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "Nodding off the Percs, that’s the way I love it", "vault_lines": ["Nodding off the Percs, that's the way I love it"], "meaning": "In this opening line, Yeat raps about falling asleep due to Percocet usage. Yeat also proclaims he  he loves the extreme high and drowsy effects that the opioid pill cause.", "annotation_id": "25744923", "url": "https://genius.com/25744923", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "Yeah, close one eye, I’m illuminati (Illuminati)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, close one eye, I'm illuminati (Illuminati)"], "meaning": "The illuminati is a secret group that uses a pyramid with an eye as one of their logos.", "annotation_id": "25203145", "url": "https://genius.com/25203145", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Narcoticz", "line": "Good college She got good brain, she got good knowledge (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["She got good brain, she got good knowledge (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat says a girl gives good “Brain” (slang for oral sex) while also saying she goes to a good college. This is a play on the word brain by using it as a sexual term instead and using it by the college she is attending to.", "annotation_id": "25203126", "url": "https://genius.com/25203126", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
