{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Naked", "line": "Naked (Is it worth the risk?) Like to see you naked (Is it worth the risk?) Naked (Is it worth the risk?)", "vault_lines": ["I, I just like to see you naked"], "meaning": "Yeat is expressing how he completely detaches from the intimacy of a relationship and only uses it for his own gain and therefore knows the risk involved and what it could cause to the relationship", "annotation_id": "41352719", "url": "https://genius.com/41352719", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
