{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "NY (feat. Lunchbox)", "line": "So many racks, I might get me a tummy tuck", "vault_lines": ["So many racks, I might get me a tummy tuck"], "meaning": "A tummy tuck, professionally known as an abdominoplasty, is a somewhat expensive cosmetic procedure that can cost anywhere from $6,000 to $15,000 to complete. Lunchbox in particular would be a good candidate for this surgery because of his rather large stomach.", "annotation_id": "36777979", "url": "https://genius.com/36777979", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
