{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "NY (feat. Lunchbox)", "line": "We just landed in N.Y., flew out from ’Ella, yeah (Yeah) I put a few in a duffle bag for the plane, in the bookbag, take it wherever (Yeah, book ’em) Yeah, told ‘em I’m movin’ the Za’ every way, I ain’t talk to no jake, but I call up my dealer", "vault_lines": ["We just landed in N.Y., flew out from 'Ella, yeah (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat says he’s moving Za (Weed) from ‘Ella (Los Angeles) to New York. He avoids feds (Jakes) and talks to his dealer instead.", "annotation_id": "27548501", "url": "https://genius.com/27548501", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
