{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mysëlf", "line": "Talkin’ ’bout life, from the love, uh, dreams from above", "vault_lines": ["Talkin' 'bout life, from the love, uh, dreams from above"], "meaning": "Yeat starts talking more about his life instead of just flexing. When he says “from the love,” he could mean the support he gets from people or the emotions that push him to keep going. “Dreams from above” makes it sound like his goals feel bigger than him, like they’re meant to happen or coming from something higher, not just random.", "annotation_id": "39155552", "url": "https://genius.com/39155552", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
