{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "My wrist", "line": "Michael Jackson in his prime, bitch, hee-hee, and I’m bad", "vault_lines": ["Michael Jackson in his prime, bitch, hee-hee, and I'm bad"], "meaning": "Michael Joseph Jackson was an American singer, songwriter, dancer, and philanthropist. Known as the “King of Pop”, he is regarded as one of the most significant cultural figures of the 20th century.\n\nIn this line, Thugger is referring to one of the lines Micheal Jackson used to say, which was “hee-hee”\n\nThugger also refers to one of Micheal’s most popular songs, Bad", "annotation_id": "30146439", "url": "https://genius.com/30146439", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
