{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Morning mudd", "line": "No, baby girl, don’t try me, this not Maury", "vault_lines": ["No, baby girl, don't try me, this not Maury"], "meaning": "Yeat is warning one of his hoes that she better not try to get pregnant, fake a pregnancy, or possibly lie about him being the father to her baby in order to tie him down or get money from him.\n\nThen mentions “Maury” who is known widely for offering guests on his show the chance to take DNA tests to prove or disprove paternity.", "annotation_id": "24942101", "url": "https://genius.com/24942101", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
