{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Morning mudd", "line": "Most y’all lost, find yourself just like you Dory, let’s go", "vault_lines": ["Most y'all lost, find yourself just like you Dory, let's go"], "meaning": "In Pixar’s Finding Dory the regal blue tang finds her parents after being split from them at a young age. Just like Dory did, Yeat advises most of y'all to find yourself as Dory found her parents", "annotation_id": "23950706", "url": "https://genius.com/23950706", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Morning mudd", "line": "I be making album after album, got like twenty hits", "vault_lines": ["I be making album after album, got like twenty hits"], "meaning": "Yeat has a total of 6 albums on major DSPs, releasing three albums in 2021 alone, with Up 2 Më containing 22 songs. He also stated via an Instagram story that he will be releasing an album shortly after Up 2 Më.", "annotation_id": "23927809", "url": "https://genius.com/23927809", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Morning mudd", "line": "I just woke up in the morning, uh I just woke up in the morning, I got mud in my cup (Woke up) I just woke up in the morning, I got mud in my cup (Woke up) At least I woke up today", "vault_lines": ["I just woke up in the morning, uh"], "meaning": "Yeat uses the term “mud” to refer to the popular drug concoction in rap, lean, consisting of codeine and Sprite. Being a heavy user, Yeat expresses his relief after waking up after consuming the drug, glad he hasn’t died as an overdose is lethal.", "annotation_id": "23927731", "url": "https://genius.com/23927731", "state": "accepted", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
