{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Monëy so big", "line": "My money be twerkin’, my money do dances", "vault_lines": ["My money be twerkin', my money do dances"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Yeat’s 2021 song in the album 4L released on June 11,2021, Money Twërk. The main idea is that Sir Twizzy Rich got bands that dance.", "annotation_id": "25633985", "url": "https://genius.com/25633985", "state": "pending", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
