{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Monëy so big", "line": "Yeah, I had a fifty band and I turned it to a honeybun", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I had a fifty band and I turned it to a honeybun"], "meaning": "A honeybun is slang for hunnid band, which means a hundred thousand dollars.\n\nYeat once trolled an artist who was asking for a feature by telling them that it would cost a honeybun, much to the artist’s confusion:", "annotation_id": "24751294", "url": "https://genius.com/24751294", "state": "accepted", "votes": 82, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
