{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Money Twërk", "line": "Boosie", "vault_lines": ["Make hits, slidin' like Toosie, we rich like Lil' Boosie"], "meaning": "“Torrence Ivy Hatch Jr., better known by his stage name Boosie BadAzz or simply Boosie, is an American rapper. Hatch began rapping in the 1990s as a member of the hip hop collective Concentration Camp, eventually pursuing a solo career in 2000 with the release of his debut album Youngest of da Camp.”  (Wikipedia)", "annotation_id": "28771471", "url": "https://genius.com/28771471", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
