{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mob outsidë", "line": "Ridin’ round in a big Tonka, got the drop on ’em, got the battle bus", "vault_lines": ["Ridin' round in a big Tonka, got the drop on 'em, got the battle bus"], "meaning": "Yeat is, as usual, riding in a Tonka car, often times a truck or “tank” in this line. This is the “battle bus” from the popular game Fortnite that he’s referring to where you spawn when you’re game, dropping out of the bus and landing on an island with several different sections.\n\nBy saying that he’s getting the drop on whomever, he means in reality that he’s ready to attack somebody (preferably one of his opposition) within approaching them using the element of surprise and stealthy movements.", "annotation_id": "31167087", "url": "https://genius.com/31167087", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
