{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Made It On Our Own", "line": "I made ten mil’ while I’m faceless", "vault_lines": ["I made ten mil' while I'm faceless"], "meaning": "EsDeeKid flexes supposed eight-figure earnings from his career so far. This is particularly impressive given he has yet to reveal his true identity, remaining ‘faceless’.\n\nIn December 2025, he reportedly signed a deal with Capitol Records worth up to $30 million, making his claim actually seem like an understatement.\n\nNotably, Yeat also used to rock a face covering in public appearances and music videos, but has since been doing this less. For the music video to Made It On Our Own, both artists conceal their faces with balaclavas.", "annotation_id": "38802182", "url": "https://genius.com/38802182", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
