{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "Yeah, I heard that bitch wanna have sex with me", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I heard that bitch wanna have sex with me"], "meaning": "This goes back to the bar “This bitch mistake me for a broke” before the girl mistook yeat for someone with no money, she wanted to have intercourse with yeat.", "annotation_id": "31276843", "url": "https://genius.com/31276843", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "Bitch, I’m mad ’bout that (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm mad 'bout that (Ayy)"], "meaning": "As you see in other bars, yeat is obviously upset. The reason for being up set is this girl mistaking yeat for a broke boy which he is the opposite of that. Number two, someone stealing his flow. Now if we think back to June 10, 2021 yeat drops his popular song “Sorry Bout That” in that song he repeats the words “sorry bout that” what I think this means is that in sorry bout that yeat is apologizing for his actions. What is he apologizing for? Being mad at the girl who thought he was broke and the random stealing his flow. You may think “ but mad bout that dropped after sorry bout that” well you may be right but upon the release of sorry bout that, yea happens to be speaking in future tense. So this all adds up on why yeat was mad then sorry bout that.", "annotation_id": "31276754", "url": "https://genius.com/31276754", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "I pay people to make me money, I don’t do answers", "vault_lines": ["I pay people to make me money, I don't do answers"], "meaning": "You see yeat is one of the best rappers on earth. So regardless of his image people still enjoy his music all over the world. Yeat doesn’t have time or energy to answer any questions or do any photo shoots. Yeat spends his entire day making music and doing important things that help with his career. Yeat has no time for all of these events, so he rarely is seen out of his home or studio. Because of this yeat hires people to help him with contracts and things of that sort.", "annotation_id": "31276707", "url": "https://genius.com/31276707", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "I don’t be rappin’, I just be talkin’, this shit banter", "vault_lines": ["I don't be rappin', I just be talkin', this shit banter"], "meaning": "You see this needs to be discussed. Yeat is known for his fast paced rapping and his clean bars. Which some people who lack the intelligence and knowledge may not understand. Which cause people to hate on yeats music. Yeat is making fun of people for not understanding his bars even though someone with at least the basic understanding of music can understand.", "annotation_id": "31276663", "url": "https://genius.com/31276663", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "Flossin’ the diamonds, I ain’t brushin’ my teeth, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Flossin' the diamonds, I ain't brushin' my teeth, yeah"], "meaning": "Now when you have grills, rappers tend to put diamonds on them. Before I break this down we must discuss what grills are. Grills, also called “grillz” or “fronts,” are decorative covers often made of gold, silver or jewel-encrusted precious metals that snap over one or more of their teeth. They generally are removable but some grill wearers have had their teeth altered with gold crowns to permanently resemble a grill. Now the reason for yeat flossing his diamonds instead of brushing his teeth (which is dirty asf btw) is not specific but I can give some type of ideas. 1.) these grills might be permanent so brushing his teeth is impossible. So instead of brushing he will clean his diamonds on his teeth. 2.) gets values his grills more than he values his teeth. Or 3.) yeat lost his tooth brush, so until  he can buy another one, he must clean his grills for now.", "annotation_id": "31276594", "url": "https://genius.com/31276594", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "Why’d you try to steal my flow? Bitch, I’m mad ’bout that (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Why'd you try to steal my flow? Bitch, I'm mad 'bout that (Yeah)"], "meaning": "It seems that yeat is a little bit upset. This must be because there’s another rapper who uses his flow and style and can’t come up with something original.", "annotation_id": "31276588", "url": "https://genius.com/31276588", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
