{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "I was sorry ’bout that, bitch, but now I’m mad ’bout that (Ayy, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["I was sorry 'bout that, bitch, but now I'm mad 'bout that"], "meaning": "One of Yeat’s biggest hits is “Sorry Bout That”. This song references that song and is a sequel of sorts.", "annotation_id": "30922214", "url": "https://genius.com/30922214", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
