{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "(Keep it up, sharkboy)", "vault_lines": ["(Keep it up, Sharkboy"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag for Sharkboy, a producer and samplemaker from Russia. He co-producer Yeat’s popular song “Sorry Bout That” and produced known Yeat songs such as “Trëndy way” and the song “Yam” from his own album.\n\nHe has also notably worked with DC The Don, Kankan, and UnoTheActivist, among others.", "annotation_id": "29880150", "url": "https://genius.com/29880150", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
