{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Mad bout that", "line": "I bought a Tonka truck ’cause my money got big body", "vault_lines": ["I bought a Tonka truck 'cause my money got big body"], "meaning": "Yeat buys a “tonka truck”, which in his definition is a luxury SUV, such as a Lamborghini Urus or a Rolls Royce Cullinan. Yeat refers to his money as “big body”, because his net worth grew over his years of rapping, and the cars he owns are “big body” or large.", "annotation_id": "27565811", "url": "https://genius.com/27565811", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
