{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "MEh (Remix)", "line": "What you gon’ say if we get pulled over by them guys? I just tested her", "vault_lines": ["What you gon' say if we get pulled over by them guys? I just tested her"], "meaning": "Hahaha. I can’t help but chuckle to myself after hearing such a perfectly crafted bar By Mr. Smith. Here Noah Oliver Smith is referencing that when he was riding around with his “Shawty” he asked her what if they were to be pulled over by the Los Angeles Police Department what she would say to them. This is a test because what Noah, sorry Mr. Smith understands is that it is crucial that she does not illiterate any words to the police officer. Because anything that she could say has a chance of incriminating Mr. Smith.", "annotation_id": "27528766", "url": "https://genius.com/27528766", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "MEh (Remix)", "line": "On some stupid shit, I thought that I was dead, couldn’t open my eyes (Ah)", "vault_lines": ["On some stupid shit, I thought that I was dead, couldn't open my eyes (Ah)"], "meaning": "He got too fucked up off the opiates and thought he died. Those last 3 bars , in case you didn’t realise, cover all 3 of yeat’s favorite topics, drugs, sex and money, just like he says on “YAM” another one of his songs.", "annotation_id": "26297810", "url": "https://genius.com/26297810", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
