{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "MEh (Remix)", "line": "On some stupid shit, put 10K in that crash machine and doubled it", "vault_lines": ["On some stupid shit, put 10K in that crash machine and doubled it"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to the popular gambling game, Crash.\n\nThe rules of the game are to place a bet and wait for the multiplier to reach the expected point before cashing out, failing to cash out before the “Crash” will result in losing the bet without profit.", "annotation_id": "24661731", "url": "https://genius.com/24661731", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
