{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "M.F.U.", "line": "Live my life, born like this, I ain’t get my life (Yeah, yeah) They tryna see my life One of a kind, can’t repeat, can’t repeat (My life)", "vault_lines": [", they can't see me, baby"], "meaning": "Claims uniqueness, his lifestyle can’t be replicated.", "annotation_id": "38798318", "url": "https://genius.com/38798318", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
