{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "M.F.U.", "line": "Ketamine now and fucking on bitches I find out really was my medication", "vault_lines": ["Ketamine now and fucking on bitches I find out really was my medication"], "meaning": "It seems that after letting go of his past X, Oxy and Lean habits, Yeat has now found Ketamine to be a more suitable drug for his lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "36429192", "url": "https://genius.com/36429192", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "M.F.U.", "line": "Yeah, yeah, I’m Buddha, lil’ bitch, yeah, I’m meditatin’", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, yeah, I'm Buddha, lil' bitch, yeah, I'm meditatin'"], "meaning": "Yeat has come to terms with achieving nirvana because of how talented he has been with his music career, he is someone to be looked up to and he should be an inspiration.\nHe describes himself as the Buddha and he wishes to meditate now he has done so much with his career.", "annotation_id": "36428886", "url": "https://genius.com/36428886", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
