{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lyfestylë", "line": "Yeah, I love the feeling when it’s wrong, not right", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I love the feeling when it's wrong, not right"], "meaning": "Yeat has stated before that he loves violence as well as doing the wrong things. In his song “U Should Know” featured on his 4th studio album “2093” he says “Doing things that you never should…” proving that he loves to do things that he shouldn’t. In other words “doing the wrong things”.", "annotation_id": "30929031", "url": "https://genius.com/30929031", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
