{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lyfestylë", "line": "I’m a cheese-head", "vault_lines": ["All you wanna see is diamonds"], "meaning": "A fan of the Green Bay Packers is referred to as a cheese-head and Lil Wayne is one of the most famous ones. This love for the Packers even inspired him to make “Green and Yellow – Green Bay Packers Theme Song” in 2021.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YZucdBahsmI", "annotation_id": "30915625", "url": "https://genius.com/30915625", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lyfestylë", "line": "Ooh, look up, it’s a bird, look up, it’s a plane, no, bitch, it’s a Desert Eagle", "vault_lines": ["Ooh, look up, it's a bird, look up, it's a plane, no, bitch, it's a Desert Eagle"], "meaning": "When you look up you can see birds and planes but not in Lil Wayne’s presence.\nWhen you look up in Lil Wayne’s presence you will see a Desert Eagle.\n\nThe Desert Eagle is a gas-operated, semi-automatic pistol known for chambering the .50 Action Express, the largest centerfire cartridge of any magazine-fed, self-loading pistol.\n\nTaking away the Desert from the Eagle, an Eagle is a species of bird, which is a national animal in the United States of America.\n\nThis is clever because he mentions that when you look up you see a bird earlier in the sentence.", "annotation_id": "30911440", "url": "https://genius.com/30911440", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lyfestylë", "line": "All you wanna see is diamonds (Let it shine) All I wanna see is violence You don’t know how inside of my mind gets (Let it shine) Shut your mouth, close your eyelids", "vault_lines": ["All you wanna see is diamonds"], "meaning": "A possible message to the world of Hollywood only showing the main glamor of popular stars not showing how many suffer from depression and live deep inside of their minds, the last line could also signify how people are deaf and blind to the truth.", "annotation_id": "30910388", "url": "https://genius.com/30910388", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
