{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Luv monëy", "line": "[Chorus: Yeat]", "vault_lines": ["Perc' got me in my mental (Huh, huh)"], "meaning": "The chorus (also called the hook) is the catchy, repeated, main part of the song that summarizes its core idea, often featuring the most memorable lyrics and melody, designed to stick in the listener’s head and provide a central, sing-along moment between storytelling verses.", "annotation_id": "37878751", "url": "https://genius.com/37878751", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
