{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Luh m", "line": "No, I’m not your twizz, no, I’m not your friend", "vault_lines": ["No, I'm not your twizz, no, I'm not your friend"], "meaning": "Yeat’s “twizz” or alternatively “twizzy” are the members of his self-founded label, TwizzyRich. Yeat has mentioned the label previously in tracks before, such as an entire song to pay homage to the label—\"Twizzy Rich,“ from his debut studio album Up 2 Më.\n\nHe often refers to his “twizzy” or “twizz” as fellow-rapper and member of the collective SeptembersRich.", "annotation_id": "25717934", "url": "https://genius.com/25717934", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Luh m", "line": "Bitch, I touched an M, bitch, I touched an M (A lil’ M)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I touched an M, bitch, I touched an M (A lil' M)"], "meaning": "To “touch an M” means to garner enough USD to equal a total of a million dollars. Yeat has surpassed the milestone of “touching an M,\"— current exhibits of this can include his recent record-label deals for up to $13,000,000 as said in previous songs; most notably ”No commënt,“ with lines following:\n\nGot thirteen mill' from the deal, pockets so real (Ha, yeah)", "annotation_id": "25717863", "url": "https://genius.com/25717863", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Luh m", "line": "Broke-ass nigga eating his Chili’s", "vault_lines": ["Twenty bitches and they stripping, broke-ass nigga eating his Chili's"], "meaning": "September says, “eating chitlins.” Chitlins are the small intestines of domestic animals. They were often eaten by African-American slaves in America’s formative years.\nAs time progressed, chitlins became symbolic of those with lower socioeconomic status; hence, the term “broke.”", "annotation_id": "25247267", "url": "https://genius.com/25247267", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
