{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Luh m", "line": "Fucked my money up so much, it told me that it’s cumming", "vault_lines": ["Fucked my money up so much, it told me that it's cumming"], "meaning": "When two humans engage in sexual intercourse, sometimes it will continue to the point where one or multiple partners will achieve the point of an orgasm. Yeat often speaks about his obsession for money so he used the logic on his money.\n\nYeat has made a tweet similar to the line before:\n\nI was making my money twerk so good i was damn near finna fuck it\n\nThis line could also interpolate Kankan’s “Fuk Tha Clout,” which Yeat is featured on. On Yeat’s verse of the song, he uses similar lines reading:\n\nYeah, I fuck my money up so much it told me that it came", "annotation_id": "25169018", "url": "https://genius.com/25169018", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
