{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Livë Hi", "line": "They be getting high, I’ve been living high I seen my life flash in the corner of my eye", "vault_lines": ["They be getting high, I be livin' high"], "meaning": "Yeat taunts people who brag about getting high once or twice meanwhile he reiterates that he doesn’t just get high, but rather he is high all the time and lives in this state. Because of this he often feels as though he is going to die perhaps due to a drug overdose and he sees his life flash before his eyes. However this happens so often he is used to it and his life now flashes in his peripheral vision instead.", "annotation_id": "31483709", "url": "https://genius.com/31483709", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
