{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Livë Hi", "line": "You don’t put pointers in your watch, you deserve to trip and fall", "vault_lines": ["You don't put pointers in your watch, you deserve to trip and fall"], "meaning": "The arms which point the time in a watch, yeat prolly has gold or even diamond pointers in his watch referencing that whomever he is talking about doesn’t deserve the gold or even diamond pointers yeat also has because theyve not gone trough the same pain and suffering yeat has gone to get the gold or even diamond pointers he has in his watch.", "annotation_id": "29768500", "url": "https://genius.com/29768500", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Livë Hi", "line": "If you do me wrong, don’t matter who you is, bitch, I’ll turn to Melly", "vault_lines": ["If you do me wrong, don't matter who you is, bitch, I'll turn to Melly"], "meaning": "Yeat will wrong another if they wrong him, and pays homage to YNW Melly and the first-degree murder case in which Melly and his suspected accomplice YNW Bortlen were suspected of murdering YNW Sakchaser and YNW Juvy. Both of them were murdered on October 26, 2018, but after this accident, Melly’s song “Murder On My Mind”, which was released on March 4, 2017, started gaining traction online. In the song, he goes in depth of explaining a violent encounter – accidentally shooting an unknown individual:\n\nYellow tape around his body, it’s a fucking homicide\nHis face is on a T-shirt and his family traumatized\nI didn’t even mean to shoot him, he just caught me by surprise\nI reloaded my pistol, cocked it back, and shot him twice\n\nA Genius video of Melly breaking down the lyrics to “Murder on My Mind” is posted on YouTube:\n\nI’m a pussy murderer, I murder the vagina. And I murder the beat. I am not no hu—human murderer.\n\nDespite “Murder on My Mind” mentioning a death in where Melly was involved, recent court decisions show that the song is prejudicial, meaning it would be evidence that would cause an inherent bias against the defendant without actually being evidence that contributes to the case.", "annotation_id": "28770020", "url": "https://genius.com/28770020", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Livë Hi", "line": "Independent than you and richer than all of y’all", "vault_lines": ["Independent than you and richer than all of y'all"], "meaning": "in between Trendi and Up 2 me he signed on of the biggest record deals of all time, some estimate in around 6 ms", "annotation_id": "28663678", "url": "https://genius.com/28663678", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
