{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Livë Hi", "line": "Yeah, y’all gon’ rock Marc Jacobs, I’m gon’ rock Margelly", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, y'all gon' rock Marc Jacobs, I'm gon' rock Margelly"], "meaning": "Yeat has previously expressed his distaste for the fashion brand Marc Jacobs in the same album on the song “Money Twerk”\n\nYeah, you rock Marc Jacobs, you smelly (Uh)\n\nIn this line he reminds the listener he still holds that sentiment for the mid brand.", "annotation_id": "25305340", "url": "https://genius.com/25305340", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
