{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Live", "line": "When I take this Perc’ inside her home, I feel so sexually", "vault_lines": ["When I take this Perc' inside her home, I feel so sеxually"], "meaning": "Percocets, being a form of opioids, release neurotransmitters similar to those released by arousal. This leads to an effect where the two sensations are often confused.", "annotation_id": "39508311", "url": "https://genius.com/39508311", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
