{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lil Krazy", "line": "Mean feen", "vault_lines": ["I just been actin' lil' mean feen"], "meaning": "This could be a possible reference to the song Mëan feen", "annotation_id": "31179591", "url": "https://genius.com/31179591", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lil Krazy", "line": "How the fuck my own brother switch up on me? Shit so crazy (Crazy)", "vault_lines": ["How the fuck my own brother switch up on me? Shit so crazy (Crazy)"], "meaning": "This a clear diss towards SeptembersRich, who use to be Yeat’s bro but apparently he switched up.\n\nYou can see many times on IG Story after June 2023, Sept has been seen throwing subliminals shots at Yeat numerous amounts of times and Yeat has stayed quiet until now apparently. Also, the next bar appears to be another Sept diss.\n\nIt seems like a set of lyrics where the artist expresses feelings of betrayal or disappointment towards someone close, possibly a brother figure, who has seemingly changed or turned against them. The lyrics suggest a sense of disbelief (“How the fuck my own brother switch up on me?”) and frustration (“Shit so crazy”).\n\nThe lines also hint at financial difficulties or downfall (“That motherfucker really idiot broke now, shit so cranky”), with a possible assertion of power or influence (“We can get ya killed in many ways, we got the word, real basic”).\n\nThe mention of “Backwood, we could lace it” might refer to rolling a Backwood cigar filled with marijuana, possibly using it metaphorically to enhance or amplify the situation or emotions being conveyed in the lyrics.\n\nOverall, these lyrics depict a mix of emotions, including betrayal, frustration, and a sense of potential power or authority, conveyed through raw and direct language.\n\nAlso,\n\nIn that case, if the lyrics mention “Backwoods, we could lace it,” it could indeed imply a reference to disrespecting or metaphorically “smoking” someone, Sept in this context, by rolling a Backwood cigar with the intention of symbolically disrespecting or dismissing them.\n\nRap lyrics often contain layers of meaning and references that can be interpreted in various ways based on the context and the artist’s intentions.", "annotation_id": "30239624", "url": "https://genius.com/30239624", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lil Krazy", "status": "done", "targets": 13, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Yeat-lil-krazy-lyrics", "genius_title": "Lil Krazy", "genius_id": 9797079, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lil Dub", "line": "Yeah, lie my ass off at the doc’s, I’m fake coughin’ Yeah, ”What’s your favorite syrup?”, Coffee (Coffee)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, lie my ass off at the doc's, I'm fake coughin'"], "meaning": "We would expect a person like Yeat to favorite the consumption of cough syrup in a mixture of any carbonated soda (thus, creating the popular liquidated drug “lean”), but Yeat puts a spin on things by claiming that his favorite type of syrup, in general, is coffee syrup.\n\nThis may be his response to his doctor one line above as he states he purposefully lies about his health condition to his doctor, supposedly to get prescription drugs.", "annotation_id": "34127010", "url": "https://genius.com/34127010", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Lil Dub", "line": "(I’m shy, oh my God)", "vault_lines": ["I just dropped a dub, Balenciaga (Woo-woo-woo, yeah)"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag for Nadddot. The tag is a sample that comes from North Carolina rapper, Ashnikko and her genius verified interview for her song STUPID.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/aXR4APbzN1U?t=88", "annotation_id": "26224261", "url": "https://genius.com/26224261", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
