{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "I said, “R.I.P. to them pussies,” told them, “Rest in piss” (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I said, \"R.I.P. to them pussies,\" told them, \"Rest in piss\" (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is making a clever play on words with the term “rest in peace”, by instead saying “rest in piss”. This line is widely considered one of the most creative rap lyrics ever written.", "annotation_id": "35773820", "url": "https://genius.com/35773820", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
