{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "Let’s go shoppin’, finna send this bitch the Balenci’ emoji (I’m crazy)", "vault_lines": ["Let's go shopping, finna send this bitch the Balenci' emoji (I'm crazy)"], "meaning": "It is unclear what Yeat is referring to by “the Balenci emoji”, seeing as this is not a standard emoji that commercially available phones come equipped with. Did he make it up, and in any case, what does it mean? It is not unthinkable that a man of his esteem would have access to emojis not publically available. Highlighting this would thus accentuate his social standing.\n\nAnother possible explanation is that Yeat is displaying his enhanced cognitive abilities, specifically as it relates to language capacities. In addition to his native Twizzy-Speak, he shows that he is also fluent in emoji communication, all the while he exhibits decent English proficiency at the same time. Quite the polyglot.", "annotation_id": "34252304", "url": "https://genius.com/34252304", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "What would you do if I was wrong? What would you do if I was broke? (Crazy) Even though I wouldn’t be (I’m crazy)", "vault_lines": ["What would you do if I was wrong? What would you do if I was broke? (Crazy)"], "meaning": "One of the hardest Yeat bars ever.\nThis bar is phrased as if he is asking this question to someone who he feels might be leeching onto his success. He seems to wonder if they would really be by his side if he wasn’t up.\n\nWe then get a glimpse into Yeat’s thoughts as the ad-lib “crazzzyy” echos through the air, like the simple thought of not being rich is something unfathomable to him.\n\nHe then comes back to reality and clarifies that the answer to his question doesn’t really matter, as he knows would never be wrong, and definitely never be broke…", "annotation_id": "34178492", "url": "https://genius.com/34178492", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "Only way I know how to sleep is with some Tris or E (I ain’t lyin’)", "vault_lines": ["Only way I know how to sleep is with some Tris or E (I ain't lying)"], "meaning": "Here Yeat clearly states that he cannot fall asleep without ingesting lean more specifically trisaminomethane or tris for short which is a type of  lean commonly used by rappers. when consumed it makes one drowsy and gives them a ‘high’ effect", "annotation_id": "32953590", "url": "https://genius.com/32953590", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "I’m finna ship out this weed, but I don’t even smoke no more", "vault_lines": ["I'm finna ship out this weed, but I don't even smoke no more"], "meaning": "talking about how yeat used to ship out weed but  wasnt even doing weed himself because it made him lazy, this was back when he would scam", "annotation_id": "30811817", "url": "https://genius.com/30811817", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
