{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Liftëd", "line": "I ain’t even go to sleep yet, it’s one o’clock, yeah, I took a Tesla (I’m talkin’ P.M.)", "vault_lines": ["I ain't even go to sleep yet, it's one o'clock, yeah, I took a Tesla (I'm talking PM)"], "meaning": "Yeat is stating that he hasn’t slept in a while and probably won’t sleep anytime soon, given the fact that he took a Tesla (XTC pill). This could also be interpreted as him riding out in a Tesla while sleep deprived, but knowing he’s good because of the auto pilot.\n\nIn the second part he geniously follows up the previous line by clearing up any confusion it evokes; 1am isn’t that late, so it could raise questions. By confirming the PM period he explains the meaning of the line.", "annotation_id": "26444143", "url": "https://genius.com/26444143", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
