{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "Hold on, yeah, let King Tonka talk", "vault_lines": ["Hold on, yeah, let King Tonka talk"], "meaning": "While tonka’s original definition is a big-body luxury truck/SUV, Yeat has now nicknamed himself as King Tonka. Obviously he is a human and not a car, so this is probably a way to say he is really rich by having all the tonka’s.\n\nHe has used this nickname before in various tracks:\n\nKing tonka\n\nIt king Tonka (Err, err), it king Tonka (Err, err), it king T—\n\nGrowing Pains\n\nKing Tonka, King Tonka (What?) Tell me like King Tonka, King Tonka", "annotation_id": "39164654", "url": "https://genius.com/39164654", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "And when I came all on her chest (Uh), it makes a brand-new sweater (Uh, CDG)", "vault_lines": ["And whеn I came all on her chest (Uh), it makes a brand-new sweater (Uh, CDG)"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about when he has sex with her he ejaculates on the girl he is having sex with chest. This makes her sweater turn a different color making it “brand new”.", "annotation_id": "39084841", "url": "https://genius.com/39084841", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "I be talkin’ so much shit, I might be the richest shit lil’ kid (I am)", "vault_lines": ["I be talkin' so much shit, I might be the richest shit lil' kid (I am)"], "meaning": "Yeat reuses an old adlib from 2019>, referencing his “kid” self.", "annotation_id": "39070356", "url": "https://genius.com/39070356", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "I might as well be a bartender, when she pull up, she gon’ sip", "vault_lines": ["I might as well be a bartender, when she pull up, she gon' sip"], "meaning": "Yeat is comparing his lifestyle to a bar where he’s the one providing all the drinks and substances for the people around him. By calling himself a bartender, he’s saying he controls the flow of the party and keeps everyone sipping. It shows that he’s the provider in his circle.", "annotation_id": "39061464", "url": "https://genius.com/39061464", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "I’m a nicotine fiend, she a hookah and I rip (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["I'm a nicotine fiend, she a hookah and I rip (Uh)"], "meaning": "Yeat is playing on his well-known addiction to vaping and smoking, comparing him being a “nicotine fiend” to a relationship. By calling a girl a “hookah” and saying he “rips” it, he’s using smoking as a metaphor for how he wants a woman for his own satisfaction. He’s only involved for the quick hit or the temporary high before moving on.", "annotation_id": "39061422", "url": "https://genius.com/39061422", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "I’m on demon time all day, I don’t ever have the time to fuckin’ tell her", "vault_lines": ["I'm on demon time all day, I don't ever have the time to fuckin' tell her"], "meaning": "Yeat uses this line to show how locked in he is with his work and his vices, leaving zero room for distractions. Being on “demon time” all day means he’s constantly chasing money and his own grind, so he literally doesn’t have the time to stop and explain himself to her. Yeat is saying his lifestyle moves too fast for any emotional conversations.", "annotation_id": "39061271", "url": "https://genius.com/39061271", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "She be thinkin’ that just ’cause we fucked, this shit is matrimony", "vault_lines": ["She be thinkin' that just 'cause we fucked, this shit is matrimony"], "meaning": "Speaking from the perspective of one of the girls he has fucked, they claim they are bound to marriage after having sex together.\n\nHowever, he’s too busy with his life and precious time to even consider this proposal of marriage. Instead, as stated in the next line, he has already gone and fucked this girl’s friend, proving how he doesn’t care about any girl he fucks personally.", "annotation_id": "39061181", "url": "https://genius.com/39061181", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "And she always give good head like she a fortune teller", "vault_lines": ["And she always give good head like shе a fortune teller"], "meaning": "A fortune teller uses their “head” (psychic ability/mind) to see the future, and Yeat is using it as a play on words for a women giving him “head”.", "annotation_id": "39061173", "url": "https://genius.com/39061173", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Let King Tonka Talk", "line": "And you can go talk shit online, I’m still the biggest in this bitch (You hide)", "vault_lines": ["And you can go talk shit online, I'm still the biggest in this bitch (You hide)"], "meaning": "Yeat doesn’t care what anybody who criticizes him has to say about him. He flaunts off the fact that he’ll still remain relevant with the rap scene, despite the everchanging genres and styles.\n\nThe adlib, “You hide”, makes Yeat directly tell these haters that they don’t do anything outside of their lives on the internet, and that they wouldn’t ever talk shit to his face.", "annotation_id": "39061107", "url": "https://genius.com/39061107", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
