{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Latë Night", "line": "And the crazy thing is that last week I took a Tesla and almost died (Huh) And the crazier thing is I took a Tesla right now and I’m feelin’ fine (Fuck it) I think last week I took two Addy’s on top and that’s why I died, yeah (I’m retarded)", "vault_lines": ["And the crazier thing is I took a Tesla right now and I'm feelin' fine (Fuck it)"], "meaning": "Tesla is apart of an populated drug called “Ecstasy” It’s the orange one with the car brand “Tesla” Logo on it.", "annotation_id": "26977180", "url": "https://genius.com/26977180", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
