{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Last Day", "line": "I already died but I got nine lives like a cat does (I got nine lives)", "vault_lines": ["I already died but I got nine lives like a cat does (I got nine lives)"], "meaning": "Apparently, when this tape was being made Yeat had a serious overdose and almost death to the point where he thought he would never be back. And in his words, The devil saved his life and the devil kept him alive and made him a star. He speaks about dying and coming back to life like how a cat has nine lives, good comparison Mr. Smith.", "annotation_id": "29878124", "url": "https://genius.com/29878124", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
