{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Last Day", "line": "And it feel so good to be this damn rich and they don’t gotta ask me why", "vault_lines": ["And it feel so good to be this damn rich and they don't gotta ask me why"], "meaning": "Yeat is known for making money in “different” ways, so this line interprets he found another way to mask how he mainly makes money, so, he doesn’t get questioned how he’s so rich. Luh Crank", "annotation_id": "25519017", "url": "https://genius.com/25519017", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
