{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYING 5 FUN", "line": "Uh, I’m still on X, and I’m still on X, and I’m still on X", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I'm still on X, and I'm still on X, and I'm still on X"], "meaning": "“X” refers to the drug ecstasy (MDMA). This is a common phrase used in many songs by Yeat, including Up off X.", "annotation_id": "33319374", "url": "https://genius.com/33319374", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYING 5 FUN", "line": "(Ooh) You must have thought I was done, huh, huh (Ooh) You must have thought I was done, huh, yeah We lying for fun, and bitch, just do what I want, huh, huh You must have thought I was done You must have thought I was done (Ah, ah) Pull up in that big Bentley truck (Ah, ah) Come on, you must have thought I was done (Ah, ah) You gon’ fold over, you must have thought it was guns (Ah, ah, woo, woo)", "vault_lines": ["(Ooh) You must have thought I was done, huh, huh"], "meaning": "Call back to his 2021 track “Lying 4 fun”:\n\nYou must’ve thought I was done (Haha)\nYou must’ve thought I was done (That’s not how I'ma end it)\nYou must’ve thought I was done (I put my whole shit in it)\n\nThe title of this track is also a callback; the 4 being replaced with a 5 may indicate that this is a sequel to the first,", "annotation_id": "33317942", "url": "https://genius.com/33317942", "state": "accepted", "votes": 45, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
