{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Laughin’ at yo’ ass, yo’ ass a joke, ah (Ha) You ain’t grown man, you a lil’ ho", "vault_lines": ["You ain't grown man, you a lil' ho, woah, oh"], "meaning": "Yeat could be dissing Ian here. Ian posted a snippet to his YouTube channel of his unrealeased song 2FACE. People quickly commented how this resembled a leaked Yeat song called Repent. Later, Yeat posted a story containing several laughing emojis, fans realized that this could have been a diss meant for Ian.", "annotation_id": "33332962", "url": "https://genius.com/33332962", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "They just gon’ copy, that’s how it go", "vault_lines": ["They just gon' copy, that's how it go"], "meaning": "Might be a Ian sneak diss, but is most likely just him talking about people biting the recent 2093 sound", "annotation_id": "33332249", "url": "https://genius.com/33332249", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "I Cash App for her tits, she prolly think I’m a lick", "vault_lines": ["4LYFER, I Cash App for her tits, she prolly think I'm a lick"], "meaning": "Durk performs a double entendre which is hard asf.\n\nThe first meaning is about scamming through cash app in an attempt to “hit a lick” (rob someone).\n\nThe second meaning is about sexual activity and licking the breasts to arouse your partner", "annotation_id": "33332208", "url": "https://genius.com/33332208", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
