{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Off the Molly, now I gotta pee", "vault_lines": ["Off the Molly, now I gotta pee"], "meaning": "The irresponsible consumption of MDMA (also known as molly) can lead to symptoms akin to that of “Neurogenic Bladder Dysfunction,”a condition that can cause the bladder to be unable to properly control the flow of urine. Lil Durk is no stranger to the usage of the drug, even dedicating a song to it.", "annotation_id": "33318916", "url": "https://genius.com/33318916", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Ride around with that stick, shoot a nigga in his shit", "vault_lines": ["4LYFER, ride around with that stick, shoot a nigga in his shit"], "meaning": "Lil Durk has been attributed to the murder of Saviay'a Robinson, also known as “Lul Pab.” He was the cousin of Quando Rondo, the rapper who was also involved in a physical altercation with King Von. Robinson’s death was most likely in retaliation for King Von’s death by the hands of Quando Rondo affiliate Lul Timm.", "annotation_id": "33318661", "url": "https://genius.com/33318661", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Yeah, big mag", "vault_lines": ["(Woo-ooh-ooh-ooh) Diamond out (Yeah, big boy diamond like—), rock out (Dream, this shit go dummy"], "meaning": "A drum mag (drum magazine) is a type of firearm magazine that is circular in shape and can hold a large number of rounds compared to standard box magazines. It is often used in automatic or semi-automatic firearms for sustained fire.\n\nUsually drum mags hold between 50 and 100 rounds.", "annotation_id": "32253681", "url": "https://genius.com/32253681", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Dream, this shit go dummy", "vault_lines": ["(Woo-ooh-ooh-ooh) Diamond out (Yeah, big boy diamond like—), rock out (Dream, this shit go dummy"], "meaning": "tag of dreamawake, a producer known for his work with yeat and unotheactivist", "annotation_id": "30609638", "url": "https://genius.com/30609638", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Yeah, with a mask, pull up, fifty whack (Pull up, fifty whack, boom)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, with a mask, pull up, fifty whack (Pull up, fifty whack, boom)"], "meaning": "Yeat says, “with the mask, pull up get them wacked”. Referring to wearing a ski mask and pulling up in a car on somebody and taking them out with guns.", "annotation_id": "30395754", "url": "https://genius.com/30395754", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LYFESTYLE", "line": "Pump", "vault_lines": ["(Woo-ooh-ooh-ooh) Uh, shotgun, pump"], "meaning": "yeat is clearly referring to the hit multiplayer video game known as fortnite battle royale. the game first became popular after its release in late 2017, and has since become one of the biggest video games in the world.\n\nthe pump shotgun is a strong weapon in said game.", "annotation_id": "30369668", "url": "https://genius.com/30369668", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
