{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOVELOVË IT", "line": "Never take it back, we don’t got no strings attached (Oh) I like you like that, I don’t like to double back and dip in (Oh)", "vault_lines": ["I love-love it (I love-love it)"], "meaning": "Yeat shows he likes to keep things surface level. He shows he can like someone but it’s clear he wants no commitment.", "annotation_id": "39215899", "url": "https://genius.com/39215899", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOVELOVË IT", "line": "You said, “It’s bad” (Huh-ah) And no receipt for you (Huh-ah) I said, “It’s bad” Yeah, ’cause I seen it through Yeah, and I know I don’t got ’cause, yeah I’m into you", "vault_lines": ["I love-love it (I love-love it)"], "meaning": "She’s basically calling out the feeling as bad, and for once he actually feels it instead of brushing it off. Even though he knows it’s messed up and doesn’t have an excuse still admits he’s into her.", "annotation_id": "39215886", "url": "https://genius.com/39215886", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
