{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "Yeah, we outside, on Bottega, we got mob ties", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, we outside, on Bottega, we got mob ties"], "meaning": "He is saying that he is out and about in public, riding in or wearing Bottega (a high-end fashion brand), and that he has connections to a powerful group or crew. “Mob ties” refers to having influential or loyal associates, adding to his status and reputation.", "annotation_id": "37774662", "url": "https://genius.com/37774662", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "That bitch gon’ ride me, she hop, she scotch", "vault_lines": ["(Ooh-ooh), that bitch gon' ride me, she hop, she scotch"], "meaning": "Yeat is implying this intimate partner of his is not only going to ride him (another term for the sex position known as cowgirl/reverse cowgirl) but she will have to hop when performing this position, most likely a causation from the penis size being above average height. Due to the height of the penis being longer, the partner must do a hopping motion in order to complete the movement successfully. “Scotch” in this context refers to hopscotch, a fun and silly game often played by children, an ode to former collaborator Autumn.", "annotation_id": "37436804", "url": "https://genius.com/37436804", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "Smokin’ this bitch like a blunt, I’ma tell this bitch LooseLeaf (Smokin’ this) Smokin’ this bitch like a blunt, I’ma tell this bitch LooseLeaf (LooseLeaf)", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' this bitch like a blunt, I'ma tell this bitch LooseLeaf (Smokin' this)"], "meaning": "Yeat likely alluding to the loose-leaf tobacco wrap; the Leaf wrap is made from natural, whole-leaf tobacco\n\nhttps://www.tobaccostock.com/products/loose-leaf-natural-dark-wraps-8-packs-of-5#:~:text=The%20Loose%20Leaf%20wrap%20is,wrap%20with%20no%20added%20flavorings.", "annotation_id": "36568612", "url": "https://genius.com/36568612", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "Tiffany girl", "vault_lines": ["I just went and got a new watch, we just went and left with a Tiffany girl"], "meaning": "“Tiffany Girl” refers to the women who worked at Tiffany Studios, a decorative arts company that were known for their innovative and creative glass-item production.\n\nThe founder of the company, Louis Comfort Tiffany, made it appear to the public that he made all of the pieces and items himself, but it is later revealed that the “Tiffany Girls” worked behind the scenes by designing many of the luxury items that the company made.", "annotation_id": "36477605", "url": "https://genius.com/36477605", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "Two-tone bitch in the ’Bach", "vault_lines": ["Two-tone bitch in the 'Bach"], "meaning": "“Two tone bitch” refers to a biracial female, while “in the ‘bach” addresses her being in his maybach", "annotation_id": "36454158", "url": "https://genius.com/36454158", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOOSE LEAF", "line": "I’m goin’ two hundred and eighty, I’m on the Autobahn, baby, come save me", "vault_lines": ["I'm goin' two hundred and eighty, I'm on the Autobahn, baby, come save me"], "meaning": "“Autobahn” is an word that origins from Deutsch, which means freeway.\nIn this line, Yeat specifically refers to German superhighways, as they are large and known for having sections without mandatory speed limits.", "annotation_id": "36438149", "url": "https://genius.com/36438149", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
