{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCO", "line": "Uh-uh, I need a mil’ for a show, uh-uh, I need a— Uh-uh, I need a—, uh-uh, I need a— Uh-uh, I need a—, uh-uh, I need a— Uh-uh, I need a—, uh-uh, I need a— Uh-uh", "vault_lines": ["Uh-uh, I need a mil' for a show"], "meaning": "Playing directly off the interlude sampling Zias and Blou discussing forgetfulness, Yeat gets stuck repeating “I need a—”, showing he completely forgot what else he was about to say.", "annotation_id": "40811014", "url": "https://genius.com/40811014", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
