{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "They talkin’ ’bout me like I am a thesaurus", "vault_lines": ["They talkin' 'bout me like I am a thesaurus"], "meaning": "A thesaurus, sometimes called a synonym dictionary or dictionary of synonyms, is a reference work which arranges words by their meanings, sometimes as a hierarchy of broader and narrower terms, sometimes simply as lists of synonyms and antonyms.\n\nhttps://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https%3A%2F%2Fshop.merriam-webster.com%2Fproducts%2Fthe-merriam-webster-thesaurus-new-edition&psig=AOvVaw0TjcGq_xIPvWmdiSdNZshI&ust=1705352677886000&source=images&cd=vfe&ved=0CBIQjRxqFwoTCJiBjfjj3YMDFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\n\nDue to his well-known status in the underground HipHop scene, midwxst is saying how everyone keeps on talking about him and his music since it’s starting to become mainstream.", "annotation_id": "30603238", "url": "https://genius.com/30603238", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
