{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I’m one of a kind, no, you can’t reproduce me", "vault_lines": ["I'm one of a kind, no, you can't reproduce me"], "meaning": "his unique flow and lyrical abilities are something that nobody could replicate even if they tried to. That’s why midwxst is a one of a kind artist.", "annotation_id": "30603208", "url": "https://genius.com/30603208", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I’m with the clan, they can’t understand These aren’t even my friends, we all in a fam This isn’t the squad, it’s full on the mob", "vault_lines": ["I'm with the clan, they can't understand"], "meaning": "Matt OX is saying how he’s very close with his “fam'” and how they are more than just friends.", "annotation_id": "30603200", "url": "https://genius.com/30603200", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I’m right outside of the Benz", "vault_lines": ["I'm right outside of the Benz"], "meaning": "The word “Benz” is a reference to the car company Mercedes-Benz.\n\nMercedes-Benz, commonly referred to as Mercedes and sometimes as Benz, is a German luxury and commercial vehicle automotive brand established in 1926. Mercedes-Benz AG is headquartered in Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.", "annotation_id": "30400103", "url": "https://genius.com/30400103", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Tris", "vault_lines": ["I tip up off the drank, I can't stand (Luh Tris"], "meaning": "Tris is a codeine and promethazine cough syrup company, famous for being inexpensive at the cost of quality when compared to Actavis or other brands such as Wockhardt.", "annotation_id": "30219182", "url": "https://genius.com/30219182", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Geekin’", "vault_lines": ["I drop a new song, all my fans know they geekin'"], "meaning": "‘Geeking’ is an expression signified by an intense excitement and desire to move, and is generally displayed under environments of extreme happiness. This shows that midwxst has an army of loyal fans.", "annotation_id": "30219135", "url": "https://genius.com/30219135", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
