{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I don’t play fair, get a foul and it’s flagrant", "vault_lines": ["I don't play fair, get a foul and it's flagrant"], "meaning": "A flagrant foul is a type of foul in basketball. The way a flagrant foul is called is by having excessive or violent contact that could be injuring the player that is being fouled, however, not all flagrant fouls are intentional.", "annotation_id": "28765652", "url": "https://genius.com/28765652", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Run the track like a motherfucking relay", "vault_lines": ["Run the track like a motherfucking relay"], "meaning": "A relay race is a track and field racing competition that is played on a team where one person hands a baton off to the person in front of them. The only two Olympic relay race distances are 4x100 (400 meters) and 4x400 (1,600 meters).", "annotation_id": "28765637", "url": "https://genius.com/28765637", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Bentley", "vault_lines": ["I only give a fuck 'bout this Bentley"], "meaning": "Bentley is a luxury vehicle manufacturer that was founded in 1919 in London, England. Bentley is currently a subsidiary of Volkswagen AG. As of 2023, Bentley only has 3 models in production: Bentayga, Continental GT, and Flying Spur.\n\nBentley Bentayga\n\n\n\nBentley Continental GT\n\n\n\nBentley Flying Spur", "annotation_id": "28765536", "url": "https://genius.com/28765536", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I don’t got no Masi", "vault_lines": [", I don't got no Masi"], "meaning": "A “Masi” is a Maserati. Maserati is a luxury vehicle manufacturer located in Bologna, Italy and was formed in 1914.", "annotation_id": "28765525", "url": "https://genius.com/28765525", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Luh Wocky", "vault_lines": ["I took the cup, got luh Wocky"], "meaning": "Wock is short for Wockhardt. Wockhardt is a global pharmaceutical company which produced over the counter codeine and promenthazine cough syrup which many consider as high grade.  By using wock in a song, rappers are most likely referring to high grade cough syrup or Wockhardts own cough syrup.", "annotation_id": "28409008", "url": "https://genius.com/28409008", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Yeah, I’m a Gemini, bitch, fuck a Taurus", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm a Gemini, bitch, fuck a Taurus"], "meaning": "Gemini and Taurus are both astrology signs.  Midwxst was born in June 5th, meaning he’s a Gemini and does not get along with Tauruses.", "annotation_id": "28305603", "url": "https://genius.com/28305603", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Bitch, I just pulled up in a Lamb’ I just pulled up in that big boy Tonka", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I just pulled up in a Lamb'"], "meaning": "Yeat makes his entrance coming through in a Lamborghini truck/SUV, having a larger build similar to a Tonka truck.", "annotation_id": "27500489", "url": "https://genius.com/27500489", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Diamond my vision, Cartier my lens (Diamonds)", "vault_lines": ["Diamond my vision, Cartier my lens (Diamonds)"], "meaning": "Cartier is a luxury brand founded in 1847 specializing in high jewelry, jewelry, timepieces & accessories. They are mostly known for their eyewear, which are sometimes encrusted with diamonds.\n\n\n\nSignature C de Cartier Precious Sunglasses.", "annotation_id": "27089351", "url": "https://genius.com/27089351", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Got some boys in the hood, I ain’t talkin’ ’bout Morris", "vault_lines": ["Got some boys in the hood, I ain't talkin' 'bout Morris"], "meaning": "“Boys in the hood” refers to the 1991 American coming-of-age hood drama film known as Boyz  n the Hood. The film features a slew of notable celebrities, such as Cuba Gooding Jr., Laurence Fishburne, and Ice Cube.\n\n\n\n“Morris” refers to the actor Morris Chestnut, who stars in the film as Ricky Baker. Ricky is well-known within the film for his death scene, in which he is shot and killed by members of the Bloods gang.", "annotation_id": "25794140", "url": "https://genius.com/25794140", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I’ve been bangin’ my chest like I’m D.K., spin tracks like a DJ", "vault_lines": ["I've been bangin' my chest like I'm D.K., spin tracks like a DJ"], "meaning": "“D.K.” refers to Donkey Kong, who is a major character within the Super Mario franchise. He is best known for the Donkey Kong Country video game and the original Donkey Kong game, which was the first game Mario appeared in under the video game company Nintendo. A constant habit that Donkey Kong does is bang his chest, similar to a gorilla.\n\n\n\nA DJ, short for disc jockey, is a person who plays recorded music for an audience. A common DJ setup includes turntables, which they spin in order to create a variety of musical changes, with examples including percussion breaks and beat loops.\n\n\n\nThe turntables can be seen under the DJ.", "annotation_id": "25794114", "url": "https://genius.com/25794114", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I need some glory, I feel like I’m Morgan, no Freeman", "vault_lines": ["I need some glory, I feel like I'm Morgan, no Freeman"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the 1989 American historical war drama film Glory.\n\n\n\nMorgan Freeman stars in the film as Sergeant Major John Rawlins.", "annotation_id": "25792860", "url": "https://genius.com/25792860", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
