{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Like I’m Doofenshmirtz, you know I’m plotting, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Like I'm Doofenshmirtz, you know I'm plotting, yeah"], "meaning": "A reference to the show Phineas and Ferb in which their pet platypus is a secret agent who goes against a evil scientist plotting plans every episode", "annotation_id": "25711908", "url": "https://genius.com/25711908", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Under me, no score", "vault_lines": ["I kill the beat, put it under me, no score"], "meaning": "Referring to music artist “underscores”. Confirmed on twitter.\nhttps://twitter.com/midwxst/status/1520081353299177472?s=20&t=pYrCQZnQUo8wEHkcxT5ywg", "annotation_id": "25711088", "url": "https://genius.com/25711088", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "That boy is a coward like Courage", "vault_lines": ["That boy is a coward like Courage"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the classic T.V. cartoon, Courage the Cowardly Dog. Courage is the main character of the show who is known for being a coward, asserting the message that fear is okay through the four seasons of the show.\n\nMidwxst is comparing someone to Courage the Cowardly Dog saying that they’re most likely cowardly and run from confrontation.", "annotation_id": "25708996", "url": "https://genius.com/25708996", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "Feel like I’m Bruno Mars, open that door", "vault_lines": ["Feel like I'm Bruno Mars, open that door"], "meaning": "This is a refference to Silk Sonic or also known as the duo of Bruno Mars and Andeerson .Paak grammy-nominated R&B song “Leave The Door Open”", "annotation_id": "25703533", "url": "https://genius.com/25703533", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "I use the mic like a sword and I’m Jason", "vault_lines": ["I use the mic like a sword and I'm Jason"], "meaning": "Jason Vorhees is the main protagonist of the Friday 13th movies. Jason mission on the movie is basically stalk and hunt down other characters with his sword, Midwxst reference’s Jason’s “Sword” as his mic.\n\n\n\nMidwxst also referenced his microphone on the same song but with a different line:\n\nThe mic is my hammer, and, bitch, I am Thor", "annotation_id": "25703306", "url": "https://genius.com/25703306", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "LOCK IT UP", "line": "The mic is my hammer and, bitch, I am Thor", "vault_lines": ["The mic is my hammer and, bitch, I am Thor"], "meaning": "Thor is a character from the Marvel Comics which was inspired by the Norse mythology-god with the same name. Thor in the Marvel Comics has a sledge-hammer, or also known as the “Mjolnir” on the comics, Midwxst says he uses his mic as how Thor uses his hammer on the comics.", "annotation_id": "25703203", "url": "https://genius.com/25703203", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
