{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Krazy up", "line": "[Verse 2: Lil Yachty]", "vault_lines": ["I got so much cheese, I don't know what to buy (Yeah, uh) (Ooh)"], "meaning": "All aspects of Lil Yachty’s verse, from the seemingly freestyled one-take of the flow and lyrics on what possibly appears to be a Yeat open, to the sound quality, point towards this being a rough draft of a verse. We can expect to see a more polished-up Yachty verse if this song gets officially released.", "annotation_id": "25640366", "url": "https://genius.com/25640366", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
