{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "I ain’t living life like this, sit here and sit down, talk to these motherfuckers", "vault_lines": ["I ain't living life like this, sit here and sit down, talk to these motherfuckers"], "meaning": "Yeat is a somewhat sociable yet awkward and antisocial person. The proper term is an Extroverted Introvert. Yeat is saying that because of his futuristic lifestyle and antisocialness that he will not sit down and talk or respond to his opps because they are not worth his time.", "annotation_id": "34457979", "url": "https://genius.com/34457979", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "When you live this life like a futuristic motherfucker You ain’t never gotta lie and shit, like these motherfuckers You ain’t never gotta a lotta shit to talk to these motherfuckers, you ain’t gotta lie", "vault_lines": ["When you live this life likе a futuristic motherfucker"], "meaning": "Yeat is known to have a futuristic personality and also claims to see the future(Breathe, FATE, Flytroop, e.t.c). This futuristic persona which he labels as the Psycho CEO is very selfish, insightful, wise, and narcissistic. This is also why we have this album and is the theme of this album. Yeat is trying to say that with this futuristic persona he doesn’t have to lie, talk behind someones back, or make rumors like his enemies 0pium and SLAYWRLD. He is basically implying that with his futuristic lifestyle he is not on the same level as these people dissing him and will not associate with these broke bums.\n\nP.S. sorry for the rant just wanted to provide background info", "annotation_id": "34457884", "url": "https://genius.com/34457884", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "Can you keep pushin’? Yeah, can you keep pushin’? Yeah", "vault_lines": ["Can you keep pushin'? Yeah, can you keep pushin'? Yeah"], "meaning": "I´m pretty sure he´s saying “Ke-Keep Pushing”, not “Can´t keep pushing”.", "annotation_id": "31605946", "url": "https://genius.com/31605946", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "I like to close myself off I like to keep my death’s off this", "vault_lines": ["I like to close myself off"], "meaning": "Yeat, conveys a sense of self-protection and a desire to maintain boundaries around sensitive topics such as emotions and mortality. It suggests a tendency towards emotional self-preservation and a reluctance to engage deeply with certain aspects of life and existence.", "annotation_id": "31208186", "url": "https://genius.com/31208186", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
