{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "When you live like this, like me, you don’t give a fuck ‘bout these motherfuckers not doin’ nothing", "vault_lines": ["When you live like this, like me, you don't give a fuck 'bout these motherfuckers not doin' nothing"], "meaning": "Yeat boasts saying that when you are successful and rich like him, you don’t need to have a single care in the world.", "annotation_id": "30954480", "url": "https://genius.com/30954480", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "I ain’t seen nobody go where I can’t go", "vault_lines": ["I ain't seen nobody go where I can't go"], "meaning": "Yeat continuously explains to his fans that he is on a whole other level in the rap game due to his god-like persona, creative music style, and how versatile he is. In this lyrics he is explaining that there is no one above him. Because of this no one can do what he can’t because they would be objectively “better” than him.", "annotation_id": "30940951", "url": "https://genius.com/30940951", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Keep Pushin", "line": "From a different fucking planet, bitch", "vault_lines": ["From a different fucking planet, bitch"], "meaning": "yeat thinks he is from a different planet because of a alien encounter he had when he was young, this alien encounter is the reason we even have this album right now. Yeat also said this album was him trying to find what planet he is from", "annotation_id": "30901855", "url": "https://genius.com/30901855", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
