{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "Y’all boys really be pussy, cap on cap like gun got a blank in it (Oou-ouu, ouu-hoo)", "vault_lines": ["Y'all boys really be pussy, cap on cap like gun got a blank in it (Oou-ouu, ouu-hoo)"], "meaning": "In this line Yeat further bashes the “boys” he’s been referring to earlier in this verse, saying that they’re pussies and that they “cap on cap”, which in this case means they frequently bluff. Their bluffs in this line being that their weapons have blanks in them, therefor they pose no harm to Yeat or his dominant attitude.", "annotation_id": "28032821", "url": "https://genius.com/28032821", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "I don’t be sniffin’ shit, but I’m gon’ always keep the hanky (Yeah, a hank)", "vault_lines": ["I don't be sniffin' shit, but I'm gon' always keep the hanky (Yeah, a hank)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to Mr. Hankey, the Christmas Poo from the show “South Park”.\n\nLike his name suggests, Mr. Hankey is a piece of shit", "annotation_id": "26217576", "url": "https://genius.com/26217576", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "Used to be shipping the Za’, I’ma send this shit out like wrapping a blankety (Yeah, hoo)", "vault_lines": ["Used to be shipping the Za', I'ma send this shit out like wrapping a blankety (Yeah, hoo)"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining how he used to ship, or sell, (presumably) large packages of “Za,” a slang word for marijuana, describing his method of wrapping the marijuana, comparing it to folding up a blanket.", "annotation_id": "25631985", "url": "https://genius.com/25631985", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "Took another perky, bitch, I’m cranky like I’m janky (Woo, luh jank) Woke up on the Lamb’, I took a crushed up Perc’, a kranky (Yeah, a crank)", "vault_lines": ["Took another perky, bitch, I'm cranky like I'm janky (Woo, luh jank)"], "meaning": "Yeat has taken a crushed up Percocet, presumably snorting it in a similar method to the intake of cocaine. Afterwards, he awoke from his drug-induced paralysis in a Lamborghini motor vehicle.\n\nYeat refers to the Percocet as a “kranky,” a term that has historically been linked to meth use. Further, he compares the high to that felt by a “janky,” playing on the term “junkie.”\n\nHe similarly rapped about his love of cranks on his February 2022 single “Still counting,” rapping:\n\nLuh crank, luh crank, luh crank (Ooh-ooh)\nLuh crank, luh crank, luh crank (Ooh-ooh, go)", "annotation_id": "25487274", "url": "https://genius.com/25487274", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "I’m flashin’ all my jewelry, you fuckin’ on some skankies (Yeah, a skank)", "vault_lines": ["I'm flashin' all my jewelry, you fuckin' on some skankies (Yeah, a skank)"], "meaning": "Yeat draws a comparison between himself and his opps; while Yeat is reaping the rewards of his success, evidenced by expensive jewelry, his opps are sleeping with “skankies,” a slang word for prostitutes.", "annotation_id": "25487244", "url": "https://genius.com/25487244", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant rëlax", "line": "Yeah, just got off the phone with Uzi, he told me it’s ready (My twizz)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, just got off the phone with Uzi, he told me it's ready (My twizz)"], "meaning": "Yeat shares an insight into his newfound friendship with Philly rapper Lil Uzi Vert, hinting that the duo’s rumored collaborative project may be finished.\n\nAlternatively, he could simply be referring to 2 Alivë: Geëk Pack, which contains two features from Uzi.", "annotation_id": "25485045", "url": "https://genius.com/25485045", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
