{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant dië", "line": "How the hell you stealing Percs’, dawg?", "vault_lines": ["How the hell you stealing Percs', dawg?"], "meaning": "Yeat doesn’t understand how people don’t have enough money to buy percs. He believes that drugs should only be a priority once you’ve become rich, and have yourself secure.", "annotation_id": "29538181", "url": "https://genius.com/29538181", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
