{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant changë", "line": "I done got my money up and that bring jealousy How you were rockin’ with me, now you’re hatin’ on me, now you envy me? And that top tier fuck shit, I don’t rock with, keep it away from me", "vault_lines": ["I done got my money up and that bring jealousy"], "meaning": "These lyrics express Yeat’s experience of facing jealousy after achieving financial success. The shift from having support to encountering hatred and envy is highlighted.", "annotation_id": "31110489", "url": "https://genius.com/31110489", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
