{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Kant Switch", "line": "All my bitches bisexual (Yeah), said that I’m they favorite dude (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["All my bitches bisexual (Yeah), said that I’m they favorite dude (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat, coming back to a topic from a previous line in the verse where he claims that his Glock goes both ways (in other words, is bisexual regardless of gender), claims that all of his preferred women are bisexual.\n\nIn spite of Yeat’s attractiveness and the interests of the females, they claim to have Yeat be “they favorite dude”, possibly because of his wealth and status.\n\nJust because Yeat’s women are bisexual doesn’t specifically mean that Yeat is too; he may just prefer to be attracted to the community of bisexuals connected to the female gender.\n\nhttps://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSJVSQtkf5F3JIeHi9NQK04T4uXjWen83I23AP1pMsqjbaAbjkAmrV-_pmL8Jpvr3_KiCE&usqp=CAU", "annotation_id": "30158942", "url": "https://genius.com/30158942", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
