{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Jus bëtter", "line": "Bitch, I’m on this plane, I’m flying higher than you (Ayy, ah)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm on this plane, I'm flying higher than you (Ayy, ah)"], "meaning": "This yeat lyric clearly depicts how much of a lyrical genius he is, he depicts a metaphor of being high (on drugs) while being on a plane but also when he is on the plane he is literally high up in the sky but he’s also high on drugs so therefore he is higher than you.", "annotation_id": "25311483", "url": "https://genius.com/25311483", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
