{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Jus bëtter", "line": "Bitch, I’m on the charts, I’m going higher than you", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm on the charts, I'm going higher than you"], "meaning": "Possibly a diss on the pluggnb arist Autumn!, or just all of that genre. He says he’s higher up on the charts than them, which very well may be true. 2 Alivë reached #1 in the world on Apple Music charts the day it was released.", "annotation_id": "25179543", "url": "https://genius.com/25179543", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Jus bëtter", "line": "I’m crazy, I’m bipolar, bipolar, bipolar", "vault_lines": ["I'm crazy, I'm bipolar, bipolar, bipolar"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining how he has bipolar disorder which has made him feel as if he is crazy and has gone & lost.😔\nBipolar depression is part of a larger condition called bipolar disorder. Specifically, the “lows” that you may be feeling, those moments of hopelessness, these are the possible symptoms of the depressive moments associated with bipolar disorder. Bipolar depression is a lifelong condition that creates unusual mood changes that can vary in length and severity. You can go from feeling revved up and euphoric to feeling down and hopelëss.", "annotation_id": "25179392", "url": "https://genius.com/25179392", "state": "pending", "votes": 37, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
