{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "IMMA BASTARD", "line": "Yeah, I got big guns, I ain’t missing, missing I got big guns, big switches, big switches", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got big guns, I ain't missing, missing"], "meaning": "“Big guns” and “switches” (gun modifications) are used as exaggerated symbols of power and dominance. In Yeat’s style, they often function more as energy and intimidation than literal threats.", "annotation_id": "39082791", "url": "https://genius.com/39082791", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
