{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "IMMA BASTARD", "line": "Y’all been dreamin’ about this life for no reason (No reason) I- I- I- I’ll give your ass a reason (Give your ass a reason)", "vault_lines": ["Y'all been dreamin' about this life for no reason (No reason)"], "meaning": "Yeat calls out people who fantasize about his lifestyle without understanding what it takes. “Give you a reason” implies he’s about to prove why he actually deserves it, contrasting real experience vs. empty ambition.", "annotation_id": "39082756", "url": "https://genius.com/39082756", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
