{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "I got / evëry spot*", "line": "I got money, yeah, in every spot (Spot, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I got money, yeah, in every spot (Spot, yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is known for having a plethora of private estates. In this line he talks about how he has money at every one of his properties.", "annotation_id": "30934708", "url": "https://genius.com/30934708", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
