{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "I Lyke", "line": "With my lil’ bitch in the hills (Mmm-hmm) We got addicted to pills (Yes), that do not mean this shit real (No) You gotta know how I feel (Feel) You gotta get why I’m crackin’ these seals (Why?)", "vault_lines": ["With my lil' bitch in the hills (Mmm-hmm)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying that he is hanging out with his bitch in his mansion in the hills, and he remarks that even though he and his girl got addicted to pills together, it doesn’t necessarily mean that they’re in a relationship.\nHe basically explains that in order for him to fw her she has to truly understand why he is a real geeker. She has to understand why he sips the purp", "annotation_id": "37735522", "url": "https://genius.com/37735522", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
