{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "I Feel Alive 4 A Min*", "line": "Yeah, know you feel some way, didn’t know you felt", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, know you feel some way, didn't know you felt"], "meaning": "Yeat is informing us the listener that he knows how the person he is singing about feels some way, although he did not realize how deep these emotions are.", "annotation_id": "40916543", "url": "https://genius.com/40916543", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
