{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Hurricaine", "line": "It’s a lot of wind between us, Hurricane Katrinas Push it far away, yeah, push it to the North Carolinas", "vault_lines": ["Know it's all a lot"], "meaning": "Hurricane Katrina was a devastating Category 5 hurricane which struck the United States on August 29, 2005, killing 1392.", "annotation_id": "30693503", "url": "https://genius.com/30693503", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
