{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "How I Eat", "line": "Red like me some Chanel", "vault_lines": ["Red like me some Chanel"], "meaning": "Red is the ultimate symbol of beauty, inextricably linked to Chanel’s history and to its language of style. Red exemplifies the CHANEL’s passion for colour. Worn proudly or slipped on like a discreet punctuation mark, it speaks volumes about the power and freedom— of movement and of thought—that Gabrielle Chanel wanted to give women when she created her first lipstick in 1924.", "annotation_id": "29769664", "url": "https://genius.com/29769664", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
