{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "How I Eat", "line": "I’m using the force, they calling me Obi", "vault_lines": ["I'm using the force, they calling me Obi"], "meaning": "The Jedi Master contends with the consequences of his greatest defeat – the downfall and corruption of his one-time friend and apprentice, Anakin Skywalker, who turned to the dark side as evil Sith Lord Darth Vader. he is a character from star wars who has the power of the force", "annotation_id": "25519042", "url": "https://genius.com/25519042", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "How I Eat", "line": "Jimmy Neutron, gotta blast", "vault_lines": ["Hold on, I got rich quick, Jimmy Neutron, gotta blast"], "meaning": "Google users\n“Jimmy Neutron: Boy Genius” tells the simple story of a 10-year-old boy and his robot dog – battling evil, rescuing his parents, saving the Earth – and returning home in time for dinner. Jimmy’s always inventing gadgets to make his life in Retroville more interesting.", "annotation_id": "25519039", "url": "https://genius.com/25519039", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
