{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "I can’t do no more or less, ’cause I’m the one now", "vault_lines": ["I can't do no more or less, 'cause I'm the one now"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about his responsibility. He is too famous and that’s why he can’t do less, his music should get better. And at the same time Yeat can’t do no more because he has millions of fans all over the world and every word he says has a big influence on his audience. Now Yeat is a big musician.", "annotation_id": "32037415", "url": "https://genius.com/32037415", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
