{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "I been shmunked out", "vault_lines": ["I just been takin' that smacks, I been shmunked out"], "meaning": "Shmunked is another one of the words created by Yeat. It most likely means being high or unconcious if you take into consideration the context.", "annotation_id": "27208494", "url": "https://genius.com/27208494", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "Yeah, come back to this crib and I got plenty guns, uh Yeah, come back to this crib, security kill you once, bitch, uh You can come back everyday, we will gon’ kill you for months", "vault_lines": ["You can come back everyday, we will gon' kill you for months"], "meaning": "Yeat continues to explain what risks and rewards he faces. He has to protect himself at all costs, and at all times; kind of like the Pope must be protected… Holy ones.", "annotation_id": "26760108", "url": "https://genius.com/26760108", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "Yeah, uh, holy fuck, uh, in the Bentley truck (Phew) Uh, riding ’round with bullets, I got plenty bucks", "vault_lines": ["Uh, riding round with bullets, I got plenty bucks (Come), uh"], "meaning": "Here Yeat quickly explains his situation, but it is not just a flex. He’s in the Bentley truck with bullets to protect himself and his plenty bucks. It’s another quick explanation of the rewards and risks of living this lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "26760098", "url": "https://genius.com/26760098", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "I just pulled up in that fuckin’ Urus, in that Urus truck I been living life like way too fast, I had to perish up", "vault_lines": ["I just pulled up in that fuckin' Urus, in that Urus truck"], "meaning": "If you string these two lines together, you may notice the double meaning behind it. Yeat is living the fast life, driving a fast car that he bought with cash he earned with fast money, perishing up. Once again the idea of purifying something (money) can also be seen here. The risk of the fast life almost demands the reward.", "annotation_id": "26760063", "url": "https://genius.com/26760063", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "Uh, I just popped that boy and copped that Birkin", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I just popped that boy and copped that Birkin"], "meaning": "Again, cleaning off the money. The first activity is likely motivated by money. Once the mission is complete, Yeat invests that cash into an expensive Birkin product.", "annotation_id": "26759997", "url": "https://genius.com/26759997", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "(Holy fuck, I took twenty, feelin’ it, bitch, I’m the holy one)", "vault_lines": ["(Yo, Luca, where you at?"], "meaning": "Took twenty refers to twenty mg of Percocet, a considerable dose. After feelin' it, Yeat begins to really feel himself, stating he’s the holy one. Given his LSD use he probably does believe in the idea that he is the holy one in more ways than one, mostly in that he can do what he pleases when he pleases.", "annotation_id": "26759981", "url": "https://genius.com/26759981", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "(Holy fuck, ridin’ ’round in that Urus, you look broke as fuck)", "vault_lines": ["(Yo, Luca, where you at?"], "meaning": "Simple comparison bar aimed at proving that Yeat is on another level than his opps, as he rides in the expensive Lamborghini, you look broke as fuck. It is important to pay attention to how he states you LOOK broke as fuck, emphasizing his riches AND his ability to flex as he pleases. This is common in the game, as people think trappers do all this flashy stuff to look cool, this is how they invest and sanitize their funds.", "annotation_id": "26759941", "url": "https://genius.com/26759941", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Holy 1", "line": "Neon guts, triple guts (Skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["Neon guts, triple guts (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "Yeat is mentioning Lil Uzi Vert’s song “Neon Guts” that was release on August 25, 2017. This song was apart of Uzi’s 4th studio album “Luv is Rage 2”.", "annotation_id": "26676005", "url": "https://genius.com/26676005", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
