{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Heavy stunts", "line": "I do a whole lot of motherfuckin’ shit, yeah, ’cause it’s my time", "vault_lines": ["I do a whole lot of motherfuckin' shit, yeah, 'cause it's my time"], "meaning": "yeat realizes how he is in his prime right now as this song is released. His last album, ‘2093’ was a huge success and yeat claims that he had been sober throughout the whole album. After the success of 2093, he has made it clear that he wants to release another album by the end of the year. He has already let the fans hear ‘HeliMAn’. Releasing 2 albums in a year is what yeat considers a massive achievement for him which would explain why he thinks he’s in his prime.", "annotation_id": "31893056", "url": "https://genius.com/31893056", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
