{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Heavy stunts", "line": "You do what I said, you do what I said, you do what I said, yeah", "vault_lines": ["You do what I said, you do what I said, you do what I said, yeah"], "meaning": "Very similar to the “Simon Says” snippet,\n\nLike Simon said, do what I said to ya\n\nthe next bar also matches with it\n\nGuillotine his head and send his head to ‘em\n\nIt’s possible that “Simon Says” and Heavy stunts were the same song, it’s also noteworthy to mention the beat similarity.", "annotation_id": "31696934", "url": "https://genius.com/31696934", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
