{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Havin motion", "line": "Light it up and then I send it to the back, get it gone (Gone, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Light it up and then I send it to the back, get it gone (Gone, ooh)"], "meaning": "Light it up and then I send it to the back, get it gone (Gone, ooh)", "annotation_id": "40078829", "url": "https://genius.com/40078829", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Havin motion", "line": "Yeah, they send you to the ocean, signed it out with the devil (Ooh) Yeah, he said we havin’ motions (Signed it out, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, they send you to the ocean, signed it out with the devil (Ooh)"], "meaning": "These lines connect street violence with the idea of “motion.” “Send you to the ocean” suggests making someone disappear or getting rid of them completely, while “signed it out with the devil” makes the threat sound darker and almost contractual. The next line, “he said we havin’ motions,” ties that danger back to status: in this world, having “motion” does not just mean money or fame, but also having people, power, and dangerous connections behind you.", "annotation_id": "40078820", "url": "https://genius.com/40078820", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Havin motion", "line": "Yeah, we just havin’ motion, light it up like a spliff (Ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, we just havin' motion, light it up like a spliff (Ooh)"], "meaning": "“Motion” is slang for having activity, money, influence, or momentum around you. The rapper is saying that his lifestyle is active and fast-moving, while “light it up like a spliff” connects that energy to smoking and turning up. The line works as both a flex and a mood-setter for the chorus, showing that he and his circle are constantly moving, spending, and enjoying themselves.", "annotation_id": "40078801", "url": "https://genius.com/40078801", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
