{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Havin motion", "line": "Yeah, I’m too up, so my brother been servin’ Canes (Cane)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm too up, so my brother been servin' Canes (Cane)"], "meaning": "Raising Cane’s is a fast food restaurant that primarily serves fried chicken. In this line, he states that his brother, SeptembersRich, is “servin' Canes.” “Serving chickens” means selling the stimulant drug, Cocaine. This means SeptembersRich is selling cocaine.", "annotation_id": "32698411", "url": "https://genius.com/32698411", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
