{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Hatër", "line": "We been up all day, I’m off Adderall", "vault_lines": ["We been up all day, I'm off Adderall"], "meaning": "Adderall is a prescription medication primarily used to treat attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) and narcolepsy. When taken as prescribed, it can help improve focus, attention, and impulse control in individuals with ADHD. However, like any medication, Adderall can have side effects. Common side effects may include increased heart rate, elevated blood pressure, decreased appetite, dry mouth and insomnia.\n\nYeat is stating that he’s been up all night from taking Adderall. This is probably the side effect from taking this medicine and could be suffering from insomnia.", "annotation_id": "31433390", "url": "https://genius.com/31433390", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
