{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Hatër", "line": "Yeah, I came with a blick, I just brought the fire (Bah)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I came with a blick, I just brought the fire (Bah)"], "meaning": "“Came with a blick” meaning he came with a gun more specifically a pistol (most of the times reffering to a glock)\n\n.jfif)\n\nI just brought the fire could both mean that the fact that he brough his blicky (glock) he is ready for the smoke (anyone that is trying to mess with him) or it could mean that he brought some good weed or something.", "annotation_id": "27495190", "url": "https://genius.com/27495190", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
