{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "HYD", "line": "I see all my kids, like I just came with the UV light (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["I see all my kids, like I just came with the UV light (Ugh)"], "meaning": "“Kids” is a slang term for semen, which glows under UV light.\n\nIn his 2022 song Rich Minion, Yeat raps:\n\nI call my Minion my children (Children)\nI call my children my Minions\n\nHere, Yeat is referring to his fans as his “children”\n\nIn this bar, Yeat acknowledges his fans by saying that he sees them just like semen under a UV light.", "annotation_id": "31261938", "url": "https://genius.com/31261938", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "HYD", "line": "When we fuckin’ this bitch, go retarded, I had to go call her the lil’ short bus (The lil’ short bus)", "vault_lines": ["When we fuckin' this bitch, go retarded, I had to go call her the lil' short bus (The lil' short bus)"], "meaning": "“Short bus” is North American slang for the smaller bus that is used to transport special needs students..\n\nYeat first raps the words “go retarded” to mean “go crazy”, meaning that he’s aggressive in bed. However, the meaning of the words then changes to their derogatory meaning, calling the girl a “retard”, implying that she is special needs and requires the short bus.", "annotation_id": "31261847", "url": "https://genius.com/31261847", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "HYD", "line": "I see all my kids, like I just came with the UV light (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["I see all my kids, like I just came with the UV light (Ugh)"], "meaning": "“Kids” is a slang term for semen, which glows under UV light.\n\nIn his 2022 song Rich Minion, Yeat raps:\n\nI call my Minion my children (Children)\nI call my children my Minions\n\nHere, Yeat is referring to his fans as his “children”\n\nIn this bar, Yeat acknowledges his fans by saying that he sees them just like semen under a UV light.", "annotation_id": "31261742", "url": "https://genius.com/31261742", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
