{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Gët Busy", "line": "Most importantly, my brother pull up with (Brrt), yeah, blam", "vault_lines": ["Most importantly, my brother pull up with (Brrt), yeah, blam"], "meaning": "yeat is stating that his “brother” (likely a close friend or possibly one of his actual brothers luca or ethan) will bring guns to the location. he doubles down on this with the clever use of onomatopoeia, making the “blam” sound of a gun.", "annotation_id": "30563644", "url": "https://genius.com/30563644", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Gët Busy", "line": "Yeah, brought a dub inside Chanel, I’m finna go crazy (Ooh, ooh, ooh, yeah, crazy)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, brought a dub inside Chanel, I'm finna go crazy (Ooh, ooh, ooh, yeah, crazy)"], "meaning": "Yeat explains how he brought a ‘dub’ to a Chanel Store. A ‘dub’ is slang for $20,000 USD, so Yeat is saying he will spend 20k at Chanel.", "annotation_id": "29536334", "url": "https://genius.com/29536334", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Gët Busy", "line": "Got surround sound inside this tizzy (Whew)", "vault_lines": ["Got surround sound inside this tizzy (Whew)"], "meaning": "Yeat explains how his ‘tizzy’, short for ‘tonka’, has high-quality speakers around the car. This creates the ‘surround sound’ he mentions in this line.\n\nAlso, his tizzy refers to his Mercedes GLE AMG which he often mentions in various different songs.", "annotation_id": "29528860", "url": "https://genius.com/29528860", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Gët Busy", "line": "Drank and X, molly with Perc’, that’s my shit (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Drank and X, molly with Perc', that's my shit (Yeah, yеah)"], "meaning": "Drank and X (=Codein and Alprazolam)\nMolly with Perc (=MDMA and Pills which contain Oxycodon)\n\nYeat mixes Drugs which can be very dangerous but he likes it.", "annotation_id": "29240833", "url": "https://genius.com/29240833", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
