{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Griddlë", "line": "I might’ve geeked out my mind, lil’ bitch, I’ma snort me a line of that tus’", "vault_lines": ["I might've geeked out my mind, lil' bitch, I'ma snort me a line of that tus'"], "meaning": "Tus’ is short for tusi, a powdered drug also referred to as pink cocaine.\n\nFrom DEA.gov:\n“Pink cocaine has also been referred to as tusi.  The original compound in tusi was 2C-B, a psychedelic phenylethylamine. Once 2C-B became harder to get, drug organizations shifted to a drug cocktail, which they dyed pink and sold as pink cocaine.\n\nPink cocaine rarely contains 2C-B anymore, and the actual substances included in pink cocaine are not known until a sample is tested. It is likely, however, that pink cocaine contains no cocaine. DEA laboratory testing has identified pink powders containing combinations such as:\n\nKetamine and MDMA\nMethamphetamine, ketamine, and MDMA\nCocaine and fentanyl\nFentanyl and xylazine”", "annotation_id": "39411598", "url": "https://genius.com/39411598", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Griddlë", "line": "My tummy got fatter, my money got Lizzo", "vault_lines": ["My tummy got fatter, my money got Lizzo"], "meaning": "Lizzo refers to the Amercian singer who happens to be big asf", "annotation_id": "39266882", "url": "https://genius.com/39266882", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
