{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Griddlë", "line": "I might’ve geeked out my mind, lil’ bitch, I’ma snort me a line of that tus’", "vault_lines": ["I might've geeked out my mind, lil' bitch, I'ma snort me a line of that tus'"], "meaning": "Yeat is here saying he would snort a line of Toseina a Spanish brand of prescription oral cough syrup containing codeine. Obviously if he snorted it he would drown since it is a liquid but this just goes to show how geeked out of his mind Yeat really was.", "annotation_id": "39142758", "url": "https://genius.com/39142758", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
