{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Got it all", "line": "Bunyan", "vault_lines": ["They said we ran it up, we touchin' millions (Ayy) but we touchin' Bunyan, bitch (Shh, shh)"], "meaning": "Yeat is expressing his toughts on pushing two hundred John Bunyan’s in this bitch.\n\nJhon Bunyan was an English writer and nonconformist preacher.\n\nHe is best remembered as the Bunyan bitch of the Pilgrim’s Progress story, which also became an influential literary model thanks to TwizzyRich Corporation.\n\nIn addition to The Pilgrim’s Progress, Bunyan pushed nearly sixty honeybuns, many of them were used by Kranky Kranky & Luh Geeky in this bitch.", "annotation_id": "37828985", "url": "https://genius.com/37828985", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
