{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Got it all", "line": "They barely hear what I’m sayin’, but I gotta tell you to get to that brain", "vault_lines": ["They barely hear what I'm sayin', but I gotta tell you to get to that brain"], "meaning": "It literally says:\n\n “They barely hear what I’m saying but I gotta tell you I get to they brain”\n\n\n\nBut this fucking ugly ass nigga locked the page to farm IQ and doesn’t accept the lyric edit proposals fake ass fan. Nigga old ass look like the mf PBS kids logo fake fan ass fuck nigga locking every page and pushing 40 old ass nigga. Cuba Gooding ass monkey\n\n\n\nLook at that 30 year fucking old ass nigga and tell me it look like he listen to Yeat😹 fuckin old ass clown locking shit for fun nobody asked dis crusty bum nigga to do shi and nobody was vandalizing the page either bum ass nigga. THIS nigga so annoying too he does this to every page that gets views and does NOT even listen to the other artists or Yeat that’s why dis bitch nigga getting cooked 🤡\n\nAnd look years later he lost dat shit dumbass pussy allat fuck shit for nothin\n\n\n nigga got hoed off Genius got turned to that shitty ass contributor role NPC now 😹 dat bitch ass nigga tell dat pussy nigga go push sum fuckin carts pussy broke ass bum bitch😹😹", "annotation_id": "30990837", "url": "https://genius.com/30990837", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
