{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Got it all", "line": "I heard they tried to call God, bitch, I work with the devil, kid", "vault_lines": ["I heard they tried to call God, bitch, I work with the devil, kid"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat openly implies that he works the dark side. This is not the first time that he mentions his contact with the devil in his lyrics,\n\nOn Monëy so big (Up 2 Më), one of his biggest songs yet, he says\n“'Bout to tell you how I’m doin' and shit\nI got the devil on my phone, he told me, keep doin' this shit\nYeah, devil taught me how to get rich\nYeah, how many bands? six-six”\n\nOn Ya Ya (Up 2 Më),\n“I just called the devil, go ahead, upside-down the T”\n\nAlso on Comë on (Lyfë),\n“The devil gon' call up my phone, lil' bitch, you know when it’s real, uh (You know when it’s real)\nI sit in the circle, I’m walking around, I’m knowing the drill\nYeah, the devil be calling my phone like every damn day, man, the Perkies is real (Perkies is real)\"", "annotation_id": "26761790", "url": "https://genius.com/26761790", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Got it all", "line": "I heard they tried to call God, bitch, I work with the devil, kid", "vault_lines": ["I heard they tried to call God, bitch, I work with the devil, kid"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat openly implies that he works the dark side. This is not the first time that he mentions his contact with the devil in his lyrics,\n\nOn Monëy so big (Up 2 Më), one of his biggest songs yet, he says\n“'Bout to tell you how I’m doin' and shit\nI got the devil on my phone, he told me, keep doin' this shit\nYeah, devil taught me how to get rich\nYeah, how many bands? six-six”\n\nOn Ya Ya (Up 2 Më),\n“I just called the devil, go ahead, upside-down the T”\n\nAlso on Comë on (Lyfë),\n“The devil gon' call up my phone, lil' bitch, you know when it’s real, uh (You know when it’s real)\nI sit in the circle, I’m walking around, I’m knowing the drill\nYeah, the devil be calling my phone like every damn day, man, the Perkies is real (Perkies is real)\"", "annotation_id": "26761781", "url": "https://genius.com/26761781", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Got it all", "line": "(dulio, 力を貸して)", "vault_lines": ["I got a brand new drop (Drop), and watch how y'all just flop, yeah (dulio, 力を貸して)"], "meaning": "This is the official producer tag of dulio, one of two producers listed in the credits. Yeat and dulio have collaborated frequently before, like tracks suck as Rollin, Told ya and No commënt", "annotation_id": "26761771", "url": "https://genius.com/26761771", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
