{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "I’m in a mansion by myself (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm in a mansion by myself (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Unlike other artists, Yeat didn’t start out rich; in this verse, we can see how he was able to buy a mansion and live in it on his own.", "annotation_id": "40407496", "url": "https://genius.com/40407496", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
