{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "Yeah, I ain’t in no telly, I’m in the belly, in Corvette, let’s floor the gas now (Ride out)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I ain't in no telly, I'm in the belly, in Corvette, let's floor the gas now (Ride out)"], "meaning": "telly = luxury hotel\nBelly =  kind of like a hood area\n\nhe tells us how he is out there stunting on the hood instead of being in a hotel.", "annotation_id": "33072108", "url": "https://genius.com/33072108", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
