{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "Yeah, they wanna sit back and talk they shit, they don’t got nothing to piss on (Nothing at all) Called up Eliantte, canary diamonds, all them pissed on (Brrt, brrt)", "vault_lines": ["Going back to LA, going back to LA, yeah"], "meaning": "Yeat states here saying that “They wanna sit back and talk that shit, they don’t got nothin to piss on” which means that nobody can piss meaning hate on him now since he has gotten rich.\n\nYeat also states here that the canary diamonds he recently splurged on from Jeweler Elliot Eliantte saying all of them are “pissed on”. Yeat likes to play with the word “piss” especially on canary diamonds since these particular diamonds have a yellow appearance looking like piss.", "annotation_id": "27701709", "url": "https://genius.com/27701709", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "And you would’ve thought I would’ve been the one that died, but the gun got the tits on it (Tits)", "vault_lines": ["And you would've thought I would've been the one that died, but the gun got the tits on it (Tits)"], "meaning": "The hundred round extended clip has a gun looks similar women’s breast and is referred to here as tits.\n\nYeat says here that people thought he died but his gun has an extended clip.", "annotation_id": "25590462", "url": "https://genius.com/25590462", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "All of my twizzies been running this shit the fuck up every day, they can’t keep up the pace (Run it up)", "vault_lines": ["I just hit NY"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to his friends as twizzies and his label is even called tizzy rich.", "annotation_id": "25590451", "url": "https://genius.com/25590451", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "[Intro] I just hit NY And you know I was on a private jet flight Going back to LA, going back to LA, yeah Yeah, yeah, finna go hit LA Finna call my twizz up, yeah Finna go back to re-up, yeah Finna go back (Yeah) [Chorus] Going back to LA Bitch, I’m going back to LA I spent a week in NY, but I’m going back to LA, going back to LA (Going back to LA)", "vault_lines": ["I just hit NY"], "meaning": "In this song Yeat is referring to famous jeweler Elliante as Ella and he needs to back to Atlanta to re-up on his jewelry.", "annotation_id": "25590434", "url": "https://genius.com/25590434", "state": "pending", "votes": -26, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "Yeah, Maison Margiela that bitch, I went and put paint on her face", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, Maison Margiela that bitch, I went and put paint on her face"], "meaning": "Maison Margiela is a French design house located in Paris, he references that he paints on her face with his semen just like Margiela does with their shoes and other clothes as they feature paint splatters", "annotation_id": "25359826", "url": "https://genius.com/25359826", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "Yeah, my AP speaking in French, that bitch got baguettes on it (Yeah, oui)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, my AP speaking in French, that bitch got baguettes on it (Yeah, oui)"], "meaning": "Yeat uses double entendre with the word Baguette to describe his iced-out Audemars Piguet (AP) watch.\nIn jewelry, a baguette diamond is a step-cut diamond, they are long and rectangular and have 14 facets.\n\n\n\nAn iced out Audemars Piguet, covered in Baguette Diamonds\nYeat says his AP is speaking in French, due to baguettes also being a type of French bread.", "annotation_id": "25359613", "url": "https://genius.com/25359613", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "Yeah, I got some pints on the way and some Percs on the way", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got some pints on the way and some Percs on the way"], "meaning": "Yeat has pints of promethazine/​codeine cough syrup, and Percocets on the way which he will take upon returning to Los Angeles.\n\n\n\nyeat with a double cup of lean, which contains promethazine/​codeine cough syrup", "annotation_id": "25359438", "url": "https://genius.com/25359438", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goin Back 2 Ella", "line": "I got a Rolls Royce umbrella,", "vault_lines": ["I got a Rolls Royce umbrella"], "meaning": "The Rolls Royce Phantom comes standard with an umbrella stored inside the rear doors so that the driver of the car can take it out for the passenger so they never have to get wet.", "annotation_id": "25324283", "url": "https://genius.com/25324283", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
