{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Goat Emoji", "line": "Hahahaha! Clibbo, you’re crazy for this one! Hahaha!", "vault_lines": ["Hahahaha! Clibbo, you're crazy for this one! Hahaha!"], "meaning": "Clibbo, whose real name is Clifford Owuor, is a Dutch record producer and DJ from Utrecht, The Netherlands. He has gained recognition for his work with high-profile artists, including a production credit on Drake’s Certified Lover Boy album. He later worked on other Yeat songs like “Tru 2 U”, and “Swërved It (4L).”", "annotation_id": "37900455", "url": "https://genius.com/37900455", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
