{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GONE 4 A MIN", "line": "Why you always lyin’ like a bitch? Yeah Take a picture, go timeless in this bitch, huh Time to make the switch", "vault_lines": ["Why you always lyin' like a bitch? Yeah"], "meaning": "This seems to be a diss to Carti considering the Song “Timeless” by The Weeknd featuring Playboi Carti dropped 1 month in advance before Yeat dropped Lyfestylë The Album, Playboi Carti had also lied previous times before this on his upcoming album “IAMMUSIC”", "annotation_id": "34920767", "url": "https://genius.com/34920767", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
