{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "(Ooh-ooh-ooh) You could show me books, and I’m gon’ burn that shit up like a candle", "vault_lines": ["(Ooh-ooh-ooh) You could show me books, and I'm gon' burn that shit up like a candle"], "meaning": "This verse is a response to Ken Carson’s “Jennifer’s Body” where he says “Gave you the whole book on how to get rich and you ain’t even read it” after the several tweets were posted from various opium members like Destroy Lonely Lil 88 (not precisely an opium member but Ken Carson’s producer) and Ken Carson Himself. Yeat seems to show various responses in this album as if he had enough of the opium attacks.", "annotation_id": "34072843", "url": "https://genius.com/34072843", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
