{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Minigun on top of that blick (Boop-boop-boop), sitting on that tank", "vault_lines": ["Minigun on top of that blick (Boop-boop-boop), sitting on that tank"], "meaning": "Here Yeat is saying he is riding in a tank. In the United States Army, ‘gun’ refers to artillery, so when he is talking about a blick (a colloquial way to refer to a firearm, similar to ‘gun’), he is referring to the main cannon on a tank (or similar weapons system). On many tanks, there is a machine gun mounted above the main cannon.", "annotation_id": "33559070", "url": "https://genius.com/33559070", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
