{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Yeah, call me like a coin, I make that money pump Yeah, shoot ’em with that buck shot, I’ma pump (Buck)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, call me like a coin, I make that money pump"], "meaning": "Here Yeat talks about how his songs have been making a splash lately, and consequently bringing him a lot of money.\n\nIt could also be a dig at those who criticize it.", "annotation_id": "33349739", "url": "https://genius.com/33349739", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Rolly-polly .308, that shoot ’em like the minky", "vault_lines": ["Rolly-polly .308, that shoot 'em like the minky"], "meaning": "Yeat is rapping about shooting unknown people with a rifle that uses .308 ammo.\n\n\n\n\n\n.308 is ammo for rifles used mainly for hunting. Yeat also posted a picture of a rifle used with this ammo, and the .308 ammo on an instagram profile used to promote his fifth studio album LYFESTYLE.", "annotation_id": "33346172", "url": "https://genius.com/33346172", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "(Woo-woo) Yeah, they thought I was motherfuckin’ pilgrim (Damn, bih’) They thought I was motherfuckin’ pilgrim (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, they thought I was motherfuckin' pilgrim (Damn, bih')"], "meaning": "Here Yeat states how he looks so foreign or out of place like a pilgrim, and even like a member of a religious organization. The word pilgrim was most likely used due to Yeat’s fashion choices, including the use of the turban. Moreover, this may be a callback to his song “Bëttr Off” on Afterlyfe, where he states, “I’m not from the zone, I’m not from my home, I’m not from this planet.”\n\n!ExTrAtErReStRiAL!", "annotation_id": "33334178", "url": "https://genius.com/33334178", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Yeah, I fuck that twat up, show me what that cunt do", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I fuck that twat up, show me what that cunt do"], "meaning": "Both twat and cunt are English slurs, with twat and cunt meaning ‘stupid person’. Both words can also mean a vagina, so Yeat could be saying that he beat someone and is now asking what that vagina do", "annotation_id": "33333399", "url": "https://genius.com/33333399", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Yeah, I’m Jesus with these thorns, bitch, I’m still bleedin’ (Doo-doo-doo)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm Jesus with these thorns, bitch, I'm still bleedin' (Doo-doo-doo)"], "meaning": "Jesus, the son of God and a prominent figure in Christianity, got crucified but worn a crown made out of thorns to mock him.", "annotation_id": "33333374", "url": "https://genius.com/33333374", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GOD TALKIN SHHH", "line": "Most ’em don’t even know we CEO, that’s how I see it", "vault_lines": ["Most 'em don't even know we CEO, that's how I see it"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring ‘CEO’ as Psycho CEO, his alternative persona displayed on 2093. Yeat can be saying that despite his massive growth as an artist, most people don’t know his music or 2093.", "annotation_id": "33333353", "url": "https://genius.com/33333353", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
