{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEKED UP", "line": "Suicide doors on the whip, ’cause it get crazy (Phew, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Suicide doors on the whip, 'cause it get crazy (Phew, ooh)"], "meaning": "Suicide door is a rear hinged door that got popularized by Rolls-Royce, called “Suicide” because of it’s disadvantages in safety and possibility to drop-out the vehicle.\n\n\n\nBy saying that, Yeat admits that he’s no more concerned about safety since his life got more crazy.", "annotation_id": "35183102", "url": "https://genius.com/35183102", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEKED UP", "line": "I’m chillin’ in all white like Pope (Pope)", "vault_lines": ["I'm chillin' in all white like Pope (Pope)"], "meaning": "The pope is very commonly seen wearing all white, Yeat is also stating that he is currently chilling in an all white fit, like the pope does.", "annotation_id": "34501547", "url": "https://genius.com/34501547", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEKED UP", "line": "Yeah, this life we live the shit you dream of", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, this life we live the shit you dream of"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying that the luxurious life he lives is the same life that many people have dreams about. People want to be rich and famous just like Yeat.", "annotation_id": "34501521", "url": "https://genius.com/34501521", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEKED UP", "line": "Oh, It kicked in (It kicked in) Oh, you’re turnt up off a G6", "vault_lines": ["Oh, you're turnt up off a G6"], "meaning": "A G6 is a Molly/Ecstasy pill.\n\nDon Toliver is saying the pill that he gave the girl is kicking in.", "annotation_id": "32346474", "url": "https://genius.com/32346474", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
