{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEK TIMË", "line": "How I fly high? ’Cause I’m ballin’, bitch", "vault_lines": ["How I fly high? 'Cause I'm ballin', bitch"], "meaning": "“ Flying high ” is metaphor that represents feeling of being powerful, unstoppable and thinking you are at the top.\n“ ‘Cause I ball ” means that Yeat living wealthy and extravagantly.", "annotation_id": "33343508", "url": "https://genius.com/33343508", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "GEEK TIMË", "line": "How the fuck you die? Turn you into swiss", "vault_lines": ["How the fuck you die? Turn you into swiss"], "meaning": "In gangster nigga terms, swiss cheese has holes in ‘em, if I were to turn your stupid ass into swiss, you’d also have (bullet) holes in you. You just got Swiss Cheesed, hoe.", "annotation_id": "33334011", "url": "https://genius.com/33334011", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
