{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "I peep all the shit you doing, tryna jack my style Oh, hold up, “How the hell they do it? I’m tryna figure it out”", "vault_lines": ["I peep all the shit you doing, tryna jack my style"], "meaning": "Here we can observe how Yeat notices other rappers attempting to copy his rap style and lyrical genius. That’s why he quotes them by saying “How the hell they do it? i’m trynna figure it out”. This shows yeat mocking the copycats who are attempting to gain as much fame as he has.", "annotation_id": "28475595", "url": "https://genius.com/28475595", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "That boy, he gon’ bring my name up ’cause it come with clout", "vault_lines": ["That boy, he gon' bring my name up 'cause it come with clout"], "meaning": "His enemy will bring up kan’s name and beef with him only because he will gain clout, which is mostly internet fame and more followers on social media 🤓", "annotation_id": "27268684", "url": "https://genius.com/27268684", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "That boy broke as hell, we took a different route", "vault_lines": ["That boy brokе as hell, we took a different route"], "meaning": "Kankan tells us here about probably an opponent of his who is broke because he chose to get an actual job (or didn’t get a job at all), when Kankan and Yeat instead got rich without putting any hard work but from rapping 🤓", "annotation_id": "27268644", "url": "https://genius.com/27268644", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "Nigga, I get paid to just sit down and talk", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, I get paid to just sit down and talk"], "meaning": "Here Kan says how much money he makes from just singing on a mic and basically how easy it is to get rich by just doing that 🤓", "annotation_id": "27268628", "url": "https://genius.com/27268628", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "That boy ain’t sipping on drank, he sipping on green", "vault_lines": ["That boy ain't sipping on drank, he sipping on green"], "meaning": "Green drank is similar to purple drank in that it uses cough syrup; however, this concoction is the result of mixing a quarter of a bottle of nyquil with yellow amp. The flavor is reminiscent of blueberries and lemonade whilst the hue of the resulting drank is green.", "annotation_id": "25990988", "url": "https://genius.com/25990988", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
