{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "Yeah, I fuck my money up so much it told me that it came", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I fuck my money up so much it told me that it came"], "meaning": "When two humans engage in sexual intercourse, sometimes it will continue to the point where one or multiple partners will achieve the point of an orgasm, often referred in past-tense as “came.” Yeat often speaks on his obsession with money in his music, using similar lyrics on records such as “Trëndy way”:\n\nFirst my money twerk, now it’s lifting weights\nMoney in the gym, now it’s heavyweight\n\nYeat posted a tweet similar to the line before:\nhttps://twitter.com/yeat1_/status/1380275754634600450?s=20&t=zY4Bk78oOYJv9r9_B75bBg\n\nThe line was interpolated in Yeat’s “Luh m” for his debut major-label studio album, 2 Alivë.\n\nFucked my money up so much, it told me that it’s cumming", "annotation_id": "25717990", "url": "https://genius.com/25717990", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "Got the Cayenne sitting outside in the sun, that bitch is fried", "vault_lines": ["Got the Cayenne sitting outside in the sun, that bitch is fried"], "meaning": "A Cayenne is an expensive vehicle manufactured by Porsche. That being said, Yeat is known to reside in sunny Los Angeles so his car is getting cooked.", "annotation_id": "25634677", "url": "https://genius.com/25634677", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "Sipping on motor oil, dirty-ass cup, almost look like brown", "vault_lines": ["Sipping on motor oil, dirty-ass cup, almost look like brown"], "meaning": "Yeat’s lean is so potent that the color almost looks brown which in turn leads us to believe there’s an awful lot of cough syrup in his concoction.", "annotation_id": "25634644", "url": "https://genius.com/25634644", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "Yeah, pockets fat, walk with a limp, bitch, yeah, I got a cane", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, pockets fat, walk with a limp, bitch, yeah, I got a cane"], "meaning": "Mr Yeat’s pockets are so full of money that he requires a cane if he wishes to walk otherwise he’d topple over.\n\n\n\nYeat walking carrying a bag of money.", "annotation_id": "25634619", "url": "https://genius.com/25634619", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuk Tha Clout", "line": "And this bitch head go back like it was PEZ (Yeah, pop her)", "vault_lines": ["And this bitch head go back like it was PEZ (Yeah, pop her)"], "meaning": "Here Yeat is insinuating that the woman’s head is going back thus opening her mouth in order to receive either his pecker or his seed.\n\nhttps://images.app.goo.gl/KXsxVaGhdgnYunts7", "annotation_id": "25634602", "url": "https://genius.com/25634602", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
