{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuck the cops", "line": "I guess I’m the one with checks from endorsements", "vault_lines": ["I guess I'm the one with checks from endorsements"], "meaning": "This is a double entendre and a reference to yeat’s image as a whole.\n\nWhile he does not have an outright deal with the brand Nike, he has been seen in several ads, and been involved in several collaborations with Drake’s Nike sub-label, NOCTA.\n\n This bar is a play on words, with “checks from endorsements” meaning that he gets paid by his sponsors and everyone that partners with him. However, this is also a reference to Nike’s brand, which sports the check as their logo, and that I have previously mentioned his partnership with.", "annotation_id": "37092903", "url": "https://genius.com/37092903", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuck the cops", "line": "I guess I’m the one revolving when them doors spin (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I guess I'm the one revolving when them doors spin (Yeah)"], "meaning": "This line uses imagery to describe how yeat is watching his entire life pass him by and the world evolve as he just watches.\n\n“the one revolving” meaning that he is the one watching the doors, but not making a decisive move, just turning and staring\n\n“when them doors spin” being a reference to the things going on in his life that he just watches and watches, not doing anything", "annotation_id": "37092899", "url": "https://genius.com/37092899", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fuck the cops", "line": "No, don’t need new friends, ah No, don’t need new friends", "vault_lines": ["No, don't need new friends"], "meaning": "yeat is stating that he can live with just himself or the people he keeps around him right now, and that he doesn’t need to associate with more people", "annotation_id": "31660833", "url": "https://genius.com/31660833", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
