{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "I fill it with free money, I fill it with scam money (Yeah) I fill it with drug money (Yeah-yeah), this shit was so easy, how could I not? (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I fill it with free money, I fill it with scam money (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Before Yeat’s music took off, him and SeptembersRich scammed to stay afloat, and Yeat often mentions dealing drugs in the past.", "annotation_id": "27548538", "url": "https://genius.com/27548538", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "Yeah, I gotta take me a break off the drugs (I gotta take me a break off ‘em, know what gon’ happen) I gotta make sure all my family good (Yeah) I gotta make sure me and my momma know we understood (Yeah) And I told her I did too much, but she ain’t care as good (Yeah, sadly)", "vault_lines": ["I gotta make sure all my family good (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat speaks on his drug problems, and how he should prioritize his family, but his mom is still supportive.", "annotation_id": "27548532", "url": "https://genius.com/27548532", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "I used to watch my back, ridin’ ’round with the Ellen (Woo-ah) I done made a lot of money sellin’ Ellen", "vault_lines": ["I used to watch my back, ridin' 'round with the Ellen (Woo-ah)"], "meaning": "Ellen is slang for cocaine, and Yeat is saying he had to watch his back when selling it, but that he made a lot of money selling it.", "annotation_id": "27548525", "url": "https://genius.com/27548525", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "Bitch, I been on them Percs, I don’t know how I’m feelin’ (Perc up, ye)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I been on them Percs, I don't know how I'm feelin' (Perc up, ye)"], "meaning": "Percocet is a powerful narcotic that changes the way that the brain perceives pain. In this bar, Yeat states that his ability to feel pain is altered by the effect of the narcotic.", "annotation_id": "24653018", "url": "https://genius.com/24653018", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "Take a picture of this shit, these diamonds shinin’ (Let’s go, let’s go)", "vault_lines": ["Take a picture of this shit, these diamonds shinin' (Let's go, let's go)"], "meaning": "Under a camera, the gleam of diamonds are extreme. It is a form of boast to show off one’s diamonds.", "annotation_id": "24652992", "url": "https://genius.com/24652992", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Free em", "line": "Twizzy said, “Tell me if it’s an issue, I’ll pull up and smoke ’em like a ’rillo” (Ba-ba-ha-ha-ha)", "vault_lines": ["Twizzy said, \"Tell me if it's an issue, I'll pull up and smoke 'em like a 'rillo\" (Ba-ba-ha-ha-ha)"], "meaning": "Short for Cigarello, a small type of cigar that is cut open, emptied of tobacco, and filled with marijuana, Yeat alludes to a close friend injuring someone with a firearm if necessary", "annotation_id": "24652638", "url": "https://genius.com/24652638", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
