{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Forëally / 4Ly", "line": "Sippin’ on this purple in my cup, I’m sipping Wockhardt", "vault_lines": ["Sippin' on this purple in my cup, I'm sipping Wockhardt"], "meaning": "When Yeat says “sipping on this purple in my cup” he means lean which is a mix of codeine and antihistamine promethazine combined with soda, cough syrup, candy and sometimes alcohol, lean can become an addiction and it is used to cope with mental health. also when Yeat says “I’m sipping on wockhardt” he’s referring to the manufacturer of the cough syrup that has promethazine that’s one of the components of making lean", "annotation_id": "32242770", "url": "https://genius.com/32242770", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
