{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Forëally / 4Ly", "line": "In a day, I’m talking mâtin", "vault_lines": ["(Foreally, foreally) In a day, I'm talking mâtin"], "meaning": "I believe I solved this lyric it says:\n\n“In a day,  I’m talking mâtin”\n\nWhich is the French word for “morning”.\n\n\n\nYeat displays an interest in French culture as he’s been using French words such as “derriere” mentioned quite a few times on songs such as All Typez, WAR 1, and Big Stonëz.\n\nWe can also see his love for France when he went on vacation to Paris.", "annotation_id": "30642068", "url": "https://genius.com/30642068", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Forëally / 4Ly", "line": "I remember when I was just inside", "vault_lines": ["(Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah) I remember when I was just inside"], "meaning": "I strongly believe yeat does not say\n\nAll of my diamonds they SI\n\nAs he directly said on Jus Wokëup:\n\nEverything flawless over here, it’s no S.I on us\n\nFor extra reference on this as well, Yeat also referred to S.I diamonds with a negative connotation on Sorry Bout That saying:\n\nAll your shit is fake, that shit SI\n\nAs well as SeptembersRich his “confidante” on Provë sum:\n\nThem diamonds S.I, they not hitting for shit, nobody seeing them shine\n\nS.I diamonds are a low rating for diamonds. Here is a diamond rating chart as well:\n\n\n\nYeat would most likely want flawless diamonds, not S.I as mentioned in Flawlëss, multiple times or even VS1 as mentioned in Super Tëst\n\nI’m packing these diamonds, they hit in the middle of the night, man, these bitches, them VS1\n\nThis bar more likely says and moreso directly sounds like he said:\n\n“I remember when I was just inside”\n\nThis would make sense because during the production of 4L there were lockdown restrictions that were recently being lifted.", "annotation_id": "30614815", "url": "https://genius.com/30614815", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
