{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Forëally / 4Ly", "line": "Every time they rock them fake ass diamonds, call ’em Cinderelly", "vault_lines": ["Every time they rock them fake ass diamonds, call 'em Cinderelly"], "meaning": "Yeat talks about how people rock fake ass diamonds and he calls them “Cinderelly” . This refers to the movie “Cinderella” and in the movie Cinderella would wear her trademark slippers, the glass slippers. Basically saying people show off fake diamonds, glass.", "annotation_id": "25748442", "url": "https://genius.com/25748442", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
