{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "I got them racks all in my own pants", "vault_lines": ["I got them racks all in my own pants"], "meaning": "Uzi talks about having “Racks all in my own pants” Racks are slang for a large sum of money more specifically one thousand dollars (1000$).\n\nUzi is frequently seen talking about “racks” on songs such as “New Patek”, “XO Tour Life”, “P2”, etc", "annotation_id": "35066850", "url": "https://genius.com/35066850", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
