{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "Yeah, I’m so raw, I don’t even use a condom (I don’t use a what?), I’m sorry", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I'm so raw, I don't even use a condom (I don't use a what?), I'm sorry"], "meaning": "Uzi conveys the fact that he’s confident in himself (for instance, in this case his confidence comes from the fact that he doesn’t need a condom for [this is the author’s interpretation] he can pull out just fine).\n\nUzi could also be claiming to be the Nietzschean Ubermensch ideal, the human who’s so, in this case “raw”, that he stands above and beyond society.", "annotation_id": "29259887", "url": "https://genius.com/29259887", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
