{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "You don’t exist", "vault_lines": ["Out here thuggin', my boy"], "meaning": "“You don’t exist” implies that Yeat does not acknowledge your presence, weather that be because of your low financial status, your pathetic criminal history, your ‘gang’ status, popularity, or innocence. Whilst you do actually exist, Yeat refuses to acknowledge it for these reasons.", "annotation_id": "27804070", "url": "https://genius.com/27804070", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "You don’t exist", "vault_lines": ["Out here thuggin', my boy"], "meaning": "“You don’t exist” implies that Yeat is not able to acknowledge your presence, whether that be because of your low financial status, your pathetic criminal history, your ‘gang’ status, popularity, or innocence. Whilst you do actually exist, Yeat does not acknowledge it for these reasons.\n\nSome have also proposed that here it is implied Yeat expresses his adherence to the philosophical school of solipsism.", "annotation_id": "27804021", "url": "https://genius.com/27804021", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "And I named they ass Ren and Lil’ Stimpy", "vault_lines": ["And I named they ass Ren and Lil' Stimpy"], "meaning": "The Ren and Stimpy Show was a popular children’s cartoon that ran on Nickelodeon from 1991-96. The show is about the daily wacky adventures of Ren, a chihuahua, and Stimpy, a red cat.\nThe series was very polarizing in its time, being deemed “controversial” for its dark and violent humor. The series would influence other shows that came after it, such as SpongeBob SquarePants and The Marvelous Misadventures of Flapjack.", "annotation_id": "26767650", "url": "https://genius.com/26767650", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "I’m the one, got a million dollars I doubled that shit, then I tripled again", "vault_lines": ["I'm the one, got a million dollars"], "meaning": "Yeat said he got the biggest record deal of the past 3 years in 2021, and rumors say it was for 5-7 million dollars.\n\n1x2=2\n2x3=6 million.", "annotation_id": "26686359", "url": "https://genius.com/26686359", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "I was just mixin’ the Perky with Bennie", "vault_lines": ["I was just mixin' the Perky with Bennie"], "meaning": "bennies are benzedrines, a brand name for a drug that is a type of amphetamine making the mind or body more active.\n\nuzi takes percs and bennies.", "annotation_id": "26686345", "url": "https://genius.com/26686345", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "Got a Bentley Mulsanne in my hangar", "vault_lines": ["Got a Bentley Mulsanne in my hangar"], "meaning": "Although Yeat is new to the hip-hop scene, he has a penchant for the Bentley Mulsanne, a full-size luxury car that was manufactured by Bentley from 2010 to 2020. A 2020 Mulsanne had a starting price of $316,525.", "annotation_id": "26678863", "url": "https://genius.com/26678863", "state": "pending", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "Run up the numbers like it was a scrimmage", "vault_lines": ["Run up the numbers like it was a scrimmage"], "meaning": "A scrimmage match is a relaxed, practice game in sports where the two opposing teams warm up in preparation for a game. Uzi says that they try their hardest even in a scrimmage, explaining how he runs up the score, or numbers.", "annotation_id": "26675007", "url": "https://genius.com/26675007", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flawlëss", "line": "Audemar watch cost me a new car (Hah)", "vault_lines": ["Audemar watch cost me a new car (Hah)"], "meaning": "Audemars Piguet are a Swiss watch manufacturer that is very popular as of the song’s release. Uzi has several watches from the brand. The brand’s watches fetch highly expensive prices on the aftermarket.", "annotation_id": "26673427", "url": "https://genius.com/26673427", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
