{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flashëy", "line": "They said that they don’t understand me, I make all kind of sense (Oh, okay)", "vault_lines": ["They said that they don't understand me, I make all kind of sense (Oh, okay)"], "meaning": "Yeat was and sometimes still is seen by many as a mumble rapper. Although at first glance this seems true, Yeat claims (and is right when he says this) that he in fact doesn’t mumble and his lyrics are developed and well thought, people just have to start peeping in foreal", "annotation_id": "37123882", "url": "https://genius.com/37123882", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
