{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flashëy", "line": "Some of my twizzies way too wild, I ain’t talkin about condiments", "vault_lines": ["Some of my twizzies way too wild, I ain't talkin about condiments"], "meaning": "Yeat is here saying, that his twizzies (Yeats word for his close friends) are wild. This may mean they engage in various illicit activities outside of the everyday average normal lifestyle.\n\nYeat compares his friends' wildness to Wild Sauce a sweet-spicy side sauce served with food at Buffalo Wild Wings, popular restaraunt/sports bar.", "annotation_id": "30693204", "url": "https://genius.com/30693204", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flashëy", "line": "Yeah, three people can’t keep a secret, if two dance with the devil, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, three people can't keep a secret, if two dance with the devil, yeah"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the Benjamin Franklin quote, “Three may keep a secret, if two of them are dead.\"", "annotation_id": "29518588", "url": "https://genius.com/29518588", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Flashëy", "line": "You ain’t have no bread, don’t have no racks, right there where the problem is", "vault_lines": ["You ain't have no bread, don't have no racks, right there where the problem is"], "meaning": "If you’re wondering why you’re depressed, why you feel low self esteem, why your girl left you, why things never go your way, why you feel stuck in life, why it feels like the weight of the world is against you…it’s because you don’t have no racks. That is the problem.", "annotation_id": "28828875", "url": "https://genius.com/28828875", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
