{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Feel more", "line": "If she call me again I’ma block her, ’bout time", "vault_lines": ["Bitch calling my phone like twenty damn times, if she call me again I'ma block her, 'bout time"], "meaning": "Yeat is hinting at blocking your exes and bitches that bother you instead of picking up the phone. Especially in the case of an ex, just block that bitch, you’re Bëttr 0ff.", "annotation_id": "35110012", "url": "https://genius.com/35110012", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
