{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Feel it", "line": "Your lil’ thotty threw that brain on me so good, I got her bachelors", "vault_lines": ["Your lil' thotty threw that brain on me so good, I got her bachelors"], "meaning": "Brain, also known as head, throat, neck, face, dome, etc, is slang for oral sex commonly used by rappers.\n\nHere, Yeat is saying that your girlfriend gave him oral sex (brain) so well, that he figuratively gained enough smarts to obtain a Bachelors degree.", "annotation_id": "28871342", "url": "https://genius.com/28871342", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
