{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Fashün Week", "line": "Oh my god, look at the way that she suck, look at her face it got pincin", "vault_lines": ["Oh my god, look at the way that she suck, look at her face it got pincin"], "meaning": "This lyric can be interpreted as “look at the way that she suck, look at her face, it got painted”.\n\nIn rap slang, “painting one’s face” refers to ejaculating on a partners face after recieving oral sex.\n\nYeat has used this expression in his earlier work, i.e in his song “Dëserve it”\n\nMy bitch pulled up, she suckin' my dick all day, paint her face like mayo", "annotation_id": "40326782", "url": "https://genius.com/40326782", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
