{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Familia", "line": "I could win a GRAMMY,", "vault_lines": ["I could win a GRAMMY,"], "meaning": "At the time of the Song’s recording, yeat hasn’t won any grammys.\n\nEven though his album “2093” performed very good commercially, he still didn’t receive any nominations after the release.", "annotation_id": "37581523", "url": "https://genius.com/37581523", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Familia", "line": "I’on fuck with not nothing, l’on even know nobody", "vault_lines": ["I'on fuck with not nothing, l'on even know nobody"], "meaning": "Yeat likes to describe himself as an introvert because most of the people in his life are snakes.\n\n(Snake) can referred to people who like to talk behind your back.", "annotation_id": "32509787", "url": "https://genius.com/32509787", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Familia", "line": "When you get this shit, motherfucker, off the press", "vault_lines": ["When you get this shit, motherfucker, off the press"], "meaning": "Yeat is talking about pressed pills like molly or ecstasy. when he says off the press he means that he is basically getting it from the direct plug or the person who actually is pressing", "annotation_id": "31370090", "url": "https://genius.com/31370090", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Familia", "line": "I’on fuck with nobody, not nothing at all", "vault_lines": ["I'on fuck with nobody, not nothing at all"], "meaning": "yeat here is emphasizing that he does not engage with anyone or anything whatsoever. This can be interpreted as a declaration of isolation or a desire for solitude.", "annotation_id": "31208133", "url": "https://genius.com/31208133", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Familia", "line": "I go everything, I go pop and rap", "vault_lines": ["I go everything, I go pop and rap"], "meaning": "Yeat expresses how he’s very diverse in his music, that he is not tied to one specific sound, he can do everything, and he’s listing examples.", "annotation_id": "30939350", "url": "https://genius.com/30939350", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
