{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Factz", "line": "Rocking Celine and a big nine", "vault_lines": ["Woah, rocking Celine and a big nine"], "meaning": "Yeat is wearing something from Celine, a French luxury brand owned by LVMH. This group is a combination of Moët Hennessy and  Louis Vuitton.\n\nCeline is one of 75 brands owned by LVMH. Some other brands include Givenchy, Fendi, Christian Dior, Gucci, Prada, and more.\n\nYeat is mixing up his high fashion with what we can presume is a 9 millimeter pistol or other firearm. Perhaps this will be kept in a bag from the brand Celine, bringing the lyric full circle", "annotation_id": "24731415", "url": "https://genius.com/24731415", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
