{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "FLYTROOP", "line": "Uh, I’m a king high, I’m on king moon", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I'm a king high, I'm on king moon"], "meaning": "This line I can explain in two senses:\n1. He is as high as the moon (giving the example that he is the king of the moon) unlike everyone else\n2. He is stoned and therefore very high as the moon (slang)", "annotation_id": "34114528", "url": "https://genius.com/34114528", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
