{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "FLY NITË", "line": "’Cause I got too many girls patiently waiting on me, so tell me", "vault_lines": ["'Cause I got too many girls patiently waiting on me, so tell me"], "meaning": "The adlib “tell me” at the end of this bar is a call back to the end of the 2093 song “Tell më” where Yeat can be heard saying:\n\n(Tell me) Tell me things\n\n\n\nIt uses the feedback distortion feature also seen at the beginning of songs like HeliMAn, and most of the songs on 2093.", "annotation_id": "37031636", "url": "https://genius.com/37031636", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
