{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "FATË", "line": "Told me— Told me what to do, told me what to do (I seen a thousand things)", "vault_lines": ["Told me— Told me what to do, told me what to do (I seen a thousand things)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to the aliens who gave him instructions on what to do when he was young.\n\nIn an Instagram story from July 2023, he mentions:\n\n“When i was young i seen a alien n they told me what to do”", "annotation_id": "38821290", "url": "https://genius.com/38821290", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "FATË", "line": "Told me— Told me what to do, told me what to do (I seen a thousand things)", "vault_lines": ["Told me— Told me what to do, told me what to do (I seen a thousand things)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referring to the aliens who gave him instructions on what to do when he was young.\n\nIn an Instagram story from July 2023, he mentions:\n\n“When i was young i seen a alien n they told me what to do”", "annotation_id": "38821253", "url": "https://genius.com/38821253", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
