{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "FATË", "line": "And the crib was shakin’ (Ah-woo), felt like earthquakes in the night But the ship ain’t hit my house and it had told me what to—", "vault_lines": ["And the crib was shakin' (Ah-woo), felt like earthquakes in the night"], "meaning": "He’s describing a vivid, physical alien encounter where his house shook like an earthquake, but he felt protected and given direction instead of harmed.", "annotation_id": "37137133", "url": "https://genius.com/37137133", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
