{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "EVERYTIME", "line": "You couldn’t live like me just for one day, you couldn’t handle it", "vault_lines": ["You couldn't live like me just for one day, you couldn't handle it (Yeah, yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "He’s saying his lifestyle is too intense—whether it’s the money, the fame, the drugs, the pressure, or the energy he moves with. Most people want what he has, but they don’t realize how heavy it is to actually live it day-to-day.", "annotation_id": "35978220", "url": "https://genius.com/35978220", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
