{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dëmon 2", "line": "My brother scored on so many pints, he a Jamba Juicer (Yeah) How you rappin’ ‘bout that lean? You ain’t sippin’ no damn syrup (Why?)", "vault_lines": ["My brother scored on so many pints, he a Jamba Juicer (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Pints refers to codeine, and Yeat calls his brother a Jamba Juicer in reference to the juice brand of the same name. He also calls out rappers for lying about sipping.", "annotation_id": "27548618", "url": "https://genius.com/27548618", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dëmon 2", "line": "Demon, yeah, demon, yeah, demon, yeah, demon (Yeah) I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Told y'all, wake up then I boot up, bitch, I worry about gettin' high (High)"], "meaning": "I feel as if this confirms my first hypothesis that this was about his inner thoughts going from “I dont feel it” to “How im feeling” as if he has just opened himself up to someone and explaining how this was explaining how was truly feeling", "annotation_id": "27545941", "url": "https://genius.com/27545941", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dëmon 2", "line": "[Verse] Ah (Uh, oh), they know everything I ate (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Ahh (Uh, oh), they know everything I ate (Yeah)"], "meaning": "In this verse Yeat’s voice changes as if he has become his own demon and as he speaks in the verse instead of speaking on drugs as he was that majority of the song before he starts becoming self absorbed saying how HE blew up and now noone near him", "annotation_id": "27545927", "url": "https://genius.com/27545927", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dëmon 2", "line": "Demon, yeah, demon, yeah, demon, yeah, demon (Yeah) I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it, I don’t feel it (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Told y'all, wake up then I boot up, bitch, I worry about gettin' high (High)"], "meaning": "I believe yeat is expressing his prior obliviousness to his inner feelings. It is as if he’s answering someone that says he has demons\n“Demon?”\n“Yeah”\n“Demon?”\n“Yeah”\nThen claims that he doesn’t feel it affecting him any way that matters. OR\nIt could be him looking around for his demon ( drugs) and the demon is answering him but yeat doesn’t hear him because he’s done so many drugs that he can’t feel them in him no more", "annotation_id": "27545875", "url": "https://genius.com/27545875", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dëmon 2", "line": "Used to be eatin’ them noodles, now I’m eatin’ shrimp and steak", "vault_lines": ["Used to be eatin' them noodles, now I'm eatin' shrimp and steak"], "meaning": "Ramen noodles are typically known cheap food for the poor.\nShrimp and Steak however are more expensive and have a more professional look towards them.\nYeat is using the foods mentioned to demonstrate that he used to be poor and know he’s rich", "annotation_id": "27545857", "url": "https://genius.com/27545857", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
