{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dub", "line": "(Hey, hey) I’m spinning off these Percs like I’m a laundromat", "vault_lines": ["(Hey, hey) I'm spinning off these Percs like I'm a laundromat"], "meaning": "When Yeat indulges in the (over)comsumption of prescription drugs, the resulting effect of said drug “Perc,” (also known as Percocet) causes Yeat to experience multiple included side effects, some described in the song as “spinning” (dizziness)\n\nOther side effects include\n\nConfusion\nConstipation\nDepression\nDrowsiness\nEuphoria\nExcessive sweating\nHeadaches\nLethargy\nMood swings\nNausea\nVomiting\nPain suppression\nStomach aches\nDropping hits back to back", "annotation_id": "24882669", "url": "https://genius.com/24882669", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dub", "line": "(Hey, hey) I’m spinning off these Percs like I’m a laundromat", "vault_lines": ["(Hey, hey) I'm spinning off these Percs like I'm a laundromat"], "meaning": "When Yeat indulges in the (over) consumption of prescription drugs, the resulting effect of the said drug “Percs,” (also known as Percocet) causes Yeat to experience multiple side effects, some described in the song as “spinning” (dizziness)\n\nOther side effects include:\n\nConfusion\nConstipation\nDepression\nDrowsiness\nEuphoria\nExcessive sweating\nHeadaches\nLethargy\nMood swings\nNausea\nVomiting\nPain suppression\nStomach aches\n    Dropping hits back to back", "annotation_id": "24882605", "url": "https://genius.com/24882605", "state": "pending", "votes": 142, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Dub", "line": "I just poured it up in my cup, shit got icky (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I just poured it up in my cup, shit got icky (Yeah)"], "meaning": "yeat poured codeine in his styrofoam cup already filled with sprite now making it “dirty” or “icky”. lean is called dirty sprite because it makes it a muddy purple instead of a crisp clear.", "annotation_id": "24799256", "url": "https://genius.com/24799256", "state": "pending", "votes": 39, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
