{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Drug Damage", "line": "Pulled up in that bitch and throw some cash, put my bizzy on it (Word) All my brothers get the same racks, I put my twizzy on it (Real)", "vault_lines": ["Pulled up in that bitch and throw some cash, put my bizzy on it (Word)"], "meaning": "Yeat’s lingo for bitch/girl is bizzy, and he’s saying he’ll throw money her way.\n\n“Put my twizzy on it” refers to Yeat explaining how to get money to his close friends.", "annotation_id": "27920762", "url": "https://genius.com/27920762", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
