{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Doublë", "line": "Getting rich just like this is a hobby (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Getting rich just like this is a hobby (Ayy)"], "meaning": "Yeat expresses that he is effortlessly accumulating wealth. He conveys a sense of ease in his financial success, suggesting that making money comes naturally and without much struggle on his part.", "annotation_id": "37869498", "url": "https://genius.com/37869498", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
