{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Doublë", "line": "Makin’ money off the Perc’, I’ma shuffle (Shuffle)", "vault_lines": ["Makin' money off the Perc', I'ma shuffle (Shuffle)"], "meaning": "Yeat boasts about profiting off the Percocet-fueled lifestyle he raps about, with his music keeping the culture in demand. “I'ma shuffle” implies he’s constantly on the move, switching lanes and keeping his hustle unpredictable-while also hinting at his tracks staying in rotation and making money", "annotation_id": "36171318", "url": "https://genius.com/36171318", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Doublë", "line": "If everybody could get lit just like this, then they would and they wouldn’t even tell nothin’ about it", "vault_lines": ["Big body GLE-ski, I went bought it (Oh, na-na-na)"], "meaning": "Yeat is insinuating that people who criticize his lifestyle choices are simply jealous and if provided the same opportunity would replicate it.", "annotation_id": "36097418", "url": "https://genius.com/36097418", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
