{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "But when I take this X, I swear I lose it all", "vault_lines": ["But when I take this X, I swear I lose it all"], "meaning": "X(abbreviation of ecstasy), or 3,4-methylenedioxymethamphetamine, is a psychoactive drug primarily used for recreational purposes. One of the major effects of 3,4-methylenedioxymethamphetamine is a feeling of euphoria. Use of “X” would cause Yeat’s problems to be forgotten for a short period of time, or be surpassed by some other high activity.", "annotation_id": "25310274", "url": "https://genius.com/25310274", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "Sippin’ 40's in the bed, don’t fall off", "vault_lines": ["Sippin' 40's in the bed, don't fall off"], "meaning": "A “40” is a 40-ounce bottle of beer or malt liquor, in this line: Yeat is saying how he’s drinking and he might get drunk so if he does he should try to avoid falling out of bed.", "annotation_id": "34199387", "url": "https://genius.com/34199387", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "The X with the boot up, yeah", "vault_lines": ["The X with the boot up, yeah"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining that he enjoys and finds solace in the combination of Ecstasy (3,4-Methyl​enedioxy​methamphetamine, a powerful and potentially hallucinogenic recreational drug) and Molly.\nMolly and Ecstasy are different forms of the same drug and they have the exact same chemical makeup. Given this, they are by definition less dangerous than other substance combinations.", "annotation_id": "28976424", "url": "https://genius.com/28976424", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "Yeah, woke up and took a Perc’ to ball with ’em", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, woke up and took a Perc' to ball with 'em"], "meaning": "Yeat is explaining how the only way for him to fit in is to take a Perc (percocet) and get high where he can “ball” (another word for hang out) with “them” (most likely fellow gang affiliates.)", "annotation_id": "25741159", "url": "https://genius.com/25741159", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "(GOONTEX)", "vault_lines": ["Wake up and brush my teeth, then bit them all off (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Tag for the group of producers GOONTEX, that Lukovic is a part of.", "annotation_id": "25162597", "url": "https://genius.com/25162597", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "I got way too many problems at home", "vault_lines": ["I got way too many problems at home"], "meaning": "Here Yeat is saying the line ‘'I got way too many problems at home’‘ Stating that he might be in trouble with money, family issues or his dad getting milk, We would not be able to know🤷‍♂️🤷‍♂️", "annotation_id": "25036717", "url": "https://genius.com/25036717", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "Bitch, I been sippin’ on juice like that bitch a beetle, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I been sippin' on juice like that bitch a beetle, yeah"], "meaning": "Here, Yeat refers to the 1988 film Beetlejuice, where he likens the name to that of the illicit drug lean, and calls it a juice.", "annotation_id": "24806556", "url": "https://genius.com/24806556", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
