{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Different bootup (X With The Boot Up)", "line": "I dropped the Perc’ in my Wock’, watch it fizzle", "vault_lines": ["I dropped the Perc' in my Wock', watch it fizzle"], "meaning": "Yeat is dropping a perc (Percocet, pill formed drug) into his wock (promethazine syrup, usually combined with a drink) and watching the pill dissolve into what is presumably a combination of promethazine (wock) and soda to create a very effective drug combination.", "annotation_id": "24475241", "url": "https://genius.com/24475241", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
