{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "DISEASE", "line": "And I got so much of this money Put ’em in whips, I put ’em in trees Got the money, shank, the power, respect The thing I only need", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, 'cause I got so much of this cheese"], "meaning": "Idk if Im reaching but for some reason this shit reminds me of Kendrick Lamar lyric on Like That “Money power respect” line especially with him talking about money and then he say trees", "annotation_id": "38498162", "url": "https://genius.com/38498162", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "DISEASE", "status": "done", "targets": 30, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Yeat-disease-lyrics", "genius_title": "DISEASE", "genius_id": 12668288, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "DEAD SPIRITS", "line": "We might be at the pinnacle, bitch (Do it all the time)", "vault_lines": ["We might be at the pinnacle, bitch (Do it all the time)"], "meaning": "When Yeat says “We might be at the pinnacle, bitch (Do it all the time)”, he’s emphasizing his position at the top of his career and lifestyle. “Pinnacle” refers to reaching the highest point of success, while the casual phrasing downplays it, making it seem routine rather than extraordinary. The parenthetical “Do it all the time” reinforces that this level of achievement isn’t a one-off moment, but something he consistently experiences, highlighting both confidence and normalization of success.", "annotation_id": "38529318", "url": "https://genius.com/38529318", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "DEAD SPIRITS", "line": "And I’m pissin’ on these bitches", "vault_lines": ["And I'm pissin' on these bitches"], "meaning": "Yeat has a “piss” fetish. And enjoys pissin on people. Yeat has told us about his piss fetish multiple times. Including my favourite timë when he said\n\n“Canary diamonds on piss, R.Kelly”\n\nFree Mr.Kelly tho", "annotation_id": "35724864", "url": "https://genius.com/35724864", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
