{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Count it up", "line": "They ask why I name it Alive (Hope I don’t die) ’Cause I ain’t think I’d make it out alive", "vault_lines": ["They ask why I name it Alive (Hope I don't die)"], "meaning": "Yeat was hospitalized in 2020 because of a drug overdose; he was brought back to life and released an album titled “Alivë” on April 2, 2021. The album included the song “Diëd B4”, which contains the line “I told ‘em I died before, they wouldn’t believe it (I did)”.", "annotation_id": "37856694", "url": "https://genius.com/37856694", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
