{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Comë on", "line": "The devil my twizzy, ha (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["The devil my twizzy, ha (Huh)"], "meaning": "Yeat has mentioned multiple times in his music that he has sold his soul to the devil. This lyric implies that the devil is his twizzy (twin, bro, friend).", "annotation_id": "27107577", "url": "https://genius.com/27107577", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Comë on", "line": "The devil gon’ call up my phone, lil’ bitch, you know when it’s real, uh (You know when it’s real) I sit in the circle, I’m walking around, I’m knowing the drill", "vault_lines": ["The devil gon' call up my phone, lil' bitch, you know when it's real, uh (You know when it's real)"], "meaning": "Yeat frequently discusses selling his soul to the devil for fame. Yeat also has tattoos that are frequent references for dark magic. A common theme of dark magic is the circles. https://www.thenotsoinnocentsabroad.com/blog/how-to-cast-a-wicca-ritual-magic-circle", "annotation_id": "26875398", "url": "https://genius.com/26875398", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Comë on", "line": "The henchman, my Twizzy, my snake, they be in the field (Buh, buh, buh)", "vault_lines": ["The henchman, my Twizzy, my snake, they be in the field (Buh, buh, buh)"], "meaning": "The terms “henchman,” “twizz,” and “snake” are all used interchangeably by Yeat to describe someone “in the field,” presumably toting firearms and prepared to harm an opp on his behalf.", "annotation_id": "26678954", "url": "https://genius.com/26678954", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Comë on", "line": "Yeah, all of my diamonds, they muhfuckin’ slatt, ha (Slatt)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, all of my diamonds, they muhfuckin' slatt, ha (Slatt)"], "meaning": "“SLATT” is an acronym, standing for “Slime love all the time,” popularized by Atlanta gang Young Slime Life (YSL), used to show love for each other. Thus, Yeat shows love to his diamonds.\n\nYeat has collaborated with two presently incarcerated YSL members Young Thug and Gunna on his 2022 project, 2 Alivë.", "annotation_id": "26678896", "url": "https://genius.com/26678896", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Comë on", "line": "Yeah, I got a blick, blick, blick, and it’s lit, lit, lit, yeah, muhfuckin’ die, ho", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got a blick, blick, blick, and it's lit, lit, lit, yeah, muhfuckin' die, ho"], "meaning": "Yeat keeps a “blicky,” or “blick,” which is slang for a pistol.", "annotation_id": "26677191", "url": "https://genius.com/26677191", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
