{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Chanëlly", "line": "I was really gettin’ high with the motherfuckin’ birds when they was online talkin’ shit like the bird on Twitter", "vault_lines": ["Pull up, Chanel, get the mask, yeah (Whoo)"], "meaning": "In the bar, Yeat is saying he’s getting “getting high with the motherfucking birds” referring to his drug use as getting high like how high birds fly\n\n“birds”  is common slang to refer to women which could be Yeat including he was getting high with girls while people were talking shit about him\n\nIn the line “they was online talking shit like the bird on twitter”.” Yeat brings up the app twitter which logo and mascot for the app (before being bought and changed to X) is a bird further adding to the bird wordplay. Twitter is also known for giving its users free will to say whatever they want. Also the twitter notification sound is a bird chirping adding to the final layer of bird references", "annotation_id": "27154278", "url": "https://genius.com/27154278", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
