{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cayenne outside", "line": "Perc’", "vault_lines": ["I be crashing, I'ma take the Perc'"], "meaning": "Oxycodone-Acetaminophen mix usually sold as Roxicet, Percocet, or OxyContin.\nThe most popular dosage is 30mg, which would make the pill yeat refers to a Roxicet “Roxy” not a Percocet “Perc”\n\nOcassionally, “Perc” may be used to describe regular Oxycodone/Roxycodone pills, however these are usually called Oxys.", "annotation_id": "28602856", "url": "https://genius.com/28602856", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cayenne outside", "line": "E.T. phone home, I ain’t been so friendly (Brr, yeah, I’ma—)", "vault_lines": ["E.T. phone home, I ain't been so friendly (Brr, yeah, I'ma—)"], "meaning": "When he says ET phone home he is implying that ET phoned himself (Yeat). As ET phoned someone from outer space Yeat is saying he is in outer space, which is a popular way to say you are high.", "annotation_id": "28602846", "url": "https://genius.com/28602846", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cayenne outside", "line": "Just bought the Cayenne", "vault_lines": ["I just bought the Cayenne"], "meaning": "Cayenne = Laudanum (slang for)\n\nhttps://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laudanum\n\nPain killer and cough syrup (lean or cup type)\n\nMess you up and driving on it will cause issues.", "annotation_id": "28026231", "url": "https://genius.com/28026231", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
