{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Can’t Remember", "line": "They just say “Yeat why you said that word four times in a row, you just said money?” (Ack) I say you need to get your broke-ass up off this couch and get some money (Broke boy) I said I’m gon’ do whatever I want like every day, it’s kinda funny (Ha, ha)", "vault_lines": ["They just say \"Yeat why you said that word four times in a row, you just said money?\" (Ack)"], "meaning": "Yeat tells us he’s pretty much messing around on this song, and that the haters should be worried about their money instead of his.", "annotation_id": "27547829", "url": "https://genius.com/27547829", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Can’t Remember", "line": "Half y’all filled out all that paperwork, you 6ix9ine with no money", "vault_lines": ["Half y'all filled out all that paperwork, you 6ix9ine with no money"], "meaning": "Yeat refers to filling out paperwork in court, or snitching. Tekashi 6ix9ine is a rapper known for snitching on his former gang in court.", "annotation_id": "27547822", "url": "https://genius.com/27547822", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Can’t Remember", "line": "Call my doctor up, he’ll tell you what I get, yeah, for real You can strike a deal, get some Perkies with ’em, maybe drank (Drank, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Call my doctor up, he'll tell you what I get, yeah, for real"], "meaning": "Yeat is probably talking about a doctor he’s paid off, that will get him prescription substances not normally available to people. Perkys = Percocets and baby drank = Codeine.", "annotation_id": "27547814", "url": "https://genius.com/27547814", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
