{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cant see in", "line": "Yeah, heard yo’ ass was slippin’, heard you kicked rocks (Yeah, ’kay) Yeah, heard yo’ ass was trippin’, heard you sniffin’ rocks (Ooh, yeah, hey)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, heard yo' ass was slippin', heard you kicked rocks (Yeah, 'kay)"], "meaning": "These lines could be a “tripping/falling” sceheme. (which if they are, it makes them quadruple entendres)\n\n“tripping” in the metaphorical sense, around yeat, will make you “kick rocks,” or die, which is what he states.\n“tripping” in the literal sense, could be caused by literally “kicking rocks”, which could be a setup for the next line:\n\nafter tripping, if you land on the ground and stay there, you may unintentionally “sniff rocks” if you’re close enough to it. whereas “sniffing rocks” in the metaphorical sense is just snorting cocaine.", "annotation_id": "36880021", "url": "https://genius.com/36880021", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cant see in", "line": "I threw a couple Perkies down, lil’ bitch, it got me sleep (Ack) I been fightin’ with my demons, I been punchin’ in my sleep (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I threw a couple Perkies down, lil' bitch, it got me sleep (Ack)"], "meaning": "“fighting his demons” in a metaphorical sense is a reference to him not actually wanting to go to sleep, so yeat starts hallucinating.\n\nhowever, this is a double entendre because it creates an image of fighting in a literal sense, whereas he would be literally “punching.”", "annotation_id": "36880002", "url": "https://genius.com/36880002", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Cant see in", "line": "Had to take a break from X, but I been on it this whole week (Geek)", "vault_lines": ["Had to take a break from X, but I been on it this whole week (Geek)"], "meaning": "yeat wants to try quiting drugs but then he just ends up doing them againn", "annotation_id": "35334166", "url": "https://genius.com/35334166", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
