{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "COMË N GO", "line": "No more sippin’ that Wock’", "vault_lines": ["No more sippin' that Wock'"], "meaning": "“Wock'”, short for Wockhardt, is a brand of prescription cough syrup that contains codeine and promethazine. In rap culture, it’s commonly mixed with carbonated drinks to create a drug known as “lean.”\n\nHere, Yeat is saying he used to abuse lean but has since quit.", "annotation_id": "36429612", "url": "https://genius.com/36429612", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
