{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bëd Side", "line": "Can’t even go make a song with nobody, ’cause they don’t wanna hop on and get embarrassed by me", "vault_lines": ["I done poured a deuce inside my ExoticPop, and took a Perc' and took a X today"], "meaning": "Yeat has a very common habit of reminding the world that his style is unique and cannot be replicated. He does so by dropping bars like this one, which imply that nobody could do as good as him on one of his beats.", "annotation_id": "25966402", "url": "https://genius.com/25966402", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
