{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "Dirty drugs, I’m in my dirty ways", "vault_lines": ["Still on them dirty drugs, I'm in my dirty ways"], "meaning": "Yeat utilitises some repetition of the word “dirty” adding emphasis on the negative impact drugs have on his life. “dirty drugs” a use of alliteration further emphasizes that this isn’t just simple drugs like marijuana or alcohol but strong opioid painkillers such as oxycodone. This links to his line “i don’t drink no Hennessy” further expressing his acquainted taste to addictive and dangerous pills such as ecstasy. Yeat acknowledges that his actions are harmful when he states his use of these drugs are his “dirty ways” which is quite oxymoronic as most of his songs glorify drug use whereas here he is almost showing us how is negatively impacts him which also foreshadows to the entire point of the album Alive which was made after his overdose which he miraculously survived in 2021.", "annotation_id": "35489595", "url": "https://genius.com/35489595", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "(Ayy, Mino, is this catchy?)", "vault_lines": ["Fell asleep, I was in a coupe, woke up in a fancy bed (Fancy)"], "meaning": "The producer tag of Mino", "annotation_id": "33813178", "url": "https://genius.com/33813178", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "I don’t drink no Hennessy, no", "vault_lines": ["I don't drink no Hennessy, no"], "meaning": "Noah here says how he doesnt drink alcoholic drinks like Hennessey (a type of cognac) because he doesnt like getting drunk.\nHe later explains this in another song of his “Jump” from the album “2 Alive”:\n“I just be high, I don’t get drunk”", "annotation_id": "31644505", "url": "https://genius.com/31644505", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "Boot up off these drugs, boot up off this, how I activate", "vault_lines": ["Boot up off these drugs, boot up off this, how I activate"], "meaning": "Noah here explains how in order for him to enter “the zone” or his focus stage, is to “boot up” which is slang for getting high off a controlled substance.", "annotation_id": "31644498", "url": "https://genius.com/31644498", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "Fell asleep, I was in a coupe, woke up in a fancy bed (Fancy)", "vault_lines": ["Fell asleep, I was in a coupe, woke up in a fancy bed (Fancy)"], "meaning": "Here, Noah briefly describes how, when he was driving a car of his (a coupe, typically a car with 2 doors), he must have been under the influence of a drug(s), and the effects of such drug(s) started to get to him and make him feel sedated. Thus, he falls asleep behind the steering wheel, and it is inferred that he crashes his car since he has no focus on the road.\n“Woke up in a fancy bed” — This “fancy bed” refers to a gurney, which is a type of hospital bed that is used to transport patients who cannot walk given their current situation. When Noah crashed his car, he must have either been under the effect of the drug(s) that disables his ability to transport himself, or been inflicted with some type of injury that causes him to not be able to walk, or both.\n“Woke up” describes how he doesn’t even remember falling asleep. This is a symptom from being unconscious. He then wakes up in a fancy bed after being brought back to conscience.\n\nOne of the most overlooked Yeat lyrics, pretty deep.", "annotation_id": "31644312", "url": "https://genius.com/31644312", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
