{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "And lately I’ve been acting dead (Funeral)", "vault_lines": ["And lately I've been acting dead (Funeral)"], "meaning": "So high he is often zoned out and looks motionless leading his associates to assume that he is dead. If Yeat doesn’t stop partaking in this fast lifestyle this lyric may unfortunately become a reality.", "annotation_id": "30693298", "url": "https://genius.com/30693298", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
