{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "Sipping on Hi-Tech, I’m sipping red", "vault_lines": ["Sipping on Hi-Tech, I'm sipping red"], "meaning": "Hi-Tech refers to promethazine hydrochloride and codeine phosphate syrup, or more commonly known as cough syrup, which is usually of a red color. Lean is a combination of the aforementioned syrup and Sprite, which, after being drunk, gets the user high. Drinking lean is a common theme in Yeat’s songs.", "annotation_id": "25952381", "url": "https://genius.com/25952381", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "I’m a alien, not from here, I feel like a Teletubby thing (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm a alien, not from here, I feel like a Teletubby thing (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Yeat calls himself an Alien, and claims he isn’t from here. He compares himself to a tellytubby; which is a tall humanoid but not human figure.", "annotation_id": "25611033", "url": "https://genius.com/25611033", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bäk 2 BED", "line": "Been through so much dumb shit, I had to numb my pain", "vault_lines": ["Been through so much dumb shit, I had to numb my pain"], "meaning": "Yeat sheds some light on why he possesses himself to do so many vices; and that reason is due to how much drama and dumb shit he has been through.", "annotation_id": "25611016", "url": "https://genius.com/25611016", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
