{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "BË QUIET", "line": "Every day Halloween", "vault_lines": ["Snipin' shit (Bam-bam-bam-bam-bam-bam), yeah, it's a lifestyle"], "meaning": "Kodak Black is associated with Kutthroat Business, as he is the founder, and is also associated with Sniper Gang.\n\nKodak Black is known for his exotic lifestyle and aggressive songs. His lifestyle comprises of drug use and street gang involvement and shoot outs.\n\nHe uses this as a form of saying how every day is Halloween for him, which is a very spooky day. But for Kodak, it’s life.", "annotation_id": "34700603", "url": "https://genius.com/34700603", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "BË QUIET", "line": "Got so high, I’m tryna fly, don’t know why, must have thought I was a vulture", "vault_lines": ["Got so high, I'm tryna fly, don't know why, must have thought I was a vulture (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Kodak stood next to Kanye West, Ty Dolla $ign, and others at the Vultures Rave in Miami on December 12, 2023, where a unreleased snippet of a track he’s featured on with Bad Bunny was teased.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=paQ-50kS3QY\n\nKodak Black would end up as a feature on the track, FIELD TRIP on Kanye West and Ty Dolla $ign’s album, Vultures 2.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hmrU19LBRkM", "annotation_id": "34201097", "url": "https://genius.com/34201097", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
