{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Brink!", "line": "Purple drink", "vault_lines": ["limousine, purple drink, diamonds ice cream"], "meaning": "“Purple drink” Is a slang word referring to the drug lean. Lean is a mixture of codeine and promethazine (both are commonly found in prescription cough medicine) and soda (eg. Sprite). Sometimes lean users mix the drink with candy, but also mix in alcohol. Mixing the drink with alcohol is very dangerous, and can result in side effects including memory loss, respiratory depression, and death.", "annotation_id": "27899153", "url": "https://genius.com/27899153", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Brink!", "line": "Lean, lean, drink", "vault_lines": ["Different colored drink, that's in my lean (Lean, lean, drink"], "meaning": "Lean is a mixture of codeine and promethazine (both are commonly found in prescription cough medicine) and soda (eg. Sprite). Sometimes lean users mix the drink with candy, but also mix in alcohol. Mixing the drink with alcohol is very dangerous, and can result in side effects including memory loss, respiratory depression, and death.", "annotation_id": "27899149", "url": "https://genius.com/27899149", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
