{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Breaking News", "line": "I’m in my bag, I’m a whole different creature", "vault_lines": ["I'm in my bag, I'm a whole different creature"], "meaning": "“I’m in my bag” means getting a bag, or lets say, get money.\n\nYeat has a 7 track album called Different Creature, which dropped as the second album he dropped on his discography. So thats what the creature that Yeat is reffering to.", "annotation_id": "24891045", "url": "https://genius.com/24891045", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
