{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Box", "line": "Bitch, I do the Percocet, I don’t do bars (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I do the Percocet, I don't do bars (Huh)"], "meaning": "“Bar” is slang for Xanax or benzodiazepine, a medication used to treat anxiety and panic disorders, which is highly addictive. Percocet (or oxycodone) is a drug used to relieve or reduce pain, which is also highly addictive.", "annotation_id": "30472359", "url": "https://genius.com/30472359", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
