{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bizzy", "line": "What’s a new word? Got to think ’bout something different (Twizzy)", "vault_lines": ["What's a new word? Got to think 'bout something different (Twizzy)"], "meaning": "Yeat describes how he makes himself unique from others in the rap game through his unusual slang terms and other lingo. The word “twizzy” is one of his most notable, with songs like September 2021’s “Twizzy Rich” using the term:\n\nThey tryna be my twizzy, you already know ain’t no deal\n\nIn an interview with Our Generation Music, Yeat explains what the word means and how he came up with it:\n\nIt’s another word for like, twin […] I was like in New York, I was with like this dude, uh, Fendi, I was like, “bro, I’m finna make up a new word,” he was like, “What?” And I was like, “twizzy,” he was like, “That shit stupid.” I just do that shit randomly, like I just be making up words like all the time.", "annotation_id": "29089406", "url": "https://genius.com/29089406", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bizzy", "line": "Same bitch you wanna bag, suckin’ on the team, how the fuck you baggin’?", "vault_lines": ["Same bitch you wanna bag, suckin' on the team, how the fuck you baggin'?"], "meaning": "Lyrics are\n“Same bitch you want bad, suckin' on the team, how the fuck you beggin'?”\n\nNever chase a b*tch. While you out here chasing, she giving dome to someone she wants.", "annotation_id": "27067012", "url": "https://genius.com/27067012", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
