{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Big Stonëz", "line": "Called up Eliantte, said, “I need them baguettes to rock”", "vault_lines": ["Called up Eliantte, said, \"I need them baguettes to rock\""], "meaning": "Eliantte here refers to the jewelry company, Eliantte & Co, which is renowned in the hip-hop and rap scene for providing jewelry. “Baguettes” are a slang word referring to baguette-cut diamonds which resemble the shape of a baguette, an originally french food.", "annotation_id": "25914670", "url": "https://genius.com/25914670", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
