{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Big Stonëz", "line": "Yeah, all my diamonds flawless, all no SI (Big flawless)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, all my diamonds flawless, all no SI (Big flawless)"], "meaning": "SI diamonds are diamonds with slight inclusions or blemishes, according to the GIA grading chart. Flawless diamonds surpass even the best diamonds like vs and vvs. A flawless diamond has no noticeable deformations/blemishes under a 10x magnification.", "annotation_id": "25862759", "url": "https://genius.com/25862759", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
