{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Big Geek Week", "line": "I’m in OT I’m in overtime Do you need to take a little T Do you need some time", "vault_lines": ["I'm in OT I'm in overtime"], "meaning": "Many people call overtime “OT.” During overtime, many coaches call timeouts frequently, sometimes signified by a “T” hand signal. Taking a “T” gives teams about 30 seconds, which is why Yeat says “do you need some time.”", "annotation_id": "24955471", "url": "https://genius.com/24955471", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Big Geek Week", "line": "The way I kill this beat I kill this song I feel like columbine", "vault_lines": ["The way I kill this beat I kill this song I feel like columbine"], "meaning": "Columbine refers to the Columbine High School massacre, a school shooting that occurred on April 20, 1999, at Columbine High School in Columbine, Colorado. “Killing” a beat refers to rapping with such skill and finesse that the flow and lyrics match perfectly to the beat. Yeat is comparing the word “kill” to the Columbine shooting, and relates “kill” to the level of his rapping, as the best artists “kill,” “slay,” and “destroy” beats.", "annotation_id": "24955405", "url": "https://genius.com/24955405", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Big Geek Week", "line": "Peanutbutter inside coupe it look like Reese’s", "vault_lines": ["Peanutbutter inside coupe it look like Reese's"], "meaning": "Yeat here is relating the popular candy line, Reese’s, to the interior color of his coupe. A “peanut butter” inside refers to a brown/tan interior colorway. Yeat is boasting driving a fast car with a high quality leather interior, showing his large wealth and spending habits.", "annotation_id": "24955328", "url": "https://genius.com/24955328", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
