{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Band or 2", "line": "I be so high in the sky when I’m takin’ this tesla, they told me I’m changing the climate", "vault_lines": ["I be so high in the sky when I'm takin' this tesla, they told me I'm changing the climate (How?)"], "meaning": "The tesla he is referring to is the MDMA/ecstasy pill, not the electric car that’s supposedly better for the climate.", "annotation_id": "41777193", "url": "https://genius.com/41777193", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
