{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Band or 2", "line": "I went and called up like, Eliantte, I told him, “Piss on my diamonds” like he was R Kelly", "vault_lines": ["I went and called up like, Eliantte, I told him, \"Piss on my diamonds\" like he was R Kelly"], "meaning": "Refers to canary yellow diamonds, hence the reference of “piss.” the R Kelly reference comes in to play because R Kelly famously urinated on a teenaged girl.", "annotation_id": "28687154", "url": "https://genius.com/28687154", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Band or 2", "line": "Yeah and my twizzy better not try and slime me, I’ll turn into Melly", "vault_lines": ["Yeah and my twizzy better not try and slime me, I'll turn into Melly"], "meaning": "This clever play on words refers to “sliming” someone (someone very close to another stabbing them in their back), as he “turns away,” thus revealing his back – and vulnerability – to his friend, hoping they won’t make him regret it.", "annotation_id": "28687149", "url": "https://genius.com/28687149", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Band or 2", "line": "Don’t put none of them fake diamonds all on your neck, boy your neck turn green, yeah that shit got a rash", "vault_lines": ["Don't put none of them fake diamonds all on your neck, boy your neck turn green, yeah that shit got a rash"], "meaning": "Oxidation can cause a green shade to appear in the skin of someone wearing copper-containing jewelry, so Yeat is referencing people who wear a chain with copper in it, claiming real diamonds.", "annotation_id": "28687141", "url": "https://genius.com/28687141", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
