{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Balënci Feet", "line": "Drank man scored,", "vault_lines": ["Drank man scored, he just told me he got bottles in (Woah)"], "meaning": "Some argue this lyric may be “Drake Maye scored”– lending itself to Yeat’s prophetic abilities, knowing that a young man in North Carolina would grow into the star he is today.", "annotation_id": "38371364", "url": "https://genius.com/38371364", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
