{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Balënci Feet", "line": "Trust me, you won’t even feel like the real you when that EDD hit twice (Word)", "vault_lines": ["Trust me, you won't even feel like the real you when that EDD hit twice (Word)"], "meaning": "The Employment Development Department or the EDD is a government plan in the state of California where people unsuitable or unable to work are given a lump sum of money every month. However people have been know to trick to government into giving them this lump  sum of money even thought they are viable to obtain a job. Yeat is here saying when an individual realizes how much money they can make simply by scamming the government then it will change their lives.", "annotation_id": "31673066", "url": "https://genius.com/31673066", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
