{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Balënci Feet", "line": "Man, I swear the last time I took that shit I talked to my demon and cried (Cried, go) Yeah, we all humans, yeah, you don’t have to lie (Why?)", "vault_lines": [", I don't even know why (Why?)"], "meaning": "Yeat is comforting his listeners by saying you don’t need to be strong and hold back your tears. Sometimes, the stronger thing to do IS to cry. We are all human, even Yeat has issues that he cries about. Like everyone.", "annotation_id": "28357462", "url": "https://genius.com/28357462", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
