{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Ball Wit Us", "line": "(Sky is my hero)", "vault_lines": ["Turn it up (Yeah, ah)"], "meaning": "This is the tag of the producer Skys, who is part of the popular producer collective Ripsquadd and has worked with other artists similar to Yeat, such as UnoTheActivist, Nessly and Weiland.\n\nAccording to Skys, an affiliated producer by the name of 30nickk also contributed to this beat, hence why they’re now credited on the Genius page, yet nowhere else; the reason behind this is that 30nickk didn’t have a producer tag to place on the track at the time.\n\n\n\nThe cover art for “skys – nod off” listed on the SoundCloud page of skys.", "annotation_id": "30185156", "url": "https://genius.com/30185156", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
