{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bak onna X", "line": "Yeah, I got two Rollies on both of my wrists, I don’t know the time (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got two Rollies on both of my wrists, I don't know the time (Woo)"], "meaning": "Yeat references Segal’s law:\n\n“A man with a watch knows what time it is. A man with two watches is never sure.”\n\nA possible interpretation of this bar is that Yeat doesn’t need to know the time since he is so rich and is using his Rolex’s solely as a status symbol.", "annotation_id": "37440171", "url": "https://genius.com/37440171", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
