{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bad bënd / DëMON", "line": "I’m on a bend like, “Wassup?” (Bend like wassup) I’m on a bad bend on these pills, man, and this shit don’t stop (I’m on a bad bend)", "vault_lines": ["I'm on a bend like, \"Wassup?\" (Bend like wassup)"], "meaning": "Yeat is on a bender, a term used to describe a period of several days of being high, drunk, etc. Unfortunately, it might be too long, perhaps [seven nights] (https://genius.com/27907236) long, and not so much fun anymore.", "annotation_id": "27910662", "url": "https://genius.com/27910662", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
