{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bad bënd / DëMON", "line": "Uh, hit him, ”Bye-bye”, on his feet (Yeah) Now they only walkin’ in they sleep, huh", "vault_lines": ["Uh, hit him, \"Bye-bye\", on his feet (Yeah)"], "meaning": "A clever follow up to the previous lines mentioning his objective to eliminate all his opponents, Yeat is saying that his opponents will have to kiss the ability to walk good bye, after his gun knocks them off their feet.\n\nNow the only opportunity they will have to walk will be in their dreams, during their eternal slumber.", "annotation_id": "27891496", "url": "https://genius.com/27891496", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
