{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Bad bënd / DëMON", "line": "I feel like makin’ a beat, bitch so I make me this beat (I made it, ho)", "vault_lines": ["I feel like makin' a beat, bitch so I make me this beat (I made it, ho)"], "meaning": "On May 8, 2021, Yeat started a standard live stream where he previewed unreleased music at the time. During this live stream, the original version of the song, called “Did wrong” at the time, was first previewed, afterwards stating:\n\nMan, this the best beat I ever made", "annotation_id": "27872619", "url": "https://genius.com/27872619", "state": "accepted", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
