{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Backroads", "line": "I’m a space cowboy, I’m in outer space (Ooh), ridin’ horses, damn, all day", "vault_lines": ["I'm a space cowboy, I'm in outer space (Ooh), ridin' horses, damn, all day"], "meaning": "Yeat seemingly references the track’s instrumental, titled “BOOTUP (SPACE COWBOY).”\n\nThe instrumental was created by BNYX on December 2, 2022 and previewed on a Twitch stream the next day.", "annotation_id": "36982236", "url": "https://genius.com/36982236", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
