{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Back up", "line": "I got Gucci on my flip, Gucci on my flop (Flop)", "vault_lines": ["I got Gucci on my flip, Gucci on my flop (Flop)"], "meaning": "In this line Yeat references Future’s line on “Thought It was a Drought”\n\nI just fucked your bitch in some Gucci flip flops\nI just had some bitches and I made ‘em lip lock\n\nThis is a warning to everyone out there who dares to mess with Yeat, as he, it seems, will fuck your bitch his Gucci flip flops.", "annotation_id": "27476045", "url": "https://genius.com/27476045", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
