{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Back homë", "line": "(I-I’m—) (I-I-I’m working on dying)", "vault_lines": ["I don't fly no jet, I flew it to Milan (Uh, uh, mm)"], "meaning": "This is the producer tag of Philadelphia producer collective Working on Dying. WOD member BNYX is the producer of this song and a frequent collaborator of Yeat’s. Other members of the group like F1lthy and Brandon Finnesin have also worked with Yeat in the past.", "annotation_id": "27979897", "url": "https://genius.com/27979897", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
