{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Back 2 basics* (2023)", "line": "I don’t give a fuck ’bout these kids (Skrrt) I ain’t give a fuck ’bout these snitches (Nah) I ain’t give a fuck ’bout these riches (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["I don't give a fuck 'bout these kids (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "Due to Yeat unfollowing SeptembersRich, (an old friend of Yeat’s, commonly featured on his old songs) and his new label not following Sept', many fans have speculated Yeat cut him off. Sept has been posting pictures of him dissing this anonymous person on his Instagram, claiming the person to “not really be about that life” and be fake.\n\n\n\n\n\nThis line is most likely an undercover diss towards Sept where Yeat states how he doesn’t care what Sept is saying or posting about on social media because he is just stuck in the past. Yeat doesn’t give a fuck.", "annotation_id": "29501696", "url": "https://genius.com/29501696", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
