{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "BARBARIAN", "line": "And I pull up in a Escalade", "vault_lines": ["And I pull up in a Escalade"], "meaning": "The Cadillac Escalade is a full-size luxury SUV produced by Cadillac, a division of General Motors. Introduced in 1999, it has become one of Cadillac’s flagship vehicles, known for its bold styling, high-end features, and powerful performance. The Escalade is often associated with luxury, space, and cutting-edge technology, and it competes with other luxury SUVs like the Lincoln Navigator and Range Rover.\n\nKey Features of the Escalade:\n1. Power and Performance\n- Equipped with a powerful V8 engine (up to 6.2 liters), offering strong towing capabilities and robust performance.\n   - Newer models, like the 2023 version, offer a diesel engine option and advanced suspension systems for improved handling.\n\n\n\nInterior Luxury\n\n\nKnown for its spacious and opulent interior, including premium materials, high-tech infotainment systems, and features like massaging seats and advanced driver assistance systems.\n\n\n\nTechnology\n\n\nLatest models come with a large OLED curved display, semi-autonomous driving technology (Super Cruise), and various connectivity features.\n\n\n\nVersatility\n\n\nThe Escalade offers three rows of seating and can accommodate up to seven passengers, making it suitable for families while maintaining luxury.\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Escalade is popular for its combination of luxury, size, and performance, often chosen by those seeking both prestige and practicality in a large SUV.\n\n(not pasted from chatgpt trust)", "annotation_id": "32920653", "url": "https://genius.com/32920653", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
