{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "You boys are jokin’, it’s actually embarrassin’ (Woo), me and Lil Twizzy is just slappin’ in Maryland (Ah)", "vault_lines": ["I was out my mind (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Here Drake is poking his opps as he consider them just a “joke” and the way it’s really “embarassing” how his opps perform before him.\n\nFurther, he talks about how he and Lil' Twizzy (other name for Yeat) ball and ride in the “Maryland”, Maryland is a state where Drake was seen performing back in 2012.\n\n\n\nMaryland, The State.\n\n.jpeg)\n\nDrake was seen performing with Meek Mills in Maryland back in 2012.", "annotation_id": "30928929", "url": "https://genius.com/30928929", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
