{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Yeah, take you to the edge, and push you off the Earth", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, take you to the edge, and push you off the Earth"], "meaning": "Yeat believes that the Earth is flat, and he possibly wants to prove it by pushing YOU off the very edge.\n\nLuckily for you, scientists agree that the Earth is round, so that couldn’t possibly happen.\n\nStaying alert is highly recommended, as Yeat sounded very determined while saying this.\n\nThis is a photo of said planet we reside upon", "annotation_id": "30917389", "url": "https://genius.com/30917389", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Really can’t even spell ball with no L’s", "vault_lines": ["Really can't even spell ball with no L's"], "meaning": "Building on a common theme of Yeat’s “2093”, Drake implies that one cannot get to “ball” status without taking some losses. Drake and Yeat have spoken many times on the journey to their success and the challenges faced along the way.", "annotation_id": "30917301", "url": "https://genius.com/30917301", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "We been overseas, Palermo by the beach", "vault_lines": ["We been overseas, Palermo by the beach"], "meaning": "Palermo is the capital city of the Italian island of Sicily. It is located on the northwest coast of the island, overlooking the Tyrrhenian Sea. Palermo is the largest city in Sicily and one of the largest cities in Italy.", "annotation_id": "30915823", "url": "https://genius.com/30915823", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Spanish hoes love me, they talk to me like I’m from Latin America, what? (Phew-phew)", "vault_lines": ["Spanish hoes love me, they talk to me like I'm from Latin America, what? (Phew-phew)"], "meaning": "Drake finds it attractive when Latin American girls speak to him in Spanish.", "annotation_id": "30914499", "url": "https://genius.com/30914499", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "We know your girl, she get tossed in the circle like Captain America, what? (What?)", "vault_lines": ["We know your girl, she get tossed in the circle like Captain America, what? (What?)"], "meaning": "Drake is referring to Captain America’s elevator fight scene in ‘Captain America: The Winter Soldier.’\n\nIn this scene, Cap finds himself going up an elevator, and Shield Agents keep coming in as the elevator makes stops. The Shield Agents where looking to capture Cap, which eventually leads to a fight scene where Cap beats up 10 men single-handedly.\n\n\n\nDrake uses this as an analogy to describe how a girl in a relationship will still seek for men’s attention for self-validation. In this context, the girl will cheat with several men, and this will make her look like a whore.", "annotation_id": "30914266", "url": "https://genius.com/30914266", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Thought he was big ’til I got on the scale", "vault_lines": ["Thought he was big 'til I got on the scale"], "meaning": "This is a response to the viral video of Drake’s penis. He criticises other rappers for flexing their penis size as he knows his will always be bigger than theirs since there’s now proof.", "annotation_id": "30913387", "url": "https://genius.com/30913387", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Just made ten mill’ as we speak (Woo-ah) Like snow to The 6ix, like sand to the beach (Woo-ah)", "vault_lines": ["Just made ten mill' as we speak (Woo-ah)"], "meaning": "Drizzy Drake is comparing making ten million dollars to sand at the beach or snow in Toronto, Canada which is where rapper Drake originates from,  it is known to be a very snowy place.", "annotation_id": "30913043", "url": "https://genius.com/30913043", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Shout’ to Big Boat, I’m so concrete", "vault_lines": ["Shout' to Big Boat, I'm so concrete"], "meaning": "Drake shoutouts Lil Yachty here, who goes by the nickname “Boat”. Concrete Boys is the name of both the music label and group, brought to life by Lil Yachty with members: Camo!, Karrahboo, Draft Day and DC2Trill.", "annotation_id": "30912997", "url": "https://genius.com/30912997", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "She wanna bring her friend, girl, I got no backseat, fuck", "vault_lines": ["She wanna bring her friend, girl, I got no backseat, fuck"], "meaning": "Drake Implies He is going to have sex with a girl in a car, they girl wants to have a threesome. But the problem is there is no space in the car.", "annotation_id": "30912928", "url": "https://genius.com/30912928", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
