{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Appear", "line": "Maajins", "vault_lines": ["Fuck goin' on, maajins"], "meaning": "Semaj Nelson, professionally known as maajins, is an American producer and rapper who is most known for his work on the songs, “Antisocial“ and ”Antisocial 2.”\n\nHe frequently collaborates/produces with tana and Slump6s, but he’s also known for his work with Autumn!, Yeat and Lil Tecca.", "annotation_id": "29627106", "url": "https://genius.com/29627106", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
