{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Always Alivë", "line": "High in the sky, high in the sky like I’m Budden (Ah-ah)", "vault_lines": ["High in the sky, high in the sky like I'm Budden (Ah-ah)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying due to how intoxicated with drugs he is he is currently as high as popular Podcaster Joe Budden’s ego.\n\nJoe Budden has been know to go on his podcasts to point out minor flaws in various rappers' art. As a result Joe Budden find himself disliked by majority of the Hip Hop community.", "annotation_id": "30693274", "url": "https://genius.com/30693274", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Always Alivë", "line": "Yeah, I wake up on the E, I can hear ’em snoring", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I wake up on the E, I can hear 'em snoring"], "meaning": "Yeat says he wakes up on E (Esctacy, Molly, MDMA) a popular drug which gives people a euphoric rush. He also says he can hear his competitors or haters snoring from miles away to signfy how ahead of them he is. Yeat may or may not be crediting his success to the drug.", "annotation_id": "30693258", "url": "https://genius.com/30693258", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
