{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Always Alivë", "line": "All of these diamonds is VS1, these bitches a sled", "vault_lines": ["All of thеse diamonds is VS1, these bitchеs a sled"], "meaning": "Yeat states that his diamonds are VS1-grade, and, as such, have only minor imperfections not visible to the naked eye. According to Yeat, these VS1 diamonds are so icy that they constitute a sled. https://www.diamonds.pro/education/vs1-clarity-guide/", "annotation_id": "26698401", "url": "https://genius.com/26698401", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
