{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Already Rich", "line": "All that shit you got is well expired (Boy, you ain’t been at the mall)", "vault_lines": ["All that shit you got is well expired (Boy, you ain't been at the mall)"], "meaning": "The person Yeat is talking to clearly is broke asf because all the clothing and belongings are out of date or “expired”.\n\nHe ends this line off with an adlib claiming they haven’t gone shopping in a while to further insinuate said person is in fact poor with no shmoola.", "annotation_id": "27060936", "url": "https://genius.com/27060936", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
