{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All typëz", "line": "Different color diamonds, watch them hit, I’m Murakami, man", "vault_lines": ["Different color diamonds, watch them hit, I'm Murakami, man"], "meaning": "Takashi Murakami is a Japanese artist and designer who gained popularity for his vibrant, colorful, and abstract works, particularly those featuring flowers. Yeat implies that the style or shine of his diamonds is similar to the colorful, eye-catching, and impactful works of Murakami.", "annotation_id": "29775370", "url": "https://genius.com/29775370", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
