{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All typëz", "line": "Bitch, I’m already up, you in the past, kiss my derriere", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm already up, you in the past, kiss my derriere"], "meaning": "In this line, yeat says about “Kissing his derriere”, this could imply that Yeat is saying “kiss my ass/behind” as derriere in French translates to “behind” which is another way to say ass/bottom. It is also known as a Euphemism for bottom.", "annotation_id": "26307144", "url": "https://genius.com/26307144", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
