{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All tha way", "line": "Government name, you know I feel I’m the wave from Noah’s Ark", "vault_lines": ["Government name, you know I feel I'm the wave from Noah's Ark"], "meaning": "Yeat’s government name is Noah Olivier Smith, alluding to the biblicial event named Noah’s Ark where God created a flood for one hundred and fifty days, covering the surface of Earth and ridding it of all evil.\n\nYeat compares himself to the waves or flood that covered the Earth on those days because of his strong belief that he had made a new wave in the hip-hop music scene.", "annotation_id": "30978046", "url": "https://genius.com/30978046", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
