{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All Different", "line": "That E.D.D, that fifty racks they in", "vault_lines": ["Who that calling on my phone? That E.D.D, that fifty racks they in"], "meaning": "E.D.D. is likely referring to the Employment Development Department, a department of the state government that administers Unemployment Insurance, based in California, where the rapper is from.\n\nThis may imply that the rapper used to be on Unemployment insurance, but now claims that fifty racks (slang for 50.000$) are in, as in his bank account.", "annotation_id": "31277936", "url": "https://genius.com/31277936", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All Different", "line": "Baguettes moved into my watch, they brand new residents", "vault_lines": ["Baguettes moved into my watch, they brand new residents"], "meaning": "Baguettes refers to a cut of diamond that resembles a French baguette.\n\nYeat is implying that he’s recently acquired a watch with diamonds.", "annotation_id": "31277882", "url": "https://genius.com/31277882", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All Different", "line": "I stopped clearing fake checks", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I stopped clearing fake checks, I already made a killing"], "meaning": "Yeat made money before he gained success in rap through scamming. Clearing fake checks is a way that people scam. Here Yeat is saying that he stopped scamming because the money he would make from it was insignificant  compared to what he made off rapping.", "annotation_id": "30899509", "url": "https://genius.com/30899509", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
