{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All Different", "line": "Just like OVO this D-R-A-C-O go bird huntin’", "vault_lines": ["Just like OVO this D-R-A-C-O go bird huntin’"], "meaning": "OVO’s a famous label from America, known to be Drake’s label, but they own a lot of other rappers. The DRACO is a little version of the well known AK-47, looking a lot alike the AK-74µ. As OVO’s logo is a bird, Yeat says his DRACO (D-R-A-C-O) is bird huntin' (killing other rappers)", "annotation_id": "28845672", "url": "https://genius.com/28845672", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
