{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "All Daë", "line": "Yeah, I like to count up and get high, that’s my feng shui", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I like to count up and get high, that's my feng shui"], "meaning": "Feng shui is an ancient art and science that was developed over 3,000 years ago in China. The literal translation of “feng” means wind and “shui” means water. In Chinese culture, wind and water are both associated with good health. Thus, feng shui came to mean good fortune.", "annotation_id": "27195135", "url": "https://genius.com/27195135", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
