{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint worried", "line": "Walked inside the building, I’m Helen Keller, I don’t know nothin’ ’bout it", "vault_lines": ["Walked inside the building, I'm Helen Keller, I don't know nothin' 'bout it"], "meaning": "Keller, who became blind and deaf as a result of a childhood illness, learned to communicate with hearing people by having signals pressed into her palm, reading lips by way of touch, reading and writing Braille, and eventually speaking audibly.\n\nyeat is saying he went inside a building without knowing why hes there", "annotation_id": "33090402", "url": "https://genius.com/33090402", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
