{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint worried", "line": "Yeah, we just goin’ crazy, goin’ AWOL", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, we just goin' crazy, goin' AWOL"], "meaning": "AWOL means to take unauthorized time off from work, school, or other duties: “Let’s go AWOL and catch a baseball game this afternoon.” AWOL is an acronym for “absent without leave [permission].”\n\nyeat is saying hes going crazy with soemone (probably off drugs) and hes going awol", "annotation_id": "33090376", "url": "https://genius.com/33090376", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
