{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint worried", "line": "I’m high as birds prolly", "vault_lines": ["Told you life is a breeze, I'm high as birds prolly"], "meaning": "Birds are a creature known for soaring high above the earth.\n\nYeat often describes himself as “high as a crane.” Typically, the crane he refers to is a tall machine used for lifting heavy objects, but it’s worth noting that there is also a type of bird called a crane.", "annotation_id": "30099741", "url": "https://genius.com/30099741", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
