{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint worried", "line": "(Damn, Trgc made that?)", "vault_lines": ["I ain't worried 'bout these snitches, I ain't worried 'bout it (Damn, Trgc made that?)"], "meaning": "Trgc is an American based producer, known for his work with Yeat on songs like “Sorry Bout That, Monëy So Big, Kant Dië”, and more. He has also worked with Kankan, Summrs, and SoFaygo.", "annotation_id": "28962807", "url": "https://genius.com/28962807", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
