{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Us", "line": "All I did, put a bell on a song, I don’t know why they made TikToks about it", "vault_lines": ["All I did, put a bell on a song, I don't know why they made TikToks about it"], "meaning": "Yeat began getting major recognition in August 2021 after releasing a snippet to his Instagram which showcased the use of bells he would add to his instrumentals.\n\nEventually, this track was released as a single on his third-independent album Up 2 Më, being the hit we all know today as “Gët Busy.”\n\nYeat is unsure as to why the song blew up the way it did, but thanks to TikTok, his streams and listeners began to skyrocket due to his creativity and giving hip-hop fans a fresh new wave of music to enjoy.", "annotation_id": "25816039", "url": "https://genius.com/25816039", "state": "pending", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
