{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Try (Tried Once)", "line": "Got the Trackhawk in the back, I heard it whine once (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["Got the Trackhawk in the back, I heard it whine once (Woo)"], "meaning": "Yeat infers that he owns a Trawkhawk referring to The Jeep Grand Cherokee Trackhawk. The whining noise created is from the supercharger mounted to the engine while it revs.", "annotation_id": "28417113", "url": "https://genius.com/28417113", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
