{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Shit Change", "line": "Stayed down for so long, I gotta go up for air, right now, I’m gone (Phew) Bitch says she wanna rock with me now, let me guess, you was busy the whole last year?", "vault_lines": ["Stayed down for so long, I gotta go up for air, right now, I'm gone (Phew)"], "meaning": "Yeat is saying he’s been keeping quiet for a while, but now that he’s up people wanna rock with him. He’s asking the girl what she was doing the entire last year, when he was available, but not as rich.", "annotation_id": "27548375", "url": "https://genius.com/27548375", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Shit Change", "line": "Told my demons, “Get rid of my fears” He done told me to give him some tears (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Told my demons, \"Get rid of my fears\""], "meaning": "Yeat is basically saying he has to sacrifice to gain his demon’s benefits. So to lose his fears, he would have to experience something equally bad.", "annotation_id": "27548371", "url": "https://genius.com/27548371", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Shit Change", "line": "When I think ’bout death, don’t really be tweakin’, I be like, “Why are we here?” (Why?) I don’t pull up like “Why am I here?” (Why?) I don’t listen, like I can’t hear (Gah)", "vault_lines": ["When I think 'bout death, don't really be tweakin', I be like, \"Why are we here?\" (Why?)"], "meaning": "Yeat is thinking about his purpose in life, but swiftly dismisses it and goes back to living in the moment.", "annotation_id": "27548364", "url": "https://genius.com/27548364", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Aint Shit Change", "line": "I done turned Toyota to the Cullinan Rolls-Royce four door (Swerve)", "vault_lines": ["I done turned Toyota to the Cullinan Rolls-Royce four door (Swerve)"], "meaning": "Yeat went from driving a Toyota to a Rolls-Royce Cullinan, a show of how much his wealth increased.", "annotation_id": "27548352", "url": "https://genius.com/27548352", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
