{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "Admit It", "line": "Only got two cups, don’t play ping pong", "vault_lines": ["Only got two cups, don't play ping pong"], "meaning": "Two cups is a reference to “lean” (codeine mixed with sprite and ice) where you often put the cup with the beverage into another cup since the cup is often cold because of the ice. Ping pong is not referring to the sport, but to beer pong, where you use more than two cups.", "annotation_id": "36156646", "url": "https://genius.com/36156646", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
