{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "ADDICTED", "line": "Yeah, I need plain jane ‘cause I’m always blankin’", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I need plain jane 'cause I'm always blankin'"], "meaning": "“Plain jane” refers to a luxury watch that has not been customized with diamonds or aftermarket jewels such as a rolex. In the context of Yeat’s references, “blankin” suggests being high to the point where he is always losing train of thought so he needs a simple watch to remember the time as he is always forgetting.", "annotation_id": "39741126", "url": "https://genius.com/39741126", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
