{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "ADDICTED", "line": "Luh geeky members only, bitch, I get so shmunky", "vault_lines": ["Luh geeky members only, bitch, I get so shmunky"], "meaning": "This may be a reference to a chain of voice messages sent by Yeat in a group chat in early 2022, shortly before the release of his second studio album 2 Alive\n\nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/GAdB_pJJOnU", "annotation_id": "37137414", "url": "https://genius.com/37137414", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "ADDICTED", "line": "This ain’t Box Tops but we get you boxed out, lil’ bitch", "vault_lines": ["This ain't Box Tops but we get you boxed out, lil' bitch"], "meaning": "“Box Tops” is a school system in USA letting students earn points by collecting school label items,\n“Boxed out” here comes from the term in basketball, getting the opponents out of the paint in order to prevent him from getting the ball\nSo Yeat in this verse basically saying that\nIts no light work and he can get you down", "annotation_id": "36025114", "url": "https://genius.com/36025114", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
