{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "Lucid", "vault_lines": ["I just been geeked up, bitch (Yeah), think it's 'bout seven nights straight (Straight)"], "meaning": "Lucy, professionally known as Lucid or Lucid740 is an American record producer from Miami, Florida", "annotation_id": "39220708", "url": "https://genius.com/39220708", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "Bitch, you slow like molasses (Ooh, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, you slow like molasses (Ooh, yeah)"], "meaning": "As to say something is as “slow as molasses” is to say it is figuratively as slow as molasses can be poured because of it’s density; 1.5 times as dense compared to regular water.\n\nThis line could be also interpreted as “Bitch, you slow like molasses, done wiped my glasses” which can allude to the previous line and imply that the recepient of Yeat is slower than him by an immense speed. This interpretation could be valid being that the previous line states that Yeat claims to “live live the fastest” and “the bestest”, an ode to his fancy and island-abode filled lifestyle.\n\n\n\nMolasses. It's very slow to pour.", "annotation_id": "30895774", "url": "https://genius.com/30895774", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "Dulio, 力を貸して", "vault_lines": ["I just been geeked up, bitch (Yeah), think it's 'bout seven nights straight (Straight)"], "meaning": "This is a producer tag used by producer Dulio.\n“力を貸して” is a Japanese phrase that means “Please lend me your strength” in English.", "annotation_id": "28722275", "url": "https://genius.com/28722275", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "Know your pockets never been on fat, know your— (Never, never) Broker than a schoolyard ride, know your— (Oh)", "vault_lines": ["Know your pockets never been on fat, know your— (Never, never)"], "meaning": "Yeat is commenting to his haters that they will never reach the material wealth he has.\n\nTo extend this even more, Yeat calls them broker than the American public schools they were educated in due to neoliberalism and economic austerity measures since the 1970s.\n\nhttps://www.nytimes.com/1981/11/15/education/is-public-education-a-casualty-of-reaganomics.html", "annotation_id": "28226670", "url": "https://genius.com/28226670", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "I been makin’ money, hear that sound", "vault_lines": ["I been makin' money, hear that sound"], "meaning": "Yeat has been makin' money, as the sound of a bill counting machine in operation playing in the background suggests", "annotation_id": "27948367", "url": "https://genius.com/27948367", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "I just been geeked up, bitch (Yeah), think it’s ’bout seven nights straight (Straight)", "vault_lines": ["I just been geeked up, bitch (Yeah), think it's 'bout seven nights straight (Straight)"], "meaning": "He is talking about how he has been doing drugs for 7 nightz", "annotation_id": "27907236", "url": "https://genius.com/27907236", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "Snitchin’ on your friends to the cop, don’t ya? (Know your—)", "vault_lines": ["Snitchin' on your friends to the cop, don't ya? (Know your—)"], "meaning": "This could be a sneak diss to the Atlanta rapper and Young Stoner Life/YSL collective Gunna, him and Young Thug were arrested over a RICO case in May 2022. On December 14, 2022, Gunna was released from jail.", "annotation_id": "27890742", "url": "https://genius.com/27890742", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "7 nightz", "line": "I pulled up with Glock, you hear that sound, oh (Bang-bang, bang-bang)", "vault_lines": ["I pulled up with Glock, you hear that sound, oh (Bang-bang, bang-bang)"], "meaning": "Yeat describes the action of entering an area home to his opposition, firing a weapon known as a Glock, conducting  a sound as loud as 139 decibels, which can be harmful to the ear if exposed to many rounds of fire, as yeat describes in this passage.", "annotation_id": "27879133", "url": "https://genius.com/27879133", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
