{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "I been goin’ brazy for ten summers (We geeked), you know what I’m sayin’?", "vault_lines": ["I been goin' brazy for ten summers (We geeked), you know what I'm sayin'?"], "meaning": "Quavo has has a long career, starting in 2008 with the forming of Migos. He says that he has been doing this for 10 summers, implying he means total years. He has been doing this for 16 years at this point, but he likely chose to say 10 to keep the flow of his verse, once again showing that he is very experienced.", "annotation_id": "33793746", "url": "https://genius.com/33793746", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "We gon’ get you killed, yeah, your new ho is a trash bag", "vault_lines": ["We gon' get you killed, yeah, your new ho is a trash bag"], "meaning": "your new home is a trash bag*\n\nThis implies that when Yeat gets you killed, your new home will be a trash bag when your body is being disposed of.", "annotation_id": "33625214", "url": "https://genius.com/33625214", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
