{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Niggas ain’t talkin’ ‘bout none, they talkin’ ’bout none-yun (They talk ’bout nothin’) I’ma stack my chips and count up these Funyuns (These Funyuns)", "vault_lines": ["Niggas ain't talkin' 'bout none, they talkin' 'bout none-yun (They talk 'bout nothin')"], "meaning": "Quavo means that others are talking about meaningless things that hold no real value to him.\n\nWhen he says, “Almost bet my chips, ain’t countin' these Funyuns,” he’s implying that he’s focused on real money or significant matters, not small, trivial things.", "annotation_id": "33451180", "url": "https://genius.com/33451180", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
