{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Know you want this whip, you get Mercedes (Yeah, we got them guns outside)", "vault_lines": ["Brazy, brazy, know you want to talk when you get crazy, crazy"], "meaning": "“Whip” is being used as a double entendre. Whip as in a Mercedes, and whip as in an actual whip. Yeat is saying he’ll go bigger and better if he is going to fight someone, linking with the next line:\n\nYeah, we got them guns outside", "annotation_id": "33431553", "url": "https://genius.com/33431553", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Brand new Mercedes, I go brazy in the Brabus", "vault_lines": ["Brand new Mercedes, I go brazy in the Brabus"], "meaning": "Yeat and Quavo recently took pictures with what looks to be a brand-new green Mercedes.", "annotation_id": "33410677", "url": "https://genius.com/33410677", "state": "pending", "votes": -5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Yeah, 195 on the 105 (Ooh, ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Brazy, brazy, know you want to talk when you get crazy, crazy"], "meaning": "Interstate 105 (I-105) is an east-west auxiliary Interstate Highway in the Greater Los Angeles urban area of Southern California. Yeat lives in California in the LA area. It can be assumed that in this bar yeat is saying he drives at 195 mph on this interstate.", "annotation_id": "33388943", "url": "https://genius.com/33388943", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Heard that you doin’ what the Illuminati told ya (Yeah) Heard that you doin’ just what everybody told ya", "vault_lines": ["Heard that you doin' what the Illuminati told ya (Yeah)"], "meaning": "While it’s not clear who Yeat is speaking to he states that the person in question is doing what the Illuminati told them to do. When we take this statement at face value many would assume this person is in some secret society, on the contrary, it seems what Yeat meant by this was the person in question is a slave to their label and they are an industry plant. Many could speculate who Yeat would be referring to but many upcoming rappers are stealing Yeats style while he has been making his sound and perfecting it for years and all of this was done while he wasn’t bound to a contract that restricted him from sounding the way he wanted to in his art.", "annotation_id": "33388630", "url": "https://genius.com/33388630", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Elliot diamonds, this a different shine, this shit ain’t cheap", "vault_lines": ["Elliot diamonds, this a different shine, this shit ain't cheap"], "meaning": "Elliot Eliantte is a jeweler whose services are often used by famous individuals due to the price and quality of the jewels. Quavo doubles down on this statement by saying these diamonds aren’t cheap further showing the money he makes and is willing to spend on diamonds.", "annotation_id": "33388593", "url": "https://genius.com/33388593", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5BRAZY REMIX", "line": "Huh, all black ski mask, bitch, I’m feelin’ all geeked, think I’m Yeat", "vault_lines": ["Huh, all black ski mask, bitch, I'm feelin' all geeked, think I'm Yeat"], "meaning": "Yeat often sports his signature look of an all-black distressed ski mask. Quavo says he feels like Yeat when he wears an all-black ski mask because Yeat has made this his trademarked look.", "annotation_id": "33388573", "url": "https://genius.com/33388573", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
