{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5 2 Üh 60", "line": "Y’all be cappin’ ’bout the fashion, y’all some Helmut lames", "vault_lines": ["Y'all be cappin' 'bout the fashion, y'all some Helmut lames"], "meaning": "Yeat calls out people who cap about fashion; pretending they’re stylish or rocking designer brands when they’re really not. He flips Helmut Lang, a well-respected minimalist fashion brand, into an insult: “Helmut lames.”", "annotation_id": "37440161", "url": "https://genius.com/37440161", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
