{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5 2 Üh 60", "line": "Bitch, don’t even text me, fuck a phone, I’ma let it ring", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, don't even text me, fuck a phone, I'ma let it ring"], "meaning": "Yeat has gone on record saying that all he does is record music. He has little, if any time or desire to consult with other people.\n\nIn this day and age, acquaintances typically communicate over text or phone call, but as previously stated, Yeat is not in favor of communicating with others when he is busy making music. If you text Yeat, he will leave you on delivered. If you call Yeat, he will let the phone ring instead of answering.", "annotation_id": "26903288", "url": "https://genius.com/26903288", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
