{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "5 2 Üh 60", "line": "Bitch, I’m married to this X, I bought a wedding ring", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm married to this X, I bought a wedding ring"], "meaning": "“X”, commonly known as ecstasy; and molly or mandy, is a potent empathogen–entactogen with stimulant properties primarily used for recreational purposes. The desired effects include altered sensations, increased energy, empathy, and pleasure. Yeat is stating that he love his “X” so much he bought a wedding ring", "annotation_id": "28470657", "url": "https://genius.com/28470657", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
