{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "2x2", "line": "Got my muddy, yeah, two times two", "vault_lines": ["Got my muddy, yeah, two times two"], "meaning": "Muddy is a mixture of cough syrup and soda, commonly known as “lean”. Originating in Houston, Texas, it’s typically served in a white Styrofoam cup.\n\nNoah Olivier Smith says his muddy is “2x2”, which is equal to 4, meaning that he has a four (or four ounces) of mudd in his cup.", "annotation_id": "25850489", "url": "https://genius.com/25850489", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
