{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "2Up / Bad Boy Remix", "line": "If I end up OD’ing on these pills then that my fate (Ugh)", "vault_lines": ["If I end up OD'ing on these pills then that my fate (Ugh)"], "meaning": "Yeat is referencing all of the rappers who have unfortunately fallen to drug overdoses like the likes of Lil Peep & Juice WRLD, and is saying if he overdoses, he will experience the same fate.", "annotation_id": "29415489", "url": "https://genius.com/29415489", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
