{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "293842341 (Time Again V3 Outro)", "line": "How much you thinkin’ ahead? I’m thinkin’ Twenty ninety– (Three)", "vault_lines": ["How much you thinkin' ahead? I'm thinkin'"], "meaning": "Could be a reference to yeats interview with channel 5, where Andrew Callaghan asks him, “If you had a time machine, what would you do?”\nYeat replies, “I would go to the future”\nAfter this, the hosts asks him, “how far you think?”\n\nhttps://m.youtube.com/watch?v=ZxtXNfPH-Ac&pp=ygUOWWVhdCBjaGFubmVsIDXSBwkJkQoBhyohjO8%3D", "annotation_id": "38518491", "url": "https://genius.com/38518491", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
