{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "24/7", "line": "Eugh, eugh, eugh, eugh-eugh, eugh (What?) Okay, that’s how I sound to a broke-ass kid (What?) We don’t speak the same language, bitch (Shut up)", "vault_lines": ["Eugh, eugh, eugh, eugh-eugh, eugh (What?)"], "meaning": "Yeat makes some unintelligible ad-libs, then says you can’t understand him because you’re broke and don’t speak his language. This bar also refers to people saying he’s a mumble rapper, basically saying they’re broke as well.", "annotation_id": "27612400", "url": "https://genius.com/27612400", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
