{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "2093", "line": "When you live like God (Hoo) When you live like God (Hoo) When you live like God (Hoo)", "vault_lines": ["When you live like God (Hoo)"], "meaning": "Carrying forward the common eccentric ideology of the album, Yeat continues to present himself as a “living god” of the culture. Yeat is seen pronouncing him as a “God” multiple times in the album.", "annotation_id": "30939671", "url": "https://genius.com/30939671", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
