{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "2 Kut Off", "line": "(This Cade, is it actually?)", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm tapped in (Tapped in), bitch, you actin'"], "meaning": "Cade is an American record producer from Houston, Texas, based in New York City, New York. Known for his prolific and tireless work ethic, he has most notably worked with Destroy Lonely, tana, Lancey Foux, wolfacejoeyy, Yeat, Duwap Kaine, Lil Candy Paint, D Savage, DC The Don, and Hardrock, among countless others.", "annotation_id": "41563418", "url": "https://genius.com/41563418", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
