{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "Chasing that warm feeling inside of ya Always playing both sides, I’m fucking tired of ya", "vault_lines": ["Chasing that warm feeling inside of ya"], "meaning": "This line suggests a sense of frustration with someone who constantly seeks fleeting happiness or satisfaction while simultaneously being deceitful or disloyal. The speaker is tired of dealing with this person’s duplicity and inconsistency. This could be yeat talking to himself or the “Psycho Ceo” his alter ego.", "annotation_id": "31342390", "url": "https://genius.com/31342390", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "You wish you could pause time and live this section your whole life", "vault_lines": ["You wish you could pause time and live this section your whole life"], "meaning": "This line expresses a desire to freeze or prolong a specific moment or period of time because it brings immense joy or fulfillment to the speaker.", "annotation_id": "31342358", "url": "https://genius.com/31342358", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "I’ma take you to the end, I’ma (Yeah, yeah) I take you to the end (Yeah, yeah, yeah) Push you to the edge (Uhh)", "vault_lines": ["I'ma take you to the end, I'ma (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "These lines convey a sense of determination to confront and challenge someone or something until reaching a definitive conclusion or outcome, even if it means pushing them to their limits or beyond.", "annotation_id": "31342353", "url": "https://genius.com/31342353", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "It’s all inside of my head But it’s all out of my control", "vault_lines": ["It's all inside of my head"], "meaning": "This line reflects a sense of internal power or agency over a situation, yet a recognition that ultimately, the outcome is beyond the speaker’s control.", "annotation_id": "31342333", "url": "https://genius.com/31342333", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "I realized it’s nine of ya And I realized that you couldn’t handle none of this shit So I’ma give you it anyway", "vault_lines": ["You a schizophrenic, I realized it's nine of ya"], "meaning": "These lines suggest a realization that there are multiple facets or personas within someone, and despite knowing they may struggle to cope with challenges, yeat intends to confront them with those challenges regardless.", "annotation_id": "31342326", "url": "https://genius.com/31342326", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "So I’ma take it to the end But I can’t be ya friend So I’ma show you the other way That’s the way of dead men", "vault_lines": ["I could take it away"], "meaning": "The lyrics express a decisive break from toxic relationships and a commitment to prioritize self-preservation over harmful connections.", "annotation_id": "31342318", "url": "https://genius.com/31342318", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "Gemstones like Tuesdays", "vault_lines": ["Are you in this shit for life? (All of ya)"], "meaning": "This suggest that something rare and precious is being compared to an ordinary day, highlighting the uniqueness of certain experiences or feelings.", "annotation_id": "31342302", "url": "https://genius.com/31342302", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "You know that feeling that you said you hate? Everything great, I push away", "vault_lines": ["You know that feeling that you said you hate?"], "meaning": "This suggest a pattern of self sabotage or pushing away positive experiences or relationships, even though they might bring happiness or fulfillment. Yeat acknowledges the existence of a feeling he dislike, which could be associated with vulnerability, intimacy or contentment.", "annotation_id": "31342279", "url": "https://genius.com/31342279", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "Are you in this shit for life? (All of ya) I’Il back-stab you with a fuckin’ knife (All of ya)", "vault_lines": ["Are you in this shit for life? (All of ya)"], "meaning": "Yeat is questioning the loyalty of someone or commitment to a situation or relationship. It implies a sense of betrayal or potential harm if the person’s loyalty is not genuine or long lasting.", "annotation_id": "31342253", "url": "https://genius.com/31342253", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "Don’t it just feel right? (And I realized) Don’t you just feel good? (All of ya)", "vault_lines": ["I realized it's nine of ya"], "meaning": "This may indicate a cynical or sarcastic tone, highlighting the irony or satisfaction yeat feels in potentially betraying someone who lacks loyalty.", "annotation_id": "31342242", "url": "https://genius.com/31342242", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
