{"type": "line", "artist": "Yeat", "song": "1093", "line": "You a schizophrenic, I realized it’s nine of ya", "vault_lines": ["You a schizophrenic, I realized it's nine of ya"], "meaning": "Schizophrenia is a mental disorder in which people interpret reality abnormally, which may result in hallucinations or delusions.\n\nThis means a schizophrenic may hallucinate a person in clones, or nine clones to be specific.\n\nIn this section he repeats the word ‘ya’ nine times.", "annotation_id": "30898413", "url": "https://genius.com/30898413", "state": "pending", "votes": 53, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
